_.setTranslation({" and ":" e "," and {0} ":" e {0} "," builder says the villagers could make steel, given the tools.":" construtora di que a veciñanza podería facer aceiro, se tivese as ferramentas.",", {0} ":", {0} ","...":"...","....":"....","\"a physician. she treated both sides and said so out loud.\"":"\"unha médica. tratou os dous bandos e dixoo en voz alta.\"","\"and then a door was opened. i was not there. i have had a great deal of time to be grateful that i was not there.\"":"\"e entón abriuse unha porta. eu non estaba alí. tiven moito tempo para agradecer non ter estado alí.\"","\"curse the profane for all time, and curse the exile for releasing them.\"":"\"maldito sexa o profano por sempre, e maldito sexa o exiliado por liberalo.\"","\"curse the profane, who was told what would happen and did it anyway.\"":"\"maldito sexa o profano, a quen lle dixeron o que ía pasar e aínda así o fixo.\"","\"curse the profane.\"":"\"maldito sexa o profano.\"","\"fell in the first bombardment, with the roof of his own house.\"":"\"caeu no primeiro bombardeo, co teito da súa propia casa.\"","\"forcing your will through violence? you have only proven why you deserve to be shunned.\"":"\"impor a túa vontade pola violencia? só demostraches por que mereces ser desterrada.\"","\"four years old. the sky came down.\"":"\"catro anos. o ceo caeu.\"","\"go home, commander.\"":"\"vai para a casa, comandante.\"","\"he stood at the profane's shoulder for nine years.\"":"\"estivo ao carón do profano durante nove anos.\"","\"i could never have done any of this without you. but you would never understand.\"":"\"nunca podería ter feito nada disto sen ti. pero ti nunca o entenderías.\"","\"i have made my peace with never leaving. i recommend it. it is the only thing out here that gets easier.\"":"\"fixen as paces con non marchar nunca. recoméndoo. é o único que aquí fóra se fai máis fácil.\"","\"i have made my peace with never leaving. you have not. that is the whole of the difference between us.\"":"\"fixen as paces con non marchar nunca. ti non. esa é toda a diferenza entre nós.\"","\"i told you i had made my peace with never leaving,\" he says. \"i would like to formally revise that.\"":"\"díxenche que fixera as paces con non marchar nunca,\" di el. \"gustaríame revisalo formalmente.\"","\"i was second. whatever he signed, i countersigned.\"":"\"eu era o segundo. todo o que el asinaba, eu contraasinábao.\"","\"keep it. you will not remember this and you will need something to be holding when you work it out again.\"":"\"gárdao. non lembrarás isto e vas necesitar algo que suxeitar cando o descubras de novo.\"","\"lost with all hands, orbital action.\"":"\"perdido con toda a tripulación, en acción orbital.\"","\"nothing.\"":"\"nada.\"","\"one of the many. there was not time to find out which.\"":"\"un máis entre moitos. non houbo tempo para saber cal.\"","\"one of the nine reported it. the profane had her executed inside the week.\"":"\"unha das nove denunciouno. o profano fíxoa executar antes de rematar a semana.\"","\"one weighed down with the weight of the stars in a prison without walls.\"":"\"un pesado co peso das estrelas nun cárcere sen muros.\"","\"perhaps judgement will not be everlasting.\"":"\"quizais o xuízo non sexa eterno.\"","\"she has been out here as long as i have and she did not have to be.\"":"\"leva aquí fóra tanto tempo coma min e non tiña por que.\"","\"she said in a room of nine people that the war should stop.\"":"\"dixo diante de nove persoas que a guerra debía rematar.\"","\"she went out when the call came. she believed it. that was the whole of her crime.\"":"\"saíu cando chegou a chamada. creu nela. ese foi todo o seu crime.\"","\"spend it on what will still be here after us.\"":"\"gástao no que aínda estará aquí despois de nós.\"","\"taken in the rising. curse the profane.\"":"\"levada no levantamento. maldito sexa o profano.\"","\"that is not a judgement.\"":"\"iso non é un xuízo.\"","\"that is the part i had to make peace with. not that it was cruel. that it stopped being about us a very long time ago and did not stop.\"":"\"esa é a parte coa que tiven que facer as paces. non que fose cruel. que deixou de tratarse de nós hai moitísimo tempo e non parou.\"","\"that is worse. i know it is worse. i countersigned all of it and it is worse for me too.\"":"\"iso é peor. sei que é peor. contraasineino todo e tamén é peor para min.\"","\"the convoys stopped coming. it took the settlement eleven weeks.\"":"\"os convois deixaron de chegar. ao asentamento levoulle once semanas.\"","\"the profane had that called treason. curse him.\"":"\"o profano chamoulle traizón a iso. maldito sexa.\"","\"the profane needed the lanes for something else. curse him for it.\"":"\"o profano necesitaba as rutas para outra cousa. maldito sexa por iso.\"","\"the watcher does not pass judgement.\"":"\"a vixiante non emite xuízos.\"","\"the watcher observes judgement.\"":"\"a vixiante observa o xuízo.\"","\"the watcher would not forbid someone from observing their own fate.\"":"\"a vixiante non lle prohibiría a ninguén observar o seu propio destino.\"","\"the wound is in his back. curse the profane, who could not even do that much to a man's face.\"":"\"a ferida está nas súas costas. maldito sexa o profano, que nin sequera foi capaz de facer iso á cara dun home.\"","\"there is a fire at home. it is still lit. that is all i have to offer and i am offering it.\"":"\"hai un lume na casa. aínda está aceso. iso é todo o que teño para ofrecer e ofrézoo.\"","\"there is nothing in there but pain. i am not going to pretend i can stop you.\"":"\"aí dentro non hai máis que dor. non vou finxir que podo deterte.\"","\"there is nothing left in you to lose. and some of what you have got left, you are holding shut on purpose. i can see you doing it.\"":"\"xa non che queda nada que perder. e algo do que che queda, estáslo a manter pechado a propósito. véxote facelo.\"","\"there was no end to them. the profane never intended one.\"":"\"non tiñan fin. o profano nunca pretendeu que a tivesen.\"","\"there was no warning given. the profane did not consider one necessary.\"":"\"non se deu ningún aviso. o profano non o considerou necesario.\"","\"THEY SHOWED ME A THING THAT CANNOT BE TRUE. I KNEW IT WAS TRUE THE MOMENT I SAW IT. I HAVE NOT BEEN ABLE TO PUT IT DOWN SINCE.\"":"\"MOSTRÁRONME ALGO QUE NON PODE SER VERDADE. SOUBEN QUE ERA VERDADE NO INSTANTE EN QUE O VIN. NON FUN QUEN DE DEIXALO DE LADO DESDE ENTÓN.\"","\"they were not told what they were firing on. curse the profane, who was.\"":"\"non lles dixeron sobre que estaban a disparar. maldito sexa o profano, que si o sabía.\"","\"to know someone is to love someone. you cannot help who you love.\"":"\"coñecer alguén é amalo. non se pode escoller a quen se ama.\"","\"twenty-one years in the wars. he was released twice and recalled twice.\"":"\"vinteún anos nas guerras. foi liberado dúas veces e chamado de volta dúas veces.\"","\"we did not arrive together and we will not leave together. the water is one water.\"":"\"non chegamos xuntas e non marcharemos xuntas. a auga é unha soa auga.\"","\"we did not think we were monsters. that is not a defence. it is just what was true.\"":"\"non pensabamos que éramos monstros. iso non é unha defensa. é só o que era certo.\"","\"we do not ask the watcher to change fate, merely to help us understand it.\"":"\"non lle pedimos á vixiante que cambie o destino, só que nos axude a entendelo.\"","\"we help those in need if we are able, but our path is to watch, not to intervene.\"":"\"axudamos a quen o precisa se podemos, pero o noso camiño é observar, non intervir.\"","\"we help those in need if we are able.\"":"\"axudamos a quen o precisa se podemos.\"","\"we perceive the penitent.\"":"\"percibimos a penitente.\"","\"we would be poor students of it if we did.\"":"\"seriamos malas discípulas diso se o fixésemos.\"","\"what is down there is not a secret. it is only difficult.\"":"\"o que hai aí abaixo non é un segredo. só é difícil.\"","\"you are holding its mark in your hand. that is where it ended up.\"":"\"tes a súa marca na man. aí é onde acabou.\"","\"you are who you always are. this is why you are shunned.\"":"\"es quen sempre foches. por iso te desterran.\"","\"you did not bring anybody either.\"":"\"ti tampouco trouxeches a ninguén.\"","\"you have the scar. you always have the scar.\"":"\"tes a cicatriz. sempre tes a cicatriz.\"","\"you may observe your fate.\"":"\"podes observar o teu destino.\"","\"you may rarely change it.\"":"\"raramente podes cambialo.\"","\"you never remember. i have stopped finding that surprising and i have not stopped minding it.\"":"\"nunca lembras. deixei de atopar iso sorprendente e non deixei de importarme.\"","{0} could help hunt, given the means":"{0} podería axudar a cazar, se tivese os medios","{0} of the three are dark now. what is left is still lit.":"{0} das tres están agora escuras. o que queda aínda está aceso.","{0} per {1}s":"{0} por {1}s","{0} traps contain {1} ":"{0} trampas conteñen {1} ","{0} uber traps contain {1} ":"{0} supertrampas conteñen {1} ","{0}:{1}":"{0}:{1}","*** EVENT ***":"*** EVENTO ***","\\u2C00 \\u2C01 \\u2C02 \\u2C03 \\u2C04 \\u2C05, the same glyphs cut into the ruins, going back to before the infinite expanse.":"\\u2C00 \\u2C01 \\u2C02 \\u2C03 \\u2C04 \\u2C05, os mesmos glifos gravados nas ruínas, procedentes de antes da extensión infinita.","1 medicine":"1 menciña","11B-X-1371":"11B-X-1371","11B-X-1371 is still and silent.":"11B-X-1371 está quieto e silandeiro.","3 medicine":"3 menciñas","300 wood, paid up front":"300 madeira, pagada por adiantado","500 wood, paid on completion":"500 madeira, pagada ao rematar","a bale goes over and is halfway to the treeline before anyone can get to it.":"un feixe cae e xa está a medio camiño da liña de árbores antes de que ninguén poida collelo.","a band of scavengers comes out of the treeline in loose order, and they are not here to talk.":"unha banda de saqueadores sae da liña de árbores en fileira solta, e non veñen para falar.","a bank of cells, most of them dead":"unha fileira de celas, a maioría delas mortas","a bank of recesses runs the length of the wall, each one holding a slotted cell.":"unha fileira de fornelas percorre todo o muro, cada unha delas cunha cela con rañura.","A Barren World":"Un Mundo Estéril","a battered highway sign stands guard at the entrance to this once-great city.":"un descachado sinal da autopista permanece en pé na entrada desta outrora gran cidade.","a battle was fought here, long ago.":"aquí houbo unha batalla, hai moito tempo.","A Beast Attack":"Un Ataque Bestial","a beast charges out of a ransacked classroom.":"unha besta carga desde unha aula saqueada.","a beast stands alone in an overgrown park.":"unha besta agarda soa nun parque frondoso.","a beast, wilder than imagining, erupts out of the foliage":"unha besta, inconcebiblemente salvaxe, xorde da follaxe","a beggar arrives":"chega un mendicante","a beggar arrives.":"chega un mendicante.","a bench, and a row of instruments still under power, all of them pointed at the same kind of measurement.":"un banco, e unha ringleira de instrumentos aínda acesos, todos apuntando ao mesmo tipo de medición.","a bench, wiped down. the tools on it are laid out in order of size.":"un banco, limpo. as ferramentas están dispostas por orde de tamaño.","a biohazard furnace, recently used":"un forno de risco biolóxico, usado recentemente","a bundle of sticks lies just beyond the threshold, wrapped in coarse furs.":"un feixe de carabullos aparece no limiar, envoltos en gordas pelaxes.","a bundle sits just outside, tied with a knot that took somebody a while.":"un feixe está xusto fóra, atado cun nó que lle levou tempo a alguén.","a buried water cache":"unha reserva de auga soterrada","a cabinet of logs, in more hands and more languages than one observatory should have needed.":"un armario de rexistros, en máis mans e máis linguas das que un observatorio debería necesitar.","a cacophony of decrepit machinery fills the room.":"unha cacofonía de maquinaria decrépita enche a sala.","A Cairn":"Un Monumento de Pedras","a cairn stands beside the track":"un monumento de pedras érguese ao carón do camiño","a camp that was finished with rather than abandoned":"un campamento que se deu por rematado, non abandonado","a camp, laid out properly, with a windbreak and a latrine trench and a fire ring used a great many times.":"un campamento, ben organizado, cun paravento e unha gabia de letrina e un círculo de lume usado moitas veces.","a camp, not long abandoned. the ash is grey through but the ground under it is still dry.":"un campamento, abandonado hai pouco. a cinsa está gris de todo pero o chan por baixo aínda está seco.","A Campsite":"Un Campamento","A Carrion Drone":"Un Dron Carroñeiro","a cartographer is making a register":"unha cartógrafa está a facer un rexistro","a cave lizard attacks":"un lagarto de cova ataca","a cell door, open, the inside as clean as the corridor.":"unha porta de cela, aberta, o interior tan limpo coma o corredor.","a cell, set into the wall of the assay hall, and much newer than the hall.":"unha cela, encaixada no muro da sala de ensaios, e moito máis nova ca ela.","A Chain-Gang Revenant":"Un Aparecido Encadeado","a chair bolted to the floor. the bolts are recent work.":"unha cadeira aparafusada ao chan. os parafusos son traballo recente.","A Chitinous Elk":"Un Alce Quitinoso","a chitinous elk charges with its thick armored hide.":"un alce quitinoso carga coa súa grosa pel blindada.","a chitinous elk walks into the middle of the settlement and does not stop walking.":"un alce quitinoso entra no medio do asentamento e non deixa de camiñar.","A Cold Camp":"Un Campamento Frío","a colossal shape emerges silently from the deep forest.":"unha forma colosal emerxe en silencio do bosque profundo.","A Column of Smoke":"Unha Columna de Fume","a column of smoke stands off to one side, too straight and too steady to be a fire.":"unha columna de fume xorde a un lado, demasiado recta e estable para ser un lume.","a column of smoke stands too straight to be a fire":"unha columna de fume está demasiado recta para ser un lume","a concerned face":"unha cara preocupada","a convoy lurches in, equal parts worry and hope.":"chega un convoi abaneando, metade angustia metade esperanza.","a corridor runs off at an angle that does not match the stair.":"un corredor esténdese nun ángulo que non coincide coa escaleira.","A Crashed Ship":"Unha Nave Estrelada","A Crowded Encampment":"Un Campamento Ateigado","a crudely made charm":"un cutre amuleto artesán","a crystal cut with four faces, in a socket at the apex where the walls meet.":"un cristal cortado con catro caras, nunha cavidade no vértice onde se xuntan os muros.","a crystal, cut as a cube, sitting in a socket that was made for it.":"un cristal, cortado en forma de cubo, colocado nunha cavidade feita para el.","a cube because a cube is what you build when a thing has to be the same from every side, and be seen to be.":"un cubo porque un cubo é o que constrúes cando algo ten que ser igual por todos os lados, e parecelo.","a cube. a tetrahedron. a sphere. all three older than the wanderers, and all three used since for something the wanderers needed.":"un cubo. un tetraedro. unha esfera. os tres máis vellos cós andarilos, e os tres usados desde entón para algo que os andarilos precisaban.","a curing fire, and racks enough for forty":"un lume de curado, e estantes abondos para corenta","a cut in the ground, forty feet of readable layers":"un corte no chan, corenta pés de capas lexibles","A Cyborg Bear":"Un Oso Cíborg","a cyborg bear comes through the fence without appearing to notice the fence.":"un oso cíborg atravesa o valado sen parecer decatarse do valado.","A Damp Cave":"Unha Cova Húmida","A Dark Room was written by Michael Townsend for Doublespeak Games in 2013. It is open-source.":"A Dark Room foi escrito por Michael Townsend para Doublespeak Games en 2013. É de código aberto.","A Darker Room":"Un Cuarto Máis Escuro","A Deserted Town":"Unha Cidade Desértica","a desperate weapon for desperate men.":"unha arma desesperada para homes desesperados.","A Destroyed Village":"Unha Vila Destruída","a destroyed village lies in the dust.":"unha vila destruída xace no pó.","a disc of the same stone the temple is cut from is put into your hand. it has the three eyes on one face and nothing on the other.":"un disco da mesma pedra da que está feito o templo póñeseche na man. ten os tres ollos nunha cara e nada na outra.","a door set into the ground, and no dust on the threshold":"unha porta encaixada no chan, e sen po no limiar","a door standing open in a wall with nothing on the other side of it.":"unha porta aberta nun muro sen nada ao outro lado.","a door with a window at standing height, and a bar across the outside.":"unha porta cunha xanela á altura dos ollos, e unha barra por fóra.","a dropped stone does not make a sound and does not come back up.":"unha pedra que se deixa caer non fai ruído e non volve subir.","A Dust Wretch":"Un Desgraciado do Po","A Dusty Path":"Un Camiño Vello","a dusty researcher clumsily hides in the shadows.":"unha investigadora empoeirada escóndese torpemente nas sombras.","a faint scent of smoke, and under it something organic.":"un leve recendo a fume, e por baixo del algo orgánico.","A Feral Terror":"Un Terror Salvaxe","a few belongings rest against the walls.":"quedan unhas poucas cousas contra as paredes.","a few dusty corpses can be seen further down, but this deck appears to have been spared most of the combat.":"vense algúns cadáveres empoeirados máis abaixo, pero esta cuberta parece librarse da maior parte do combate.","a few hundred paces along it the kneeling stops, all at once, in a clean line.":"uns centos de pasos máis adiante, os que están axeonllados detéñense, todos á vez, formando unha liña limpa.","a few items are scattered on the ground.":"hai algunhas cousas espalladas polo chan.","a few minutes at this distance is survivable. more is not.":"uns minutos a esta distancia son soportables. máis non.","a few of the racks are not empty.":"algúns dos estantes non están baleiros.","a few useful items can be scavenged.":"pódense atopar algúns obxectos útiles.","a fight, maybe.":"unha pelexa, se cadra.","a fire has started":"declarouse un incendio","a fire rampages through one of the huts, destroying it.":"o lume arrasa unha das cabanas, destruíndoa.","A Firelit Room":"Un Cuarto Alumeado","a fleet mark. the emblem of a society that is not there any more.":"unha marca de flota. o emblema dunha sociedade que xa non existe.","a floor drain, and a faint slope in the concrete leading to it.":"un desaugadoiro no chan, e unha lene pendente no formigón que leva ata el.","A Forgotten Battlefield":"Un Campo de Batalla Esquecido","a foundation trench at the edge of the village turns up a marker stone, set upright and deliberate.":"unha gabia de cimentación na beira da vila descobre unha pedra marcadora, colocada de pé e a propósito.","a frail man stands defiantly, blocking the path.":"un home delicado érguese desafiante, bloqueando o camiño.","a gallery of alcoves, each holding a shape that is almost a person and is not.":"unha galería de fornelas, cada unha cunha forma que case é unha persoa e non o é.","A Gaunt Human":"Un Humano Escuálido","a gaunt human approaches, a crazed look in his eye. there is blood upon their teeth.":"achégase un humano escuálido, cunha mirada tola nos ollos. ten sangue nos dentes.","a giant lizard shambles forward":"un lagarto xigante arrástre cara adiante","A Glass Wolf":"Un Lobo de Vidro","A Glassed Crater":"Un Cráter Vitrificado","a glyph lock bars the last door":"unha pechadura de glifos bloquea a última porta","a glyph lock, the same as the ruins":"unha pechadura de glifos, a mesma cás ruínas","a good deal of distance is covered by somebody who was not trying to cover it.":"percórrese unha boa distancia por alguén que non tentaba percorrela.","A Grafted Colossus":"Un Coloso Enxertado","a grave marker is found under the village":"atópase unha lápida baixo a vila","A Graveyard":"Un Cemiterio","a graveyard, built over older graveyards":"un cemiterio, construído sobre cemiterios máis antigos","a green cross barely visible behind grimy windows.":"vese unha cruz verde detrás das ventás mouras.","a grizzled soldier attacks, a trophy blade at his hip alongside the bayonet.":"un soldado curtido ataca, cunha folla de trofeo no cadril xunto á baioneta.","a gunshot rings through the trees.":"óense disparos entre as árbores.","a hall of racks, most of them empty, all of them the right shape to hold something that is gone.":"unha sala de estantes, a maioría baleiros, todos coa forma xusta para gardar algo que xa non está.","a hall, and in the middle of it, on a plinth, a bar of metal in a case that is still holding vacuum.":"unha sala, e no medio dela, sobre un pedestal, unha barra de metal nunha vitrina que aínda mantén o baleiro.","a handful of hypos. life in a vial.":"un puñado de xeringas. vida nun frasco.","a hatch you have never seen opens in the console housing.":"ábrese unha escotilla que nunca viras na carcasa da consola.","a haze falls over the village as the steelworks fires up":"unha néboa cae sobre a vila ao prenderse a siderurxia","a heavy armoured thing drags itself across the field.":"unha cousa pesada e blindada arrástrase polo campo.","a heavy stone, laid flat, the way you weight something you do not want disturbed.":"unha pedra pesada, deitada de plano, do xeito en que se lastra algo que non se quere que se mova.","a hold gives out at head height and the catch is made with one arm and a lot of luck.":"un apoio falla á altura da cabeza e o agarre faise cun brazo e moita sorte.","A Hollow Monk":"Un Monxe Oco","a huge arthropod lunges from the shadows, its mandibles thrashing.":"un enorme artrópodo abalánzase desde as sombras, coas mandíbulas a golpear.","A Huge Borehole":"Un Pozo Enorme","a huge hole is cut deep into the earth, evidence of the past harvest.":"un burato enorme fende a terra, proba de colleitas pasadas.","A Huge Lizard":"Un Lagarto Enorme","a huge lizard scrambles up out of the darkness of an old metro station.":"un lagarto enorme aparece na escuridade dunha antiga estación de metro.","a human is drawn in by the light and warmth of the fire. they look at you, point and call you wanderer.":"un humano achégase atraído pola luz e a calor do lume. mírache, sinálate e chámache andarilo.","a human soldier still fighting a war they have long lost.":"un soldado humano que aínda loita nunha guerra que xa perdeu hai tempo.","a hut comes down and goes back up in steel. it does not creak in the wind.":"unha cabana derrúbase e vólvese erguer en aceiro. non renxe co vento.","a jar of teeth and examination notes in weird glyphs.":"un frasco de dentes e notas de exame en glifos estraños.","a journal on the battlefield next to a dead wanderer speaks of a wanderer empire that stretches across the stars. they had unique powers.":"un diario no campo de batalla, xunto a un andarilo morto, fala dun imperio de andarilos que se estende polas estrelas. tiñan poderes únicos.","a junction where four corridors meet, and all four are the same corridor.":"un cruzamento onde catro corredores se xuntan, e os catro son o mesmo corredor.","a junction, and three ways off it, and each one ends in a shape you can see from here.":"un cruzamento, e tres camiños que parten del, e cada un remata nunha forma que se pode ver desde aquí.","a large beast charges out of the dark":"unha besta enorme carga desde a escuridade","a large bird nests at the top of the stairs.":"un paxaro grande aniña no alto da escaleira.","A Large City":"Unha Gran Cidade","a large creature attacks, claws freshly bloodied":"unha gran criatura ataca, cos dentes manchados de sangue fresco","a large creature lunges, muscles rippling in the torchlight":"unha gran criatura abalánzase, axitando os músculos cara á luz dos fachos.","A Large Encampment":"Un Gran Campamento","a large hatch grinds open, and the wind rushes in.":"unha gran escotilla ábrese renxendo, e o vento entra de golpe.","a large hatch opens into a wide corridor.":"unha gran escotilla ábrese cara a un corredor ancho.","a large man attacks, waving a bayonet.":"un home grande ataca, sacudindo unha baioneta.","a large shanty town sprawls across the streets.":"unha longa e triste cidade esténdese polas rúas.","A Large Village":"Unha Pequena Vila","a ledger of numbers, no names. the numbers run to five figures.":"un libro de números, sen nomes. os números chegan a cinco cifras.","a life brutally ended":"unha vida rematada brutalmente","a line of marked stones runs out towards the flats":"unha ringleira de pedras marcadas esténdese cara ás chairas","a line of snares runs across the slope, set by somebody who knew what they were doing.":"unha ringleira de lazos percorre a ladeira, colocados por alguén que sabía o que facía.","A Locked-Down Prison":"Un Cárcere Pechado a Cal e Canto","a log kept daily for eleven years":"un rexistro levado a diario durante once anos","a lone frog sits in the muck, silently.":"un sapo solitario senta na lama, sixilosamente.","A Lonely Hut":"Unha Cabana Solitaria","a long room, entirely empty, with a single chair at the far end facing away.":"unha sala longa, completamente baleira, cunha única cadeira ao fondo, mirando para o outro lado.","A madman":"Un tolo","a madman attacks, screeching.":"un home tolo ataca, berrando.","a maintenance panel is embedded in the wall next to a large sealed door.":"un panel de mantemento está incrustado no muro, xunto a unha gran porta selada.","a man charges down the hall, a rusty blade in his hand":"un home carga desde o recibidor, cunha folla enferruxada na man","A Man Going Out":"Un Home que Sae","a man hobbles up, coughing.":"aparece un home, tusindo.","a man joins the fight":"un home únese á contenda","a man stands over a dead wanderer. notices he's not alone.":"un home érguese xunta a un errante morto. decátase de que non está só.","A Man-Eater":"Un Comehomes","a mark goes on the underside of the stone, at the end of the list.":"faise unha marca na cara oculta da pedra, ao final da lista.","a masked soldier rounds the corner, gun drawn":"un soldado enmascarado dobra a esquina, coa pistola na man","A Mech Warrior":"Un Guerreiro Mecánico","a medical drone wheels out of control.":"un dron médico xira fóra de control.","a military perimeter is set up around the mine.":"hai un perímetro militar darredor da mina.","A Military Raid":"Unha Incursión Militar","a mobile defence platform trundles around the corner.":"unha plataforma de defensa móbil avanza pesadamente pola esquina.","A Modest Encampment":"Un Campamento Modesto","A Modest Village":"Unha Aldea Modesta","a monk inclines its head very slightly. that appears to be the entire ceremony.":"un monxe inclina lixeiramente a cabeza. parece ser toda a cerimonia.","a monk. three eyes, three ears, no mouth. it has been standing there long enough that it did not arrive.":"un monxe. tres ollos, tres orellas, sen boca. leva tanto tempo alí que non parece que chegase.","a morphing projection of this room and this planet.":"unha proxección cambiante desta sala e deste planeta.","A Murky Swamp":"Un Pantano Bretemoso","A Mutant":"Un Mutante","a mutated beast leaps from its cell.":"unha besta mutada salta desde a súa cela.","a mysterious wanderer arrives":"chega un errante misterioso","a name being struck out of something that was meant to be permanent.":"un nome sendo riscado de algo que se supoñía permanente.","a night is spent out here for nothing, and the cold gets into everything.":"pásase unha noite aquí fóra sen sentido ningún, e o frío métese en todo.","a nomad arrives, looking to trade":"chega un nómada, quere comerciar","a nomad shuffles into view, laden with makeshift bags bound with rough twine.":"aparece na vista un nómada, cargado con bolsas improvisadas atadas con cordas.","A Note on This Fork":"Unha Nota sobre Esta Bifurcación","a pack animal, alive, and carrying somebody else's work":"un animal de carga, vivo, e cargando co traballo doutra persoa","a pack animal, alive, standing in the open with nobody anywhere near it.":"un animal de carga, vivo, parado ao raso sen ninguén preto del.","A Pack of Beasts":"Unha Manda de Bestas","a pack of lizards rounds the corner.":"un grupo de lagartos rodea a esquina.","a pack of snarling beasts pours out of the trees.":"un grupo de bestas bramadoras xorde entre as árbores.","a pang":"unha punzada","a panicked scavenger bursts through the door, screaming.":"un preeiro aterrado xurde da porta, berrando.","a party comes up the path, carrying one of their own":"un grupo sobe polo camiño, cargando cun dos seus","a plague afflicts the village":"a praga aqueixa á vila","A Plague Doctor":"Un Médico da Peste","a plague doctor emerges from the shadows with an alien and confusing message.":"un médico da peste emerxe das sombras cunha mensaxe allea e confusa.","a plain marker, and somebody has kept the weeds off it.":"unha marca sinxela, e alguén mantivo as herbas afastadas dela.","a prisoner tried to repair this cell from the inside.":"un prisioneiro tentou reparar esta cela desde dentro.","a pristine medicine cabinet at the end of a hallway.":"un botiquín inmaculado ao final do corredor.","A Profane Cultist":"Un Culto do Profano","a proper military column. matched kit, a line that holds, somebody in it giving orders.":"unha columna militar como deus manda. equipamento parello, unha liña que aguanta, alguén nela dando ordes.","A Radiated Goat":"Unha Cabra Radiada","a radiated goat charges with its mutated antlers":"unha cabra radiada carga coas súas astas mutadas","a ragged stranger stumbles through the door and collapses in the corner":"unha estraña piollosa cruza a porta a duras penas e desmáisae na esquina","a random person runs out, swinging a spear around with drug-induced speed.":"unha persoa calquera sae correndo, brandindo unha lanza cunha velocidade inducida por drogas.","A Raucous Village":"Unha Vila Barullenta","A Ravaged Battleship":"Un Buque de Guerra Devastado","A Ravenous Beast":"Unha Besta Voraz","a ravenous beast leaps out of the underbrush. hunger has made it desperate and dangerous.":"unha besta voraz salta desde a maleza. a fame volveuna desesperada e perigosa.","a recently abandoned camp":"un campamento abandonado hai pouco","a record read out to a room that goes very quiet.":"un rexistro lido en voz alta a unha sala que queda en completo silencio.","a regenerative machine hums uncannily by one of the courses.":"unha máquina rexenerativa zoa de xeito inquietante xunto a un dos cursos.","a reservoir of something that is not water, lit from below, perfectly still.":"un depósito de algo que non é auga, iluminado desde abaixo, perfectamente quieto.","a room built to hold a crowd":"unha sala construída para acoller unha multitude","a room of columns, each one carrying a column of glyphs from floor to ceiling.":"unha sala de columnas, cada unha delas cunha columna de glifos do chan ao teito.","a room of eleven. a vote taken by people who all know each other. the word RECORD, and somebody saying that whatever else is lost, the record is not lost.":"unha sala de once persoas. unha votación entre xente que se coñece entre si. a palabra REXISTRO, e alguén dicindo que, pase o que pase, o rexistro non se perde.","a room of shallow basins set into the floor, each one holding a residue that has dried to powder.":"unha sala de bacías pouco profundas encaixadas no chan, cada unha cun residuo secado en po.","a room where the galaxy was once condemned and later an innocent was imprisoned.":"unha sala onde unha vez se condenou a galaxia e despois se encarcerou a un inocente.","a room with 11 chairs and a 12th empty spot.":"unha sala con 11 cadeiras e un 12º espazo baleiro.","a room with no fittings at all, and a drain in the middle of the floor.":"unha sala sen ningún mobiliario, e un desaugadoiro no medio do chan.","a round wing with no point. there is no point. nothing to gleam.":"unha ala redonda sen punta. non hai punta. nada que brille.","A Ruined City":"Unha Cidade en Ruínas","A Ruined Trap":"Unha Trampa Desfeita","A Rust Beetle":"Un Escaravello de Ferruxe","a sack of it is scraped off the barrel lids and taken inside.":"raspa un saco delo das tapas dos barrís e lévase para dentro.","a safe place in the wilds.":"un lugar seguro no salvaxe.","A Scavenger":"Un Preeiro","a scavenger draws close, hoping to add to their stores at the cost of your life.":"un saqueador achégase, esperando aumentar as súas reservas a costa da túa vida.","a scavenger waits just inside the door.":"un preeiro agarda tras da porta.","A Scout":"Un Explorador","a scout spots you. they could pass by. but why leave a witness who has seen them?":"un explorador albíscate. podería pasar de largo. pero por que deixar unha testemuña que os viu?","a scout stops for the night":"unha exploradora para para pasar a noite","a scrape in the lee of a rock, the pack pulled over, and eight hours of not moving.":"un burato ao abrigo dunha rocha, a mochila por diante, e oito horas sen moverse.","a sealed suit, and the pattern for another":"un traxe selado, e o patrón para outro","a second soldier joins the fight.":"un segundo soldado únese á contenda.","a second soldier opens fire.":"un segundo soldado abre fogo.","a second, larger lock":"unha segunda pechadura, máis grande","a secure locker is set into one wall.":"un armario de seguridade está encaixado nun muro.","a sentence read three times over so that nobody present can claim to have misheard it.":"unha sentenza lida tres veces para que ninguén dos presentes poida dicir que a escoitou mal.","a settlement where everything still works and nobody is left":"un asentamento onde todo aínda funciona e xa non queda ninguén","a settlement, intact, and running.":"un asentamento, intacto, e en funcionamento.","a shack stands at the center of the village.":"unha chabola levántase no centro da aldea.","a shady builder passes through":"pasa un construtor sospeitoso","a shaft drops away with no stair and no rail, and the far side is lit.":"un pozo cae sen escaleira nin varanda, e o lado oposto está iluminado.","a shame to let what he'd found go to waste.":"sería unha mágoa desaproveitar todo o que atopou.","a shape crosses the glass without leaving a mark on it.":"unha forma atravesa o vidro sen deixar marca nel.","a shape resolves out of the dark, already moving":"unha forma xorde da escuridade, xa en movemento","a shape steps out of the wall it was part of a moment ago.":"unha forma sae do muro do que formaba parte hai un instante.","a sharp blade can slay foes in the dangerous wilds. builder can make an iron sword but she knows this isn't for hunting animals.":"unha folla afiada pode matar inimigos nas perigosas terras salvaxes. a construtora pode facer unha espada de ferro pero sabe que non é para cazar animais.","a sharper blade for more deadly foes in the dangerous wilds. builder can make an steel sword but asks you not to fight.":"unha folla máis afiada para inimigos máis mortais nas perigosas terras salvaxes. a construtora pode facer unha espada de aceiro pero pídeche que non loites.","A Shivering Human":"Un Humano Tremendo","a shivering human moves desperately through the bracing cold winds. the biting pain has driven them mad. they attack with surprising strength.":"un humano tremendo móvese con desesperación entre ventos xeados. a dor cortante volveuno tolo. ataca cunha forza sorprendente.","a shot rings out, from somewhere in the long grass":"óese un disparo, desde algún lugar nos pastos altos","a sick man hobbles up":"chega un home enfermo","a sickness is spreading through the village.":"unha enfermidade espállase pola vila.","A Siege Automaton":"Un Autómata de Asedio","A Silent Forest":"Un Bosque Silencioso","A Silent Temple":"Un Templo Silandeiro","a slab by the well, and the same text on it four times, in four scripts, none of which share an alphabet.":"unha laxe xunto ao pozo, co mesmo texto catro veces, en catro escrituras, ningunha delas co mesmo alfabeto.","a small basket of food is hidden under a park bench, with a note attached.":"un pequeno cesto de comida agóchase baixo un banco do parco, cunha nota pegada.","a small cache of supplies is tucked inside a rusting locker.":"un pequeno alixo de provisións aparece nun armario enferruxado.","a small group arrives, all dust and bones.":"chega un pequeno grupo, todo pó e ósos.","a small knapsack hangs from a cluster of webs, a few feet from the floor.":"unha pequena mochila colga dun feixe de teas de araña, a uns pés do chan.","a small light against the overwhelming tide of darkness.":"unha pequena luz contra a marea esmagadora da escuridade.","a small number of them stand up, at the moment when standing up is the worst thing a person can do.":"uns poucos deles érguense, xusto no momento en que erguerse é o peor que se pode facer.","a small stone, and a short plot.":"unha pequena pedra, e unha parcela curta.","a small suburb lays ahead, empty houses scorched and peeling.":"un pequeno suburbio á vista, casa baleiras abrasadas e esborrallándose.","a small supply cache is hidden at the back of the cave.":"un pequeno alixo de provisións ocúltase no fondo da cova.","a smear on the curve at head height, polished by repetition.":"unha marca na curva á altura da cabeza, pulida a base de repetición.","a smooth, perfect sphere. its light is inextinguishable.":"unha esfera lisa e perfecta. a súa luz é inextinguible.","a snarling beast jumps out from behind a car.":"unha besta ruxidoira salta tras dun coche.","A Sniper":"Un Francotirador","A Soldier":"Un Soldado","a soldier, alerted, opens fire.":"un soldado, alertado, abre fogo.","a soldier, by the shape of the plot, though the stone does not say which side.":"un soldado, a xulgar pola forma da parcela, aínda que a pedra non di de que bando.","a sound comes from the tunnel, just ahead.":"chega un son do túnel, xusto diante.","a sparring automaton, still fully function and crusted with timeworn blood, lunges forward.":"un autómata de combate, aínda totalmente funcional e recuberto de sangue seco de vello, abalánzase cara a adiante.","a special meeting room abandoned.":"unha sala de reunións especial, abandonada.","a sphere because a sphere has no corner to stand in and no direction to face. whoever built this wing understood exactly what they were building.":"unha esfera porque unha esfera non ten esquina onde situarse nin dirección á que mirar. quen construíu esta ala entendía exactamente o que estaba a construír.","a split hull lies at the end of a long furrow":"un casco partido xace ao final dun longo sulco","A Spore-Choked Stag":"Un Cervo Afogado en Esporas","a squat building up ahead.":"un pequeno edificio máis adiante.","a squatter stands firmly in the doorway of a small hut.":"un ocupa mantense firme na entrada dunha pequena cabana.","a stair down, and at the bottom of it the air is dry enough to hurt.":"unha escaleira que baixa, e no fondo dela o aire está tan seco que doe.","a stairwell descends into ruins that are still powered":"unha escaleira baixa cara a unhas ruínas que aínda teñen enerxía","a stairwell, going down. the air below is colder again.":"unha escaleira, baixando. o aire de abaixo volve estar máis frío.","a startled beast defends its home":"unha besta desacougada","a stone is set upright at the end of the line, unmarked.":"unha pedra érguese de pé ao final da liña, sen marcar.","a stone monolith of what to dismantle and what to leave behind.":"un monólito de pedra sobre que desmontar e que deixar atrás.","a stone with no name on it at all, only a date and a single line.":"unha pedra sen nome ningún, só unha data e unha soa liña.","a storm of powdered glass comes off the flats":"unha tormenta de vidro en po chega desde as chairas","a storm stands still, with an edge to it":"unha tormenta permanece parada, cun límite marcado","a strange device sits on the floor. looks important.":"un dispositivo estraño repousa no chan. parece importante.","a strange thrumming, pounding and crashing. and then gone.":"un zoído estraño, golpes e estrondos. e logo, nada.","a strange thrumming, pounding and crashing. visions of people and places, of a huge machine and twisting curves.":"un zoído estraño, golpes e estrondos. visións de xente e lugares, dunha máquina enorme e curvas retortas.","a stranger arrives in the night":"chega un estraño na noite","a strip of meat goes on top, next to the cup.":"ponse unha tira de carne enriba, xunto á cunca.","a structure with no way into it":"unha estrutura sen ningunha entrada","a suit, sealed at every seam, and whoever was in it did not come out of the hole.":"un traxe, selado en cada costura, e quen o levaba posto non saíu do burato.","a swamp festers in the stagnant air.":"un pantano atufa o aire estanco.","a swarm of rats rushes up the tunnel.":"un enxame de ratas trepa polo túnel.","a temple, cut from a single piece of stone":"un templo, tallado nunha soa peza de pedra","a terrible plague is fast spreading through the village.":"unha terrible praga estase espallando moi rápido pola vila.","a tetrahedron because it is the only shape that cannot be made to wobble, and because they knew what they were sitting in the middle of.":"un tetraedro porque é a única forma que non se pode facer bambolear, e porque sabían no medio do que estaban sentados.","a thief is caught":"un ladrón prendido","a thin figure rises out of the dust. it has been here a long time.":"unha figura fina érguese do po. leva aquí moito tempo.","A Thornback Hare":"Unha Lebre de Lombo Espiñento","a thug is waiting on the other side of the wall.":"un rufián agarada no outro lado do muro.","a thug moves out of the shadows.":"un rufián sae das sombras.","A Tiny Encampment":"Un Campamento Minúsculo","A Tiny Village":"Unha Pequena Aldea","a torch to keep the dark away":"un facho para afastar a escuridade","a trading post would make commerce easier":"un mercado facilitaría o comercio","A Trench Sentry":"Un Centinela de Trincheira","a tribe of elderly squatters is camped out in this ward.":"unha tribu de ocupas anciáns acampou neste lugar.","A Two-Headed Creature":"Unha Criatura Bicéfala","a two-headed creature appears, the smaller head, poorly attached and trembling":"aparece unha criatura bicéfala, coa cabeza máis pequena mal suxeita e tremendo","a venomous beast bares its fangs.":"unha besta velenosa amosa os seus colmillos.","a vent, flush with the ground, wider than a person and going straight down.":"unha ventilación, a ras do chan, máis ancha ca unha persoa e que baixa recta.","a victim of radiation, experimentation and bloodlust lurches forward.":"unha vítima da radiación, a experimentación e a sede de sangue avanza tambaleándose.","a villager means to walk to the edge of the world":"un veciño pretende camiñar ata a fin do mundo","a voice calls a challenge in a language with no speakers left. then it fires.":"unha voz lanza un desafío nunha lingua sen falantes que queden. despois dispara.","a voice moving through a crowd without being spoken aloud.":"unha voz que se move entre a multitude sen ser pronunciada en voz alta.","a waist-high pile of stones stands beside the track, built carefully and not recently.":"un montón de pedras á altura da cintura érguese ao carón do camiño, construído con coidado e non recentemente.","a wall of gnarled trees rises from the dust. their branches twist into a skeletal canopy overhead.":"un muro de árbores retortas érguese no pó. as pólas revíranse nas copas esqueléticas.","a wanderer":"un andarilo","a wanderer arrives with an empty cart. says if he leaves with wood, he'll be back with more.":"chega un errante cunha carreta baleira. di que se marcha con madeira, volverá con máis.","a wanderer arrives with an empty cart. says if she leaves with furs, she'll be back with more.":"chega unha errante cunha carreta baleira. di que se marcha con peles, volverá con máis.","A Wanderer Lab":"Un Laboratorio de Andarilos","A Warden Echo":"Un Eco de Gardián","a weathered family takes up in one of the huts.":"unha familia de superviventes aséntase nunha das cabanas.","a week of trying gets a handful of grey nothing and a lot of wasted wood.":"unha semana de intentos dá un puñado de nada gris e moita madeira desperdiciada.","a while, she is told.":"un anaco, dinlle.","A Whirring Fabricator":"Un Fabricador Zoante","a white dome sits silent on the high ground, its shutter open to the empty sky.":"unha cúpula branca repousa en silencio en terreo alto, coa persiana aberta ao ceo baleiro.","a white dome, open to an empty sky":"unha cúpula branca, aberta a un ceo baleiro","a woman arrives with a satchel of paper and a brass instrument on a strap.":"chega unha muller cun morral de papel e un instrumento de latón nunha correa.","a work surface, and on it a log that has been kept by hand for a very long time.":"unha superficie de traballo, e nela un rexistro levado a man durante moitísimo tempo.","a youth lashes out with a tree branch.":"un mozo ataca cunha póla de árbore.","A&nbsp;Battlefield":"Un&nbsp;Campo de Batalla","A&nbsp;Borehole":"Un&nbsp;Pozo","A&nbsp;Crashed&nbsp;Starship":"Unha&nbsp;Nave Espacial&nbsp;Estrelada","A&nbsp;Crowded&nbsp;Graveyard":"Un&nbsp;Cemiterio&nbsp;Ateigado","A&nbsp;Damp&nbsp;Cave":"Unha&nbsp;Cova&nbsp;Húmida","A&nbsp;Destroyed&nbsp;Village":"Unha&nbsp;Aldea&nbsp;Destruída","A&nbsp;Glassed&nbsp;Crater":"Un&nbsp;Cráter&nbsp;Vitrificado","A&nbsp;Murky&nbsp;Swamp":"Un&nbsp;Pantano&nbsp;Bretemoso","A&nbsp;Ravaged&nbsp;Battleship":"Un&nbsp;Buque&nbsp;de&nbsp;Guerra&nbsp;Devastado","A&nbsp;Ruined&nbsp;City":"Unha&nbsp;Cidade&nbsp;en Ruinas","A&nbsp;Silent&nbsp;Temple":"Un&nbsp;Templo&nbsp;Silandeiro","A&nbsp;Wanderer&nbsp;Lab":"Un&nbsp;Laboratorio&nbsp;de&nbsp;Andarilos","above the door there is a figure worked into the rock: three eyes, three ears, and no mouth at all.":"enriba da porta hai unha figura labrada na rocha: tres ollos, tres orellas, e ningunha boca.","add a mark":"engadir unha marca","add a stone to the end":"engadir unha pedra ao final","aegis drone":"dron éxida","after a while he says the same thing he said before, in the same words, and you get the sense he would say it a hundred more times if you kept coming.":"ao cabo dun anaco di o mesmo que dixera antes, coas mesmas palabras, e dáche a impresión de que o diría cen veces máis se seguises vindo.","after a while it becomes obvious that it is not a storm that has stopped. it is a storm that has been left running.":"ao cabo dun anaco faise evidente que non é unha tormenta que parou. é unha tormenta que se deixou en marcha.","after a while nobody in the village hears it any more.":"ao cabo dun anaco xa ninguén na vila o escoita.","after a while the middle one says something to the other two and they leave.":"ao cabo dun anaco a do medio dilles algo ás outras dúas e márchanse.","agree":"aceptar","air whistles as the doors open. this section must have lower pressure than the rest of the ship.":"o aire asubía cando se abren as portas. esta sección debe ter menos presión có resto da nave.","alien alloy":"aliaxe alieníxena","alien bird":"ave allea","all":"todo","all four join the village":"os catro únense á vila","all four stay. the three who did the carrying never mention it again.":"os catro quedan. os tres que cargaron con el nunca máis o mencionan.","all he has are some scales.":"todo o que ten son escamas.","all of it stops at once.":"todo para de golpe.","all of it. the dog. it was the dog.":"todo iso. o can. era o can.","all the work of a previous generation is here.":"todo o traballo da anterior xeración está aquí.","all three are dark. and at the junction, in the floor, three recesses that were not there before -- or were, and you had no reason to look down.":"as tres están escuras. e no cruzamento, no chan, tres fornelas que non estaban alí antes -- ou si, e non tiñas motivo para mirar para abaixo.","all three of its eyes are open, and none of them are pointed at you.":"os seus tres ollos están abertos, e ningún deles apunta cara a ti.","always worked before, at least.":"antes sempre funcionaba, cando menos.","ambushed on the street.":"emboscada na rúa.","An Alien Bird":"Unha Ave Allea","an alien looking bird speeds across the plains, talons at the ready.":"unha ave de aspecto alieníxena voa veloz polas chairas, coas gadoupas listas.","an ancient beast has made these ruins its home.":"unha besta ancestral fixo destas ruínas o seu fogar.","an aqueduct comes down off the ridge in dressed stone, on piers, cut by hand. it feeds a condenser that is not stone and not hand-cut and is doing fusion, quietly, in a shed.":"un acueduto baixa da crista en pedra labrada, sobre piares, tallada a man. alimenta un condensador que non é de pedra nin está tallado a man e que fai fusión, en silencio, nun barracón.","an archive with incomprehensible records":"un arquivo con rexistros incomprensibles","an automated assembly line performs its empty routines, long since deprived of materials.":"unha liña de montaxe automatizada repite as súas rutinas baleiras, privada de materiais desde hai moito.","An Eldritch Horror":"Un Horror Arcano","an elegant instrument of death.":"un elegante instrumento de morte.","an entire pack of beasts emerge from the forest, hungry for flesh.":"unha manda enteira de bestas emerxe do bosque, famenta de carne.","an hour face-down with a pack over your head. the noise is the worst part and it is not close.":"unha hora boca abaixo coa mochila sobre a cabeza. o ruído é a peor parte e non está preto.","an hour is lost going the wrong way around a gully, and the water in the skin comes up solid.":"pérdese unha hora indo polo lado errado dunha barranca, e a auga do odre queda conxelada.","an hour of chipping fills a pocket. staying longer is not worth what it costs.":"unha hora esculpindo enche un peto. quedar máis tempo non compensa o que custa.","an hour of it. the pack is heavier coming out than going in and the weight is wrong.":"unha hora diso. a mochila pesa máis ao saír que ao entrar e o peso non cadra.","an hour of watching, and it does not move, and it does not weaken, and it does not vary.":"unha hora observando, e non se move, e non se debilita, e non varía.","an improvised shop is set up on the sidewalk.":"unha tenda improvisada levántase na beirarrúa.","an ingot of alien alloy":"un lingote de aliaxe allea","an ingot. a device that fits in one hand, with a worn recess for a thumb. and another of the colourless crystals, set apart from the rest.":"un lingote. un dispositivo que cabe nunha man, cun oco gastado para o polgar. e outro dos cristais incolores, separado do resto.","an office converted to a cell. but why?":"unha oficina convertida en cela. pero por que?","an old case is wedged behind a rock, covered in a thick layer of dust.":"unha caixa agochada detrás dunha pedra, cuberta dunha grosa capa de pó.","An Old House":"Unha Casa Vella","an old house remains here, once white siding yellowed and peeling.":"restos dunha casa vella, outrora branca, agora amarelada e desfeita.","an old human is telling tales. they say the world is this way because of the profane and the exile.":"un vello humano conta historias. di que o mundo é así por culpa do profano e do exiliado.","an old iron mine sits here, tools abandoned and left to rust.":"aquí hai unha antiga mina de ferro, as ferramentas quedaron abandonadas.","an old man bursts through a door, wielding a scalpel.":"un home maior emerxe dunha porta, brandindo un escalpelo.","An Old Observatory":"Un Vello Observatorio","an old receiver has started speaking":"un vello receptor comezou a falar","An Old Starship":"Unha Antiga Nave Espacial","an old wanderer arrives":"chega un vello errante","an old wanderer arrives.":"chega un vello errante.","an old woman, working a curing fire, with racks up and meat on all of them.":"unha muller vella, atendendo un lume de curado, con estantes montados e carne en todos eles.","an older villager waits until he is out of earshot, then says that is the fourth this year.":"un veciño maior espera a que estea fóra do alcance do oído, e despois di que ese é o cuarto este ano.","an operative waits in ambush around the corner.":"un axente agarda en emboscada tras a esquina.","An Outpost":"Unha Avanzada","An Overcrowded Ghetto":"Un Gueto Superpoboado","an overturned caravan is spread across the pockmarked street.":"unha caravana envorcada esténdese pola rúa picada.","an unfinished automaton whirs to life.":"un autómata inacabado cobra vida con zoído.","An&nbsp;Abandoned&nbsp;Town":"Unha&nbsp;Cidade&nbsp;Abandonada","An&nbsp;Old&nbsp;House":"Unha&nbsp;Casa&nbsp;Vella","An&nbsp;Old&nbsp;Observatory":"Un&nbsp;Vello&nbsp;Observatorio","An&nbsp;Outpost":"Unha&nbsp;Avanzada","ancient beast":"besta ancestral","ancient fury":"furia ancestral","ancient. simple. effective.":"ancestral. simple. eficaz.","and it comes back anyway, the way it has been coming back since you saw it:<br>the room, and the rows, and the lights going off past where you could see.":"e volve de todos os xeitos, do mesmo xeito que volve desde que o viches:<br>a sala, e as fileiras, e as luces apagándose máis alá de onde podías ver.","and on the bridge, at a station that had no reason to have anybody standing at it, somebody is standing at it.":"e na ponte, nunha estación que non tiña motivo para ter ninguén de pé, hai alguén de pé.","and something else, at the very edge of what the lens will resolve:":"e algo máis, xusto no límite do que a lente pode resolver:","and the one before that. and four further up.":"e o de antes dese. e catro máis arriba.","and the thing at the bottom of the pack is still there.":"e a cousa no fondo da mochila aínda está alí.","and then it is gone, and it was never yours, and you could not repeat a word of it.":"e logo desaparece, e nunca foi teu, e non poderías repetir nin unha palabra diso.","and then it is gone, and the crystal comes out of the socket easily, as though it had been waiting to be collected.":"e logo desaparece, e o cristal sae da cavidade con facilidade, coma se estivese esperando a que o recollesen.","and then it is gone, and you are holding four flat faces and you cannot say what you have just lost.":"e logo desaparece, e tes catro caras planas na man e non podes dicir que acabas de perder.","and then it is gone, and your hand closes on it, and you are shaking and cannot immediately say why.":"e logo desaparece, e a túa man péchase sobre el, e estás tremendo e non podes dicir por que de contado.","and then it opens anyway, because whatever is inside recognised you before the sensors did.":"e logo ábrese de todos os xeitos, porque o que hai dentro recoñeceute antes ca os sensores.","and then the row of you. the row of you goes on past where the lights end.":"e logo a fileira de vós. a fileira de vós continúa máis alá de onde rematan as luces.","and underneath: older stone. courses of it, and the mouths of vaults, and older markers again below those, going down further than the digging that put these here.":"e por baixo: pedra máis vella. fiadas dela, e as bocas das criptas, e marcas aínda máis vellas por baixo delas, baixando máis do que escavou quen puxo isto aquí.","and worked into the frame, so shallow you would only find it by running a hand over it:":"e labrado no marco, tan pouco fondo que só o atoparías pasando a man por riba:","and you understand, finally and completely, why you opened that door --<br>and that you would open it again, and that this is not remorse, and never was.":"e entendes, por fin e por completo, por que abriches aquela porta --<br>e que a volverías abrir, e que isto non é remorso, e nunca o foi.","android":"android","android.":"android.","another beast, drawn by the noise, leaps out of a copse of trees.":"outra besta, atraída polo ruído, salta desde un boscallo.","another cairn, and this one has been counted.":"outro monumento de pedras, e este xa se contou.","another cell comes off the line. the foundry crew do not look up.":"outra cela sae da liña. a cuadrilla da fundición non ergue a vista.","another checkpoint ahead, fitted with heavy doors.":"outro punto de control adiante, equipado con portas pesadas.","another door at the end of the hall, sealed from this side.":"outra porta ao final do corredor, selada desde este lado.","another stone, and another name":"outra pedra, e outro nome","answer it":"respóndeo","approach":"achegarse","approach the platform":"achegarse á plataforma","april fools.":"inocentada.","arc flash":"arco eléctrico","archon":"arconte","are you sure?":"estás seguro?","areas where there are no stars even though it hasn't been cloudy.":"zonas sen estrelas aínda que non estivo nubrado.","armature":"armadura","armour":"armadura","armour holds":"a armadura aguanta","armourer":"armeiro","armoury":"armaría","armoury's done, welcoming back the weapons of the past.":"a armaría está lista, benvidas as armas do pasado.","arms":"brazos","arms and munitions, relics from the war, are neatly arranged on the store-room floor.":"armas e municións, reliquias da guerra, están cuidadosamente dispostos no chan da tenda.","as soon as the door is open a little bit, hundreds of tentacles erupt.":"en canto a porta se abre un pouco, centos de tentáculos emerxen.","as the lights come online, so too do the defence systems.":"a medida que as luces se acenden, tamén o fan os sistemas de defensa.","ascendant":"ascendente","Ash Fall":"Caída de Cinsa","ask about her injury":"preguntar pola súa ferida","ask about the lab":"preguntar polo laboratorio","ask about the two who went":"preguntar polos dous que marcharon","ask about the watcher":"preguntar pola vixiante","ask for a blessing":"pedir unha bendición","ask for insight":"pedir claridade","ask how long they have been out":"preguntar canto tempo levan fóra","ask if anyone can read it":"preguntar se alguén o pode ler","ask them what year they think it is":"preguntarlles que ano pensan que é","ask them where home was":"preguntarlles onde estaba a súa casa","ask them who sent them":"preguntarlles quen os enviou","ask what is east":"preguntar que hai ao leste","ask what is on her mind.":"preguntar que ten en mente.","ask what they see":"preguntar que ven","ask who the oldest are":"preguntar quen son os máis vellos","ask who wrote the last one":"preguntar quen escribiu a última","asked about the vent, he responds that where it leads is classified and that you no longer have Fleet access.":"preguntado pola ventilación, responde que a onde leva é confidencial e que xa non tes acceso á Flota.","asked anything at all, he answers it the way a man answers a question he has answered several thousand times.":"sexa cal for a pregunta, respóndea do xeito en que un home responde unha pregunta que xa respondeu varios miles de veces.","asked how long ago they worked it out, one of them says it is not the kind of thing you work out once.":"preguntados hai canto o descubriron, un deles di que non é o tipo de cousa que se descobre unha soa vez.","asked how long he has been posted here, he says his relief is due, and does not say when it was due from.":"preguntado canto tempo leva destinado aquí, di que o seu relevo está a piques de chegar, e non di desde cando.","asked how they know, one of them looks at the lamp instead of answering.":"preguntados como o saben, un deles mira para o candil en vez de responder.","asked how they know, one of them says: because we were, and we did not either.":"preguntados como o saben, un deles di: porque nós tamén o eramos, e tampouco o soubemos.","asked what he is guarding, he responds that a good soldier follows orders without needing to know.":"preguntado que garda, responde que un bo soldado segue ordes sen necesidade de sabelo.","asked what he is guarding, he says that the wing is secure and the prisoner is held.":"preguntado que garda, di que a ala está asegurada e o prisioneiro retido.","asked where she learned it, she says it is what the ash is for.":"preguntada onde o aprendeu, di que para iso serve a cinsa.","asked who he reports to, he gives a rank and a designation and waits, briefly, as though expecting to be dismissed.":"preguntado a quen lle rende contas, dá un rango e unha designación e espera, brevemente, coma se agardase que o despedisen.","asked who is meant to give it, she turns her head very slightly further out, and does not answer, and goes back under.":"preguntada quen se supón que o debe dar, xira a cabeza lixeiramente máis cara a fóra, e non responde, e volve mergullarse.","asked why she will not name it, she says naming it has never once helped.":"preguntada por que non o quere nomear, di que nomealo nunca axudou nin unha soa vez.","asks for any spare furs to keep him warm at night.":"pide algunha pel de sobra para quentarse de noite.","asks what it is for. asks why you are putting a roof over people you have not met.":"pregunta para que é. pregunta por que lle das teito a xente que non coñeces.","assay warden":"gardián de ensaios","assembly arms spark and jitter.":"os brazos de montaxe faiscan e tremen.","assembly arms spin wildly out of control.":"os brazos de montaxe xiran descontrolados.","at first it just seems to be a still sky. there is nothing to see.":"ao principio parece só un ceo quieto. non hai nada que ver.","at the back of the workshop, elevator doors twitch and buzz.":"ao fondo do taller, as portas do ascensor tremen e zoan.","at the bottom of one there is a folded sheet with three names on it and a fourth crossed out.":"no fondo dunha hai unha folla dobrada con tres nomes e un cuarto riscado.","at the bottom someone has written: the barren world. it is the only entry not crossed out.":"no fondo alguén escribiu: o mundo estéril. é a única entrada non riscada.","at the bottom the ringing stops, and the silence is worse.":"no fondo o zunido detense, e o silencio é peor.","at the centre something is still standing upright, buried to the shoulder, and it did not go off.":"no centro algo aínda está de pé, soterrado ata o ombreiro, e non estalou.","at the end it gives the name of the officer expecting the reply.":"ao final dá o nome do oficial que agarda a resposta.","at the end it gives the name of the officer expecting the reply. it is giving its own name.":"ao final dá o nome do oficial que agarda a resposta. está a dar o seu propio nome.","at the far end there are two more banks, set apart, and far shorter.":"no extremo oposto hai dúas fileiras máis, separadas, e moito máis curtas.","at the lip the glass has gone frothy, full of bubbles, and things came to rest in the froth.":"no bordo o vidro volveuse espumoso, cheo de burbullas, e cousas quedaron atrapadas na escuma.","attack":"atacar","attendant":"asistente","attending":"atendendo","automated guardians still stalk the halls, unaware that their masters have long gone.":"gardiáns automatizados aínda percorren os corredores, ignorantes de que os seus amos marcharon hai tempo.","automated turret":"torreta automatizada","available":"dispoñibles","awake. head throbbing. vision blurry.":"esperto. cabeza latexando. visión borrosa.","back away from it":"afastarse del","back to the junction":"volver ao cruzamento","bad smelling sulphur":"xofre de mal cheiro","bait":"cebo","baited trap":"trampa con cebo","bar the door":"trancar a porta","barbarian":"bárbaro","barrel glows":"o cano brilla","battered technology from both sides lays dormant on the blasted landscape.":"tecnoloxía esnaquizada dos dous bandos repousa no terreo destruído.","bayonet":"baioneta","beaten to a pulp":"convertido en papa a golpes","become death, destroyer of worlds.":"convértete na morte, destrutora de mundos.","become the destroyer of worlds. use a nuke to kill the most deadly of foes. builder can channel wanderer technology to craft a handheld nuke.":"convértete na destrutora de mundos. usa unha bomba nuclear para matar aos inimigos máis mortais. a construtora pode canalizar tecnoloxía dos andarilos para fabricar unha bomba nuclear portátil.","bedrolls, torn and blackened, lay beneath a thin layer of dust.":"sacos de durmir, desfeitos e ennegrecidos, esténdense baixo unha fina capa de pó.","before, there was an end to each one, and a world at the end of it. after, there was only the next.":"antes, había un final para cada un, e un mundo ao final del. despois, só había o seguinte.","behind the barricade, a few weapons lay abandoned.":"detrás da barricada, algunhas armas xacen abandonadas.","behind the door, a deformed figure awakes and attacks.":"detrás da porta, unha figura deformada esperta e ataca.","behind the rack the wall carries a second grid, larger than the first, and lit a different colour.":"detrás do estante o muro leva unha segunda reixa, máis grande cá primeira, e iluminada dunha cor diferente.","behind you the doors close, and go on closing, past the point where a door would stop.":"detrás de ti as portas péchanse, e seguen pechándose, máis alá do punto onde unha porta debería parar.","bellowing":"bramando","beneath the wanderer's rags, clutched in one of its many hands, a glint of steel.":"baixo os farrapos do errante, aferrado a unhas das súas moitas mans, escintila o aceiro.","better avoid conflict in the wild":"evita mellor os conflictos no ermo","better to move without drawing attention.":"mellor moverse sen chamar a atención.","beyond the bulkhead is a small antechamber, seemingly untouched by scavengers.":"máis alá do mamparo hai unha pequena antesala, aparentemente intacta polos saqueadores.","bigfoot":"pé grande","Bigfoot":"Pé Grande","bird must have liked shiney things.":"ao páxaro debíanlle de gustar as cousas brillantes.","bits of meat":"cachos de carne","bits of them can be scavenged.":"pódense recuperar anacos deles.","black powder and bullets, like the old days.":"pólvora e balas, coma nos vellos tempos.","black rain, and it does not rain out here":"choiva negra, e aquí fóra non chove","blast":"abrasión","bleached bones are strewn about the entrance. many, deeply scored with jagged grooves.":"hai ósos abrancazados espallados pola entrada. moitos teñen fondas marcas de cortes irregulares.","blood red sky":"ceo vermello sangue","blow it down":"volalo pola aire","blueprints":"planos","bluesky":"ceo azul","bodies and supplies from both sides litter the ground.":"corpos e provisións dos dous bandos cubren o chan.","bodies litter the ground on either side.":"os corpos cobren o chan a ambos os lados.","bolas":"tirafonda","bone spear":"puñal de óso","both go out at the same instant.":"ambas apáganse no mesmo instante.","both groups are taken in":"ambos os grupos son acollidos","both groups are told there is no room.":"a ambos os grupos dilles que non hai sitio.","both groups are turned away":"ambos os grupos son rexeitados","both groups walked here. neither of them has aged a day more than the walk.":"ambos os grupos camiñaron ata aquí. ningún deles envelleceu nin un día máis do que levou a camiñada.","both hands":"as dúas mans","both walls go inert together.":"ambos os muros quedan inertes á vez.","boxer":"boxeador","bring in whoever is still out there":"traer a quen aínda quede aí fóra","bring the room with you.":"leva o cuarto contigo.","bring your friends.":"dillo aos teus amigos.","broken medic":"médico avariado","broken streetlights stand, rusting. light hasn't graced this place in a long time.":"quedan farolas estropeadas, oxidándose. hai moito que a luz non honra este lugar.","build":"construír","build the fire up":"avivar o lume","build:":"construír:","builder":"construtor","builder finishes the smokehouse. she looks hungry.":"a construtora remata o afumadoiro. semella famenta.","builder just shivers":"a construtora estemécese","builder knows the strange device when she sees it. takes it for herself real quick. doesn’t ask where it came from.":"a construtora recoñece o dispositivo estraño en canto o ve. quédase con el axiña. non pregunta de onde saíu.","builder points to the furs from the dead beasts. she says leather could be useful. says the villagers could make it.":"a construtora sinala as peles das bestas mortas. di que o coiro podería ser útil. di que a veciñanza podería facelo.","builder puts up a hut, out in the forest. says word will get around.":"a construtora levanta unha cabana, no bosque. di que se vai correr a voz.","builder says an armoury can produce bullets, but she doesn't intend to touch a gun ever again":"a construtora di que unha armaría pode producir balas, pero que ela non pensa volver tocar unha arma nunca máis","builder says leather could be useful. says the {0} could make it.":"a construtora di que o coiro podería ser útil. di que a {0} podería facelo.","builder says she can make a cart for carrying wood":"a construtora di que pode facer un carreta para cargar leña","builder says she can make traps to catch any creatures might still be alive out there":"a construtora di que pode facer trampas para cazar ás criaturas que poidan quedar vivas","builder says she could make finer things, if she had the tools":"a construtora di que podería facer cousas máis complexas, se tivese as ferramentas","builder says she has come up with a better trap design":"a construtora di que deu con un mellor deseño de trampa","builder says she has come up with a better trap design. wanderer ingenuity and steel versus the beasts of the wilds.":"a construtora di que deu con un mellor deseño de trampa. enxeño de andarilo e aceiro contra as bestas das terras salvaxes.","builder says the {0} could make steel, given the tools":"a construtora di que a {0} podería facer aceiro, se tivese as ferramentas","builder says the huts could be rebuilt in steel. says they would not burn.":"a construtora di que as cabanas poderían reconstruírse en aceiro. di que non arderían.","builder says the sulphur could be made to hold a charge, with the right furnace.":"a construtora di que o xofre podería facerse para almacenar carga, co forno axeitado.","builder says there are more wanderers. says they'll work, too.":"a construtora di que hai máis errantes. di que eles tamén han traballar.","builder says there are more wanderers. says they'll work, too. the fire will attract them, but they will need a place to stay.":"a construtora di que hai máis andarilos. di que eles tamén traballarán. o lume atraeraos, pero van necesitar un lugar onde quedar.","builder says to work smarter not harder. head still groggy but the fire needs more wood. having a cart means more time in the warm room and less time in the cold and dangerous woods.":"a construtora di que hai que traballar con máis intelixencia, non con máis esforzo. a cabeza aínda atordoada pero o lume precisa máis madeira. ter un carro significa máis tempo no cuarto quente e menos tempo no bosque frío e perigoso.","builder stokes the fire":"a construtora atiza o lume","builder's not sure he's to be trusted.":"a construtora non está segura de que sexa fiable.","builder's not sure she's to be trusted.":"a construtora non está segura de que sexa fiable.","builder`s gaze":"a mirada da construtora","bullets":"balas","bulwark":"baluarte","buried under them, wrapped and sealed, is water. a good deal of it.":"soterrada baixo elas, envolta e selada, hai auga. bastante dela.","burn a torch through the night":"queimar unha antorcha durante a noite","burn it":"queimalo","burn it unopened":"queimalo sen abrilo","burn the cards":"queimar as cartas","burn the infected huts":"queimar as cabanas infectadas","burn whatever burns":"queimar todo o que arda","burning":"está aceso","but in the morning everyone who woke up is still here.":"pero pola mañá todos os que espertaron seguen aquí.","but then noticing the nothing.":"pero logo decatándose do nada.","but there is a cache of medicine under the floorboards.":"pero hai un alixo de menciñas debaixo do chan.","butcher the dead":"esnaquizar os mortos","buy":"mercar","buy 15 teeth":"mercar 15 dentes","buy 25 scales":"mercar 25 escamas","buy bait":"mercar cebo","buy compass":"mercar compás","buy map":"mercar mapa","buy medicine":"mercar menciñas","buy scales":"mercar escamas","buy teeth":"mercar dentes","buy:":"mercar:","by grey light the ground has come up into low hills and the wind has something to break against.":"coa luz gris o terreo elévase en outeiros baixos e o vento xa ten algo contra o que romper.","by midday the ground is too hot to sit on and the air over it is not clear.":"ao mediodía o chan está demasiado quente para sentarse nel e o aire por riba non está limpo.","by morning the wounded raiders are not a problem any more":"pola mañá os asaltantes feridos xa non son un problema","by morning there are prints outside, deep ones, and they lead away.":"pola mañá hai pegadas fóra, profundas, e afástanse.","by the end of it you are not sweating any more, which is the part to worry about.":"ao final xa non estás a suar, que é a parte que debería preocuparte.","cameras everwhere. but who is watching if anyone?":"cámaras por todas partes. pero quen vixía, se é que alguén o fai?","camp fires burn by the entrance to the mine.":"hai lumeiradas acesas na entrada da mina.","can't read the words.":"non se poden ler as palabras.","can't see what's inside.":"non se ve o que hai dentro.","can't tell what left it here.":"imposible saber o que o trouxo aquí.","can't tell what they're up to.":"a saber o que son.","cancel":"cancelar","cargo drone":"dron de carga","carrion drone":"dron carroñeiro","carrying more means longer expeditions to the wilds":"poder cargar máis significa excursións máis longas ao salvaxe","cart":"carreta","cask":"barril","castoff from the mammoth drills can still be found by the edges of the precipice.":"aínda se ven os restos das brocas xigantes desde o borde do precipicio.","celebrant":"celebrante","cell foundry":"fundición de celas","chain-gang revenant":"aparecido encadeado","Changelog":"Rexistro de Cambios","changelog: This is a fork that both changes features, and the story from original game. Go support the original!":"rexistro de cambios: esta é unha bifurcación que cambia tanto as funcionalidades coma a historia do xogo orixinal. Apoia o orixinal!","charcutier":"chacineiro","charge disrupted":"carga interrompida","charging":"cargando","charm":"amuleto","charred bodies litter the ground.":"corpos calcinados cubren o chan.","check it out.":"botarlle unha ollada.","check traps":"comprobar trampas","check uber traps":"revisar as supertrampas","checking dropbox...":"comprobando dropbox...","chitinous elk":"alce quitinoso","choose a slot to load. this will replace your current game.":"escolle unha ranura para cargar. isto substituirá a túa partida actual.","choose a slot to save to. this will overwrite anything already there.":"escolle unha ranura na que gardar. isto sobrescribirá o que xa haxa alí.","chorus":"coro","chunks of coal":"anacos de carbón","classic.":"clásico.","clattering metal and old servos. something is coming...":"metal tinguindo e vellos servos. algo se achega...","clear it off the path":"apartalo do camiño","climb down":"baixar escalando","climb out":"saír escalando","climb out through the collapse":"saír escalando polo derrubamento","climb with everything":"escalar con todo","close":"pechar","close it and put it back":"pechalo e devolvelo ao seu sitio","close the trunk":"pechar o maleteiro","close up it is a vent in the ground, ringed in fused earth, breathing out steadily.":"de preto é unha ventilación no chan, rodeada de terra fundida, exhalando constantemente.","closing ranks":"pechando filas","cloth":"tea","clumsy machines, and easily avoided.":"máquinas torpes, e fáciles de evitar.","coal":"carbón","coal mine":"mina de carbón","coal miner":"mineiro de carbón","Coal&nbsp;Mine":"Mina de&nbsp;Carbón","coil":"bobina","cold":"frío","colder here. the filtration is louder.":"aquí fai máis frío. a filtración é máis ruidosa.","collect some of it":"recoller algo del","collected scraps spread across the floor like they fell from heaven.":"hai escombros e provisións espalladas polo chan como se caeran do ceo.","come out the far side":"saír polo outro lado","command deck":"cuberta de mando","Command Deck":"Cuberta de Mando","committed":"comprometido","compass":"compás","condensation on the pipes. it has been this cold for a very long time.":"condensación nas tubaxes. leva así de frío moitísimo tempo.","congregant":"feligrés","connect":"conectar","connect this game to your dropbox account?":"conectar esta partida coa túa conta de dropbox?","consider it":"consideralo","containment cells arranged at the back of the room, all open.":"celas de contención dispostas ao fondo da sala, todas abertas.","continue":"continuar","continue right":"continuar cara á dereita","convergence":"converxencia","convoy":"convoi","could not load from dropbox. your current game is unaffected.":"non se puido cargar desde dropbox. a túa partida actual non se viu afectada.","could not reach dropbox. check your connection and try again.":"non se puido contactar con dropbox. comproba a túa conexión e téntao de novo.","could not read that file.":"non se puido ler ese ficheiro.","could not save to dropbox. nothing was lost -- your local game is unaffected.":"non se puido gardar en dropbox. non se perdeu nada -- a túa partida local non se viu afectada.","could put the scrap to good use.":"podería darlle bo uso á chatarra.","count the scratches":"contar as marcas","count the uprights":"contar os montantes","counted against a pulse, it comes round every forty seconds, and it has not drifted once.":"contado contra un pulso, repítese cada corenta segundos, e non se desviou nin unha soa vez.","counting the layers is not possible. there are a lot of them.":"contar as capas non é posible. hai moitísimas.","cover the barrels":"cubrir os barrís","cover the supplies":"cubrir os subministros","craft":"fabricar","craft:":"confeccionar:","crawler":"reptador","creatures can be heard outside the room. builder says she can make traps to catch any creatures might still be alive out there.":"óense criaturas fóra da sala. a construtora di que pode facer trampas para capturar calquera criatura que aínda poida estar viva aí fóra.","crew cabins flank the hall, devoid of life.":"as cabinas da tripulación flanquean o corredor, sen sinal de vida.","cross the room":"atravesar a sala","crude attempts have been made to cut into the walls.":"fixéronse intentos torpes de cortar os muros.","crude but still deadly.":"tosco pero aínda así mortal.","cured meat":"carne curada","cut the pack loose and climb":"soltar a mochila e escalar","cyborg bear":"oso cíborg","damage":"dano","dangerous as it is, there is a world outside this room. nomads pass by from time to time. builder says a trading post would make commerce easier":"por perigoso que sexa, hai un mundo fóra desta sala. nómades pasan de cando en vez. a construtora di que un posto comercial facilitaría o comercio","dangerous to be this far from the village without proper protection":"é perigoso estar tan lonxe da vila sen a protección axeitada","darting between the trees in the dark, the shadow is barely seen. you hear it lunge as it is upon you.":"movéndose á présa entre as árbores na escuridade, a sombra apenas se ve. óela abalanzarse xusto cando xa está enriba de ti.","dead":"apagouse","deadly soldiers and raiders out in the wild. builder says she can make bullets though she hates guns":"soldados e asaltantes mortais aí fóra nas terras salvaxes. a construtora di que pode facer balas aínda que odia as armas","death finally came for them":"a morte por fin veu por eles","debris is stacked in the corridor, forming a low barricade.":"os escombros amoréanse no corredor, formando unha barricada baixa.","deep in the swamp is a moss-covered cabin.":"no medio do pantano hai unha cabana cuberta de mofo.","deeper into the ship, the darkness seems almost to writhe.":"canto máis fondo na nave, a escuridade parece case retorcerse.","defence turret":"torreta de defensa","descend":"descender","desert rat":"rata do deserto","destructive at a distance.":"destrutivo a distancia.","detonate":"detonar","detour through the officer's lounge.":"desvío pola sala de oficiais.","devotedly, she has given you everything. she asks for one thing back.<br>\"why did you do it?\"":"con devoción, deuche todo. pídeche unha soa cousa a cambio.<br>\"por que o fixeches?\"","dice":"dados","dig in and wait it out":"atrincheirarse e agardar","dig into the face":"escavar na parede","dig it out":"escavalo","dig it out anyway":"escavalo de todos os xeitos","disable audio":"desactivar o son","discharging":"descargando","disconnect":"desconectar","disintegrate":"desintegrar","dismantle it for scrap":"desmantelalo para chatarra","disposal. disposal. disposal. the entries run for pages, and the intervals between them are not regular either.":"eliminación. eliminación. eliminación. as entradas ocupan páxinas enteiras, e os intervalos entre elas tampouco son regulares.","disruptor":"disruptor","distress off.":"sinal de socorro apagado.","distress.":"socorro.","do not look over":"non mirar","do nothing":"non facer nada","do the work yourself for a few days":"facer o traballo ti mesma durante uns días","documents are scattered down the hall, most charred and curled.":"hai documentos espallados polo corredor, a maioría chamuscados e enroscados.","dodge attacks more effectively":"esquiva os ataques con máis eficiencia","doorkeeper":"porteiro","download as file":"descargar como ficheiro","drawing":"debuxando","drawing from the basin":"sacando da bacía","drawing power":"consumindo enerxía","drew some attention with all that noise.":"chamou algo a atención con tanto ruído.","drones go out. they go out on a schedule, and the schedule is not regular -- it is triggered.":"os drons saen. saen segundo un horario, e o horario non é regular -- actívase.","drop:":"deixar:","Dropbox":"Dropbox","drowned lumen":"lume afogado","dry brush and dead branches litter the forest floor +{0} wood":"maleza seca e pólas mortas cobren o chan do bosque +{0} madeira","dry, it is nothing. wet, it holds a shape and will not let go of it.":"seco, non é nada. mollado, mantén unha forma e non a solta.","dust wretch":"desgraciado do po","dying":"morrendo","each step into the bracing cold wilds is difficult, and yet somehow there is a calling impossibly far away from here. perhaps even to the stars.":"cada paso nas xélidas terras salvaxes é difícil, e aínda así hai unha chamada imposiblemente afastada de aquí. quizais mesmo ata as estrelas.","ears flooded with new sensations.":"orellas inundadas de novas sensacións.","easily avoided.":"fácil de evitar.","eat meat":"comer carne","eldritch horror":"horror arcano","elevator doors open to a blasted corridor. debris covers the floor, piled into makeshift defences.":"as portas do ascensor ábrense a un corredor devastado. os escombros cobren o chan, amoreados en defensas improvisadas.","elevator doors open to an empty corridor.":"as portas do ascensor ábrense a un corredor baleiro.","embark":"partir","emergency lighting flickers.":"a iluminación de emerxencia parpadea.","emits a soft red glow":"emite un tenue resplandor vermello","empty corridors.":"corredores baleiros.","empty skies":"ceos baleiros","empty the snares":"baleirar os lazos","enable audio":"activar o son","encampment":"campamento","energised":"enerxizado","energy blade":"folla enerxética","energy cell":"célula de enerxía","engage":"trabar","engineering":"enxeñaría","Engineering Wing":"Ala de Enxeñaría","enough is taken to matter and the rest goes back under, resealed, stones replaced.":"cóllese o abondo para que importe e o resto volve baixo terra, reselado, coas pedras repostas.","enough meat to no longer worry about starving. first bright light in these dark lands? should cure the meat, or it'll spoil. builder says she can fix something up.":"carne dabondo para deixar de preocuparse por morrer de fame. primeira luz brillante nestas terras escuras? habería que curar a carne, ou estragarase. a construtora di que pode amañar algo.","enter":"entrar","epidemic is eradicated eventually":"a epidemia acaba erradicándose","equally unnatural and deadly, the cyborg bear stands ready.":"igual de antinatural e mortal, o oso cíborg está listo.","escape...":"escapar...","escaped convict":"condenado fuxido","Escaped Convict":"Condenado Fuxido","escaped convicts, still in the remains of prison issue, and there are more of them than there should be.":"condenados fuxidos, aínda cos restos do uniforme carcerario, e hai máis deles dos que debería haber.","evasion":"evasión","evasive":"evasivo","even if they don't want to stay in the past":"aínda que non queiran quedar no pasado","every container is drained and the wrappings are left open to the air.":"cada recipiente está baleirado e os envoltorios quedan abertos ao aire.","every corner is the same corner. you have stopped trusting your count.":"cada esquina é a mesma esquina. deixaches de confiar na túa conta.","every entry is the same shape. dispatch. transit. RECOVERY OF SAMPLE. return. hold for assay.":"cada entrada ten a mesma forma. envío. tránsito. RECUPERACIÓN DE MOSTRA. devolución. retención para ensaio.","every hut is steel already.":"todas as cabanas xa son de aceiro.","every once in a while the builder looks up to the sky, as if to see something. she seems disappointed to find an empty sky.":"de cando en vez a construtora mira cara ao ceo, coma se buscase algo. parece decepcionada ao atopar un ceo baleiro.","every one of them faces the same direction. none of them is facing the village.":"todos eles miran cara á mesma dirección. ningún deles mira cara á vila.","every one of them is lined up on the same point, and the point is a long way further out than this.":"todos están aliñados co mesmo punto, e ese punto está moito máis alá de aquí.","every path impossibly seems to slope down and deeper.":"todos os camiños parecen imposiblemente baixar cada vez máis fondo.","every room of unerring consistency beyond what any machine can do.":"cada sala cunha consistencia infalible máis alá do que calquera máquina podería facer.","every single one of them is you.":"cada un deles es ti.","every surface is a triangle, and no two are the same triangle.":"cada superficie é un triángulo, e ningún deles é o mesmo triángulo.","every surface is the same material, and it is neither cold nor metal nor stone, and a blade will not mark it.":"cada superficie é do mesmo material, e non é frío nin metal nin pedra, e unha folla non a marca.","everybody who has sheltered under this rock has counted something, and nobody has written down what.":"todo o que se refuxiou baixo esta rocha contou algo, e ninguén escribiu o que.","everybody who has used this has signed it. none of the hands are the same, and none of them are recent.":"todo o que usou isto asinouno. ningunha das letras é igual, e ningunha delas é recente.","everybody who went to sleep wakes up.":"todos os que se durmiron espertan.","everyone seems lost here, cold, hungry and alone. at least you can return to your fire. no one deserves to live like this.":"todos parecen perdidos aquí, con frío, fame e sos. polo menos podes volver ao teu lume. ninguén merece vivir así.","everything else in the village is grey by the second morning, including everyone in it.":"todo o demais na vila está gris para a segunda mañá, incluído todo o mundo nela.","everything in this wall was somebody's present tense. none of them were the same century.":"todo neste muro foi o presente de alguén. ningún deles do mesmo século.","everything that burns goes into the fires, including two of the hut frames.":"todo o que arde vai ao lume, incluídas dúas das estruturas das cabanas.","execute them":"executalos","exile":"exiliado","exiled":"exiliado","Exosphere":"Exosfera","expanded story. alternate ending. behind the scenes commentary. get the app.":"historia expandida. final alternativo. comentarios behind the scenes. faite coa app.","expeditions require gear. builder can stitch leather together into a rucksack.":"as expedicións requiren equipamento. a construtora pode coser coiro para facer unha mochila.","experimental plans cover one wall, held by an unseen force.":"planos experimentais cobren un muro, suxeitos por unha forza invisible.","explore":"explorar","export":"exportar","Export / Import":"Exportar / Importar","export or import save data, for backing up":"exporta ou importa os datos gardados para ter copias de seguridade","export or import your save via dropbox.":"exporta ou importa a túa partida gardada mediante dropbox.","extinguish":"extinguir","extremely powerful handheld bomb that instantly destroys an enemy.":"bomba portátil extremadamente potente que destrúe un inimigo ao instante.","eye for an eye seems fair.":"ollo por ollo parece xusto.","fabricate:":"fabricar:","Fabricator":"Fabricador","facebook":"facebook","faces, darkened by soot and blood, stare out from crooked huts.":"caras, escurecidas pola feluxe e o sangue, axexan desde as cabanas quebradas.","facing {0}":"enfrontando a {0}","feed her before she goes":"daslle de comer antes de que se vaia","feral howls echo out of the darkness.":"ouveos salvaxes resoan na escuridade.","feral terror":"terror salvaxe","field collapses":"o campo colapsa","field up":"campo activo","fight":"loitar","fighting hadn't reached here, it seems.":"parece que a loita non chegou ata aquí.","filthy bite":"mordedura mugrenta","find where it is coming from":"atopar de onde vén","Fire":"Lume","fire in this room attracted others in need. but fire can also keep the darkness at bay in the wilds. build suggests crafting torches.":"o lume nesta sala atraeu a outros necesitados. pero o lume tamén pode manter a escuridade a raia nas terras salvaxes. a construtora suxire fabricar antorchas.","fired, it comes out closer to metal than to pottery, and lighter than either.":"cocido, sae máis parecido ao metal ca á cerámica, e máis lixeiro cós dous.","fired, it cracks. wet, it sags. left alone, it goes back to dust.":"cocido, racha. mollado, afunde. deixado en paz, volve ao po.","fires burn in the courtyard beyond.":"hai lumes ardendo no patio traseiro.","flanking pair":"parella de flanqueo","flare":"bengala","flickering":"chispea","flint to iron is four inches. iron to rolled plate is three.":"de pedra de lume a ferro hai catro polgadas. de ferro a chapa laminada hai tres.","flung dust":"po lanzado","folded cloth. a ration tin with no markings left on it. a bundle of flat grey cards.":"pano dobrado. unha lata de racións sen ningunha marca. un feixe de cartas planas grises.","folding":"dobrando","follow it":"seguilo","follow it out":"seguilo ata a saída","follow the one who left":"seguir ao que marchou","follow the shaft":"seguir o pozo","follow the shaft instead":"seguir o pozo no seu lugar","follow the track":"seguir a pista","for a while people watch the flats in the evening. then they stop.":"durante un tempo a xente observa as chairas pola tardiña. logo paran.","force":"forza","force locker":"forzar o armario","forest":"bosque","found some medical supplies in a discarded bag.":"atopáronse subministros médicos nunha bolsa abandonada.","four bedrolls. three packs. the fourth pack is gone and so is whoever carried it.":"catro sacos de durmir. tres mochilas. a cuarta mochila desapareceu e tamén quen a levaba.","four come up the path from the wrong direction, walking slowly.":"catro suben polo camiño desde a dirección equivocada, camiñando lentamente.","four faces, four legs into bedrock, and a table with places for eleven.":"catro caras, catro patas cravadas na rocha nai, e unha mesa con sitio para once.","four hands have counted under this rock":"catro mans contaron baixo esta rocha","four hours in it. the water goes faster than it should and then it is gone.":"catro horas nela. a auga vaise máis rápido do que debería e logo desaparece.","four hundred attempts, all of them turned back":"catrocentos intentos, todos eles rexeitados","four hundred centuries ago somebody sat in a shielded room, holding this, waiting for you to come and ask.":"hai catrocentos séculos alguén se sentou nunha sala blindada, suxeitando isto, agardando a que viñeses preguntar.","four scripts, one agreement":"catro escrituras, un acordo","free {0}/{1}":"libre {0}/{1}","free the live one and reset the line":"liberar o vivo e reiniciar a liña","freezing":"conxelado","frenzied":"enfurecido","frigid":"xélido","fur":"pel","furious":"furioso","further along the wall there is a furnace, rated for biohazard, and it is the only thing down here that looks used.":"máis adiante no muro hai un forno, homologado para risco biolóxico, e é o único aquí abaixo que parece usado.","further along, the corridor branches.":"máis adiante, o corredor bifúrcase.","gastronome":"gastrónomo","gather goods":"recoller bens","gather wood":"recoller leña","gatherer":"leñador","gaunt human":"humano escuálido","get away from it":"afastarse del","get back to it":"volver a el","get clear":"apartarse","get down and wait it out":"agacharse e agardar","get out":"saír","Get the App":"Descarga a App","get the app.":"consegue a aplicación.","get up":"erguerse","getting a piece free takes the rest of the day. the walk back out is worse than the walk in.":"liberar unha peza leva o resto do día. a camiñada de volta é peor cá de ida.","getting free of him costs skin.":"librarse del custa pel.","getting out is going to cost something. the only question is what.":"saír vai custar algo. a única pregunta é o que.","github.":"github.","give 1 medicine":"darlle 1 menciña","give 100":"darlle 100","give 250":"dar 250","give 50":"darlle 50","give 500":"darlle 500","give her a name for it":"darlle un nome para iso","give him what he needs":"darlle o que precisa","give in":"ceder","give it a wide berth":"darlle unha boa marxe","give them something and hope":"darlles algo e agardar","give them supplies and send them on":"darlles subministros e mandalos seguir","glass wolf":"lobo de vidro","glass wolves come down off the ridge, four of them, moving the way water moves.":"lobos de vidro baixan da crista, catro deles, movéndose como se move a auga.","glow stone":"pedra brillante","glyphs in every tongue: peace through equity. equity through consistency.":"glifos en todas as linguas: paz mediante a equidade. equidade mediante a consistencia.","go and look":"ir mirar","go around instead":"rodear en vez diso","go around it":"rodealo","go around the edge":"rodear o bordo","go around them":"rodealos","go back":"volver atrás","go back and climb out":"volver atrás e saír escalando","go back in":"volver entrar","go back inside":"volver dentro","go back to the rack":"volver ao estante","go back to the road":"volver á estrada","go back up":"volver subir","go deeper":"ir máis fondo","go down":"baixar","go down to the core":"baixar ao núcleo","Go Hardcore?":"Activar o Modo Difícil?","go home":"ir á casa","go home with her":"ir para a casa con ela","Go Hyper?":"Cambiar a Hyper?","go in":"entrar","go in after all":"entrar despois de todo","go inside":"ir dentro","go inside it":"entrar nel","go on":"seguir","go on in the dark":"seguir na escuridade","go past it":"pasar de largo","go the other way":"ir polo outro camiño","go through":"atravesar","go through it":"atravesalo","go through the doorway":"atravesar o van da porta","go through the packs":"rexistrar as mochilas","go through what is left of the frames":"rexistrar o que queda das estruturas","go to the door":"ir cara á porta","go to the door anyway":"ir cara á porta de todos os xeitos","go to them":"ir con eles","go twice as far without drinking":"chega o dobre de lonxe sen beber","go twice as far without eating":"chega o dobre de lonxe sen comer","go your own way":"seguir o teu propio camiño","going in circles? that handprint looks like your own.":"dando voltas en círculo? esa pegada de man párecese á túa.","going over there is a detour, in the wrong direction, across the worst of it.":"ir para alá é un desvío, na dirección equivocada, polo peor da zona.","going through the doorway puts you further down than walking around it does.":"atravesar o van da porta déixate máis abaixo do que che deixaría rodealo.","good to rebuild":"bo para reconstruír","got it":"feito","grafted colossus":"coloso enxertado","grafting":"enxertando","graves. more of them than the ground should hold, set so close that walking the rows means walking on somebody.":"tumbas. máis das que o chan debería aturar, colocadas tan preto que camiñar polas ringleiras significa camiñar sobre alguén.","grenade":"granada","grey ash falls out of a clear sky":"cinsa gris cae dun ceo despexado","grey falls out of a clear sky for two days.":"gris cae dun ceo despexado durante dous días.","handheld nuke":"bomba nuclear portátil","handprints on the inside of the glass. six fingers, and some with five.":"pegadas de mans na parte interior do vidro. seis dedos, e algunhas con cinco.","hands. not yours. good at what they are doing and doing it fast, and there is a great deal to get through and not much time.":"mans. non as túas. boas no que fan e facéndoo rápido, e hai moito por facer e pouco tempo.","hang him":"colgalo","happy april fools. the door out of here still works and none of this happened.":"feliz día das inocentadas. a porta de saída aínda funciona e nada disto pasou.","hardcore.":"modo difícil.","hazard suit":"traxe de risco","he arrives at dusk, alone, in armour that was very good once and has not been repaired in living memory.":"chega ao serán, só, cunha armadura que unha vez foi moi boa e que non se reparou desde que alguén poida lembrar.","he arrives exactly at dusk, which he has clearly been doing for a very long time.":"chega xusto ao serán, algo que claramente leva facendo dende hai moitísimo tempo.","he arrives with a perfect uniform stride, stepping in his previous footprints.":"chega cun paso uniforme e perfecto, pisando sobre as súas propias pegadas anteriores.","he asks whether anyone came out here with you. he asks it the way you ask a question you already know the answer to.":"pregunta se alguén veu aquí fóra contigo. pregúntao do xeito en que se fai unha pregunta da que xa se sabe a resposta.","he begs for medicine.":"suplica menciñas.","he came back up the same path he left by, from the same direction.":"volveu polo mesmo camiño polo que marchara, desde a mesma dirección.","he comes back from the other direction":"volve desde a outra dirección","he comes back three days later with a sack, and leaves it at the door.":"volve tres días despois cun saco, e déixao na porta.","he comes back up the path from the opposite direction to the one he left in, and he will not talk about it.":"volve polo camiño desde a dirección oposta á que marchara, e non falará diso.","he comes out of the dark already walking the line, as though he had never stopped and simply became visible.":"sae da escuridade xa camiñando a liña, coma se nunca parase e simplemente se volvese visible.","he does not answer straight away, and when he does he is not warm about it.":"non responde de inmediato, e cando o fai non é con calor.","he does not come back":"non volve","he does not come back.":"non volve.","he does not explain that. he says you should ask her, and then says, immediately, that you should not, because she will not tell you either.":"non explica iso. di que debes preguntarllo a ela, e logo di, de inmediato, que non o fagas, porque ela tampouco cho vai dicir.","he does not fight, but the two who were walking a hundred paces behind him do.":"el non loita, pero os dous que camiñaban cen pasos por detrás si.","he does not fight. he watches, while the bags are cut from his shoulders.":"non loita. observa, mentres lle cortan as bolsas dos ombreiros.","he does not look at the third charm. he looks at you.":"non mira o terceiro amuleto. mírate a ti.","he does not say who. he leaves before first light.":"non di quen. márchase antes de que amenza.","he does not surface. shaking him does nothing and shouting does less.":"non sae á superficie. sacudilo non fai nada e berrarlle fai menos aínda.","he does not take the charm this time. he closes your hand around it.":"esta vez non colle o amuleto. pecha a túa man arredor del.","he eats like he has not in days. leaves a token behind.":"come coma se non o fixese en días. deixa unha lembranza.","he gives back what is left of the food. it is most of it. he says he stopped being hungry somewhere out there.":"devolve o que queda da comida. é a maior parte dela. di que deixou de ter fame nalgún punto aí fóra.","he had nothing to give":"non tiña nada que dar","he has been walking a long time. he has not once mentioned that anything is still calling him.":"leva moito tempo camiñando. nin unha soa vez mencionou que algo aínda o chame.","he is gone eleven days.":"está fóra once días.","he is not raving. he has clearly thought about this a great deal.":"non delira. claramente pensou moito niso.","he is put on the store room door instead of behind it.":"póñeno na porta do almacén no canto de detrás dela.","he is slower than he looks right up until he is not.":"é máis lento do que parece ata que deixa de selo.","he is talked down":"convéncese de baixar","he is talked down at the bottom of the path and goes back to his hut.":"convéncese de baixar ao final do camiño e volve á súa cabana.","he is visible for most of the morning, getting smaller, and then he is not.":"é visible durante case toda a mañá, facéndose máis pequeno, e logo xa non o é.","he knows this route better than anyone here. he will not be walking it again.":"coñece esta ruta mellor ca ninguén aquí. non a volverá camiñar.","he leaves a reward.":"deixa unha recompensa.","he lets go. says he has done this before, with you, more times than he intends to say out loud.":"sóltao. di que xa fixo isto antes, contigo, máis veces das que pretende dicir en voz alta.","he looks at you a while. does not finish the meal. says some debts are not the kind that get paid.":"mírate un anaco. non remata a comida. di que hai débedas que non son do tipo que se paga.","he looks at you a while. says nothing about what he sees.":"mírate un anaco. non di nada sobre o que ve.","he looks at you a while. says whatever you are carrying, you have been setting it down.":"mírate un anaco. di que sexa o que sexa o que cargas, o levas deixando aos poucos.","he looks at you a while. says you are carrying something you have not put down.":"mírate un anaco. di que cargas con algo que non deixaches.","he looks at you a while. says you are lighter than when you got here.":"mírate un anaco. di que estás máis lixeira ca cando chegaches.","he never says thank you. he does not need to.":"nunca dá as grazas. non lle fai falta.","he puts the cup down and looks at you properly for the first time all evening.":"deixa a cunca e mírate como é debido por primeira vez en toda a tardiña.","he says he has not seen one of these in a long time. that it is a fleet mark, and that there was a fleet.":"di que non vía un destes desde hai moito. que é unha marca de flota, e que houbo unha flota.","he says nothing for a while, and then says he will give you something more useful than a technique.":"non di nada durante un anaco, e logo di que che vai dar algo máis útil ca unha técnica.","he says one sentence in a language nobody here speaks, and then does not say anything else.":"di unha frase nunha lingua que ninguén aquí fala, e logo non di nada máis.","he says the dying is not even between us.":"di que o morrer non está sequera parello entre nós.","he says the trick is not surviving out here. anyone can do that for a while.":"di que o truco non é sobrevivir aquí fóra. calquera pode facelo un tempo.","he says the wars after that were not like the wars before.":"di que as guerras despois diso non foron coma as guerras de antes.","he says the watchers have a phrase about observing fate and rarely changing it, and that they are not wrong, and that they are not much help.":"di que os vixiantes teñen unha frase sobre observar o destino e raramente cambialo, e que non se equivocan, e que non axudan moito.","he says you were not a bad commander. says he has thought about it for what amounts to several lifetimes and keeps arriving at the same place.":"di que non foches unha mala comandante. di que o pensou durante o que equivale a varias vidas e sempre chega ao mesmo sitio.","he sets the bags down himself, before anybody asks him to, and steps back from them.":"el mesmo deixa as bolsas no chan, antes de que ninguén llo pida, e apártase delas.","he smiles warmly and asks for lodgings for the night.":"sorrí amablemente e pregunta por algún refuxio no que pasar a noite.","he speaks of once leading the great fleets to fresh worlds. unfathomable destruction to fuel wanderer hungers.":"fala de cando lideraba as grandes flotas cara a mundos novos. destrución insondable para alimentar as fames dos andarilos.","he stops fighting well before he stops moving":"deixa de loitar moito antes de deixar de moverse","he takes the charm and sets it with the others, and does not add anything.":"colle o amuleto e ponno cos outros, e non engade nada.","he takes the charm, and then he takes your wrist, and turns your hand over to look at the back of it.":"colle o amuleto, e logo colle o teu pulso, e volve a túa man para mirar o dorso dela.","he thinks about it for a long time before he says anything.":"pénsao durante moito tempo antes de dicir nada.","he walks back the way he came, with nothing.":"volve polo mesmo camiño polo que chegou, sen nada.","he walks out at first light with nothing at all.":"sae en canto amañece sen absolutamente nada.","he walks out with nothing":"sae sen nada","he walks the ring, checks the vent, and starts back. he does not acknowledge anyone.":"percorre o anel, revisa a ventilación, e comeza a volver. non recoñece a ninguén.","he weighs the second charm against the first, one in each hand, as though checking they match.":"sopesa o segundo amuleto contra o primeiro, un en cada man, coma se comprobase que coinciden.","he works the store room door for a week.":"traballa na porta do almacén durante unha semana.","help her sort it":"axudala a organizalo","her amulet":"o seu amuleto","Her Hands":"As Súas Mans","her meloncholy mood departs for a moment.":"o seu estado de ánimo melancólico esvaece por un intre.","her pack is beside her, still buckled. she was not out of supplies.":"a súa mochila está ao seu carón, aínda pechada. non se quedara sen subministros.","hinges rusted through. no challenge.":"gonzos completamente enferruxados. sen dificultade.","his time here, now, is his penance.":"o tempo aquí, agora, é a súa penitencia.","hollow monk":"monxe oco","hollow warden":"gardián oco","hot":"moi quente","housing open":"carcasa aberta","housing splits":"a carcasa parte","how deep do these tunnels go? why is it so cold?":"ata onde chegan estes túneles? por que fai tanto frío?","how did the watcher temple have a key to thos place?":"como tiña o templo da vixiante unha chave para este lugar?","hp":"ps","hp: {0}/{1}":"ps: {0}/{1}","hull re-forms":"o casco rexenérase","hull: ":"casco: ","hungry mouths crave meat. beasts attack wanderers in the wild. wanderers want to strike back. builder says villagers could help hunt, given the means with a hunting lodge.":"as bocas famentas ansían carne. as bestas atacan aos andarilos nas terras salvaxes. os andarilos queren contraatacar. a construtora di que a veciñanza podería axudar a cazar, se tivese os medios cunha casa de caza.","hunt the pack down":"cazar a manda","hunter":"cazador","hut":"cabana","hyper.":"hyper.","hypo":"xeringa","i armour":"armadura i","I do not claim this to be an extension of Townsend's intent. I intentionally tried to make this story its own.":"non pretendo que isto sexa unha extensión da intención de Townsend. tentei intencionadamente que esta historia fose propia.","ichor":"icor","if it is valid, this will replace your current game. that part is irreversible.":"se é válido, isto substituirá a túa partida actual. esa parte é irreversible.","if only they'd been destroyed along with everything else.":"ollalá tivesen sido destruídos xunto con todo o demais.","if the save is invalid, nothing will be changed.":"se a partida gardada non é válida, non se cambiará nada.","if you fell here, would anyone find you? was the pack worth it? it nearly cost you dearly.":"se caeses aquí, atoparíate alguén? mereceu a pena a mochila? case che custa caro.","ignore her":"ignorala","ignore it":"ignoralo","ignore them":"ignoralo","immortal wanderer":"andarilo inmortal","import":"importar","in a flash, the figure is standing.":"nun instante, a figura está de pé.","in exchange, the wanderer offers his wisdom.":"a cambio, o errante ofrece a súa sabedoría.","in its place there is a ration tin, full, and a card with nothing written on it at all.":"no seu lugar hai unha lata de racións, chea, e unha carta sen absolutamente nada escrito nela.","in the distance soldiers battle over wars long past, some with spears and some with guns. they are unable to let go.":"ao lonxe, soldados combaten en guerras xa moi pasadas, algúns con lanzas e algúns con armas de fogo. son incapaces de deixalo ir.","In the mean time this is what has changed: Ruins, Temple, Graveyard, Lab, Prison, easter eggs, 14 endings, mobile, Hardcore mode, uber traps, new perk, new weapons, new upgrades, expanded story, new enemies, April Fool's mode, key controls in combat, visual tweaks, bugfixes, and more to come!":"mentres tanto isto é o que cambiou: Ruínas, Templo, Cemiterio, Laboratorio, Cárcere, easter eggs, 14 finais, móbil, Modo Difícil, supertrampas, novo talento, novas armas, novas melloras, historia ampliada, novos inimigos, modo do Día das Inocentadas, controis de teclado no combate, retoques visuais, correccións de erros, e máis por vir!","in the middle there is a shape in the rock, machined, most of it still buried.":"no medio hai unha forma na rocha, mecanizada, a maior parte dela aínda soterrada.","in the spring nobody can quite agree on how many people were here before it.":"na primavera ninguén se pon de acordo sobre cantas persoas había aquí antes diso.","inside an hour the exposed skin on the packing crew has gone the colour of ash.":"antes dunha hora a pel exposta da cuadrilla de embalaxe tomou a cor da cinsa.","inside it there is no wind at all. the noise is entirely on the outside.":"dentro non hai vento ningún. o ruído está enteiramente fóra.","inside the hut, a child cries.":"dentro da cabana, chora un neno.","inside, the air is dry and tastes of pennies and the light does not behave.":"por dentro, o aire está seco e sabe a moedas e a luz non se comporta como debería.","inside, the remains of its victims are everywhere.":"dentro, hai restos das súas vítimas en todas partes.","inside, wheels and gears creak in the wind.":"por dentro, rodas e engrenaxes renxen co vento.","instruments for measuring how far something has drifted":"instrumentos para medir canto se desviou algo","investigate":"investigar","invisible death - radiation floods most of this level":"morte invisible - a radiación inunda a maior parte deste nivel","inviting. it would be so easy to give in, completely.":"convidador. sería tan doado ceder, por completo.","ios":"ios","iOS.":"iOS.","iron":"ferro","iron armour":"armadura de ferro","iron mine":"mina de ferro","iron miner":"mineiro de ferro","iron sword":"espada de ferro","iron's stronger than leather":"o ferro é más duro có coiro","Iron&nbsp;Mine":"Mina de&nbsp;Ferro","is escape possible? somehow the land becomes even more bleak and unforgiving moving further from the fire. is this place some sort of exile?":"é posible escapar? de algún xeito a terra vólvese aínda máis desolada e implacable ao afastarse do lume. é este lugar algún tipo de exilio?","is it really worth it?":"paga realmente a pena?","is something blocking some of the stars tonight?":"hai algo bloqueando algunhas estrelas esta noite?","it also did 9/11.":"tamén fixo o 11 de setembro.","it barks once, politely, and the drives come up.":"ladra unha vez, educadamente, e as unidades arrincan.","it comes apart in bright pieces.":"desfaise en anacos brillantes.","it comes apart into rack-shaped pieces.":"desfaise en anacos con forma de estante.","it comes around the curve and it was always going to":"chega pola curva e sempre ía facelo","it comes as far as the door":"chega ata a porta","it comes as far as the door and stays there long enough that you can hear it breathing through the wood.":"chega ata a porta e queda alí tempo dabondo para que a escoites respirar a través da madeira.","it comes off the flats with nothing in the way of it, and it does not gust. it just leans.":"chega desde as chairas sen nada polo medio, e non sopra en rachas. só se inclina.","it comes up out of the reservoir without disturbing the surface.":"sae do depósito sen alterar a superficie.","it contains travelling gear, and a few trinkets.":"contén o equipo de viaxe e algunhas cousas máis.","it costs most of a season of gathering.":"custa case unha tempada enteira de recolección.","it costs. the village is smaller and colder for a while.":"ten un custo. a vila queda máis pequena e máis fría durante un tempo.","it cuts the mortar rather than the other way round.":"corta a argamasa en vez de ao revés.","it discorporates without any sound at all.":"descorpórase sen ningún son.","it does not come free of the rack. what comes free is everything else.":"non se libera do estante. o que se libera é todo o demais.","it does not drift. the wind out here would take a fire apart in minutes and it does not touch this.":"non se desvía. o vento aquí fóra desfaría un lume en minutos e non toca isto.","it does not go out, because it was never lit. it simply stops.":"non se apaga, porque nunca estivo aceso. simplemente para.","it does not help him. it was never going to help him.":"non o axuda. nunca ía axudalo.","it does not raise its head. the wounds on its arms are old, and closing.":"non ergue a cabeza. as feridas dos seus brazos son vellas, e están pechando.","it does not react to anything.":"non reacciona a nada.","it does not resist. it does not appear to consider resisting.":"non se resiste. non parece considerar resistirse.","it does not say anything. it has never had anything to say anything with. but you understand, the way you understood the crystal, that what is being observed is not a judgement.<br>it is a redemption. and it is being witnessed, which is the only ceremony the watchers know how to hold.":"non di nada. nunca tivo nada con que dicir nada. pero entendes, do mesmo xeito que entendiches o cristal, que o que se observa non é un xuízo.<br>é unha redención. e está a ser testemuñado, que é a única cerimonia que os vixiantes saben celebrar.","it does not stop you looking. it does not appear to have considered stopping you.":"non che impide mirar. non parece ter considerado impedircho.","it does not taper. there is no run of illness, no bad winter, no slow decline.":"non se vai apagando. non hai unha racha de enfermidade, nin un mal inverno, nin un declive lento.","it does not try the door. it goes round, and round, and the sound of it does not change.":"non tenta a porta. dá voltas, e voltas, e o son que fai non cambia.","it does not want to be scrap. apparently it has a say in the matter.":"non quere ser chatarra. polo visto ten algo que dicir ao respecto.","it drags a length of chain behind it. the other end is still bolted to something.":"arrastra un tramo de cadea detrás. o outro extremo aínda está aparafusado a algo.","it drops fast once the light goes. walking at night out here has its own problems, but not this one.":"cae rápido en canto se vai a luz. camiñar de noite aquí fóra ten os seus propios problemas, pero non este.","it drops, and stops.":"cae, e para.","it faces the platform until it stops.":"mira cara á plataforma ata que para.","it falls, and the air goes clear again.":"cae, e o aire volve estar limpo.","it falls. the shackle stays closed.":"cae. o grillón permanece pechado.","it fills the corridor and then it does not.":"enche o corredor e logo deixa de facelo.","it flattens back out and stays flat.":"aplánase de novo e queda plano.","it folds back into the wall, and the wall does not close behind it.":"dóbrase de volta cara ao muro, e o muro non se pecha detrás.","it goes back to being the floor.":"volve ser o chan.","it goes back to the chair, and sits, and stops.":"volve á cadeira, séntase, e para.","it goes badly about two thirds of the way up, and the recovery is worse than the slip.":"vai mal a como dous terzos da subida, e a recuperación é peor cá escorregada.","it goes on for about a mile.":"continúa durante case unha milla.","it goes up easily. everything out here is dry.":"prende con facilidade. aquí fóra todo está seco.","it had friends.":"tiña amigos.","it has been empty a long time. the hull went on walking anyway.":"leva moito tempo baleiro. o casco seguiu camiñando de todos os xeitos.","it has been repeating the same eleven seconds since it was switched on.":"leva repetindo os mesmos once segundos desde que se acendeu.","it has the look of something venting rather than burning.":"ten o aspecto de algo que ventea en vez de arder.","it has the shape of a storm and the sound of one and it is standing exactly still, in a circle, with a clean edge to it.":"ten a forma dunha tormenta e o son dunha, e está completamente quieta, nun círculo, cun bordo limpo.","it has three eyes and no mouth, and the voice arrives anyway, from somewhere behind the ears.":"ten tres ollos e ningunha boca, e a voz chega igual, desde algún lugar detrás das orellas.","it hovers over the dead and recites a census that ended a long time ago.":"flota sobre os mortos e recita un censo que rematou hai moito tempo.","it is a count. and further back down the line, once you know to look, so are all the others.":"é un reconto. e máis atrás na liña, unha vez que sabes que buscar, tamén o son todos os demais.","it is a cycle. something is running a cycle out here, and has been, with nobody to run it for.":"é un ciclo. algo aquí fóra está a executar un ciclo, e leva facéndoo, sen ninguén para quen facelo.","it is a description of this room. somebody told them what it was like in here, and there is only one person who could have.":"é unha descrición desta sala. alguén lles dixo como era isto por dentro, e só hai unha persoa que puidese facelo.","it is a muster order. a fleet designation, a rally point, and a countdown that finished a long time ago.":"é unha orde de mobilización. unha designación de flota, un punto de reunión, e unha conta atrás que rematou hai moito tempo.","it is a single ingot, and it is far heavier than its size accounts for.":"é un único lingote, e é moito máis pesado do que o seu tamaño explicaría.","it is a voice from this room. it asked for lodgings, and ate at that table, and thanked everybody for the trouble.":"é unha voz desta sala. pediu aloxamento, e comeu nesa mesa, e deu as grazas a todos polas molestias.","it is already dying. it does not get up.":"xa está morrendo. non se ergue.","it is an agreement. who digs, who repairs, whose year it is when the years do not match.":"é un acordo. quen escava, quen repara, de quen é o ano cando os anos non coinciden.","it is bracingly cold. this place seems familiar. it is hard to think clearly with the cold.":"fai un frío que corta. este lugar parece familiar. é difícil pensar con claridade con este frío.","it is done against the wall of the store room.":"faise contra o muro do almacén.","it is easier with the pack on than without. the weight keeps you against the wall.":"é máis doado coa mochila posta ca sen ela. o peso mantente contra o muro.","it is far past wearing. the pattern is cut into the lining, whole, the way you write something down when you expect to have to make another.":"está moito máis que gastado. o patrón está cortado no forro, enteiro, do xeito en que se escribe algo cando se espera ter que facer outro.","it is going to be a long way to morning.":"aínda queda moito para que amenza.","it is gone the next morning, and the line is one stone longer than it was, and the new one has a mark on it.":"desaparece á mañá seguinte, e a liña ten unha pedra máis do que tiña, e a nova ten unha marca nela.","it is gone within the week. nobody sees it go.":"desaparece antes de que remate a semana. ninguén o ve marchar.","it is in the seat. not in a socket -- in the seat, where somebody sat holding it, waiting.":"está no asento. non nunha cavidade -- no asento, onde alguén se sentou a suxeitalo, agardando.","it is killed. it should not have been possible for it to get that close.":"mátase. non debería ter sido posible que chegase tan preto.","it is left where it lies. the traps can be rebuilt":"déixase onde xace. as trampas pódense reconstruír","it is light, and cold, and does not mark when it is struck.":"é lixeiro, e frío, e non se marca cando o golpean.","it is like being sanded. every exposed inch of you, for forty minutes, without pause.":"é coma se te lixasen. cada polgada exposta de ti, durante corenta minutos, sen pausa.","it is not a fight so much as a conclusion.":"non é tanto unha loita coma unha conclusión.","it is not a memory. the others were memories.<br>this is a thing somebody made, deliberately, to be handed to one person.":"non é un recordo. os outros eran recordos.<br>isto é algo que alguén fixo, a propósito, para lle ser entregado a unha soa persoa.","it is not a name anybody here can pronounce, and it belongs to a man who slept in this room and would not give it.":"non é un nome que ninguén aquí poida pronunciar, e pertence a un home que durmiu nesta sala e non o quixo dar.","it is not a name. it is a rank, a fleet number, and a date of loss.":"non é un nome. é un rango, un número de flota, e unha data de perda.","it is not a storm that stopped. it is one left running":"non é unha tormenta que parou. é unha deixada en marcha","it is not a voice. it is a position, and a heading, and a supply manifest for a ship that is not coming.":"non é unha voz. é unha posición, e un rumbo, e un manifesto de subministros para unha nave que non vén.","it is not ash from anything burning. it has no smell, and it tastes faintly of metal, and it does not stop.":"non é cinsa de nada que arda. non ten cheiro, e sabe lixeiramente a metal, e non para.","it is not clear who it is for. it does not seem to matter.":"non está claro para quen é. non parece importar.","it is not cut to a shape. it is the wrong colour for a crystal and the wrong weight for its size, and it is not warm.":"non está tallado con forma ningunha. ten a cor equivocada para un cristal e o peso equivocado para o seu tamaño, e non está quente.","it is not locked. it has been carried a very long way, and repaired more than once, badly.":"non está pechado con chave. levouse moi lonxe, e reparouse máis dunha vez, mal.","it is not made of anything the village knows how to make.":"non está feito de nada que a vila saiba facer.","it is not warm. it is the difference between cold and the other thing.":"non está quente. é a diferenza entre o frío e a outra cousa.","it is one piece. no seams, no windows, no join where a door would have to be.":"é unha soa peza. sen costuras, sen xanelas, sen unión onde debería haber unha porta.","it is shaped like a wanderer and it is moving wrong.":"ten a forma dun andarilo e móvese mal.","it is small, and it does not run.":"é pequeno, e non foxe.","it is smooth black glass all the way down, and it is not natural, and nothing has grown here since.":"é vidro negro liso ata o fondo, e non é natural, e nada medrou aquí desde entón.","it is still asking.":"aínda está a preguntar.","it is still carrying a full surveyor's kit, buckled properly, in good order.":"aínda carga cun equipo completo de topógrafo, ben pechado, en bo estado.","it is still running a headcount. it has not been told the prison fell.":"aínda está a facer un reconto. non lle dixeron que o cárcere caeu.","it is still standing there when the ridge finally hides it.":"aínda está de pé alí cando a crista por fin o esconde.","it is still transmitting. it has always been still transmitting.":"aínda está a transmitir. sempre estivo a transmitir.","it is still true. that is the part nobody ever believes and it has never once stopped being the part that matters.":"aínda é certo. esa é a parte que ninguén cre nunca e que nunca deixou de ser a parte que importa.","it is still visible most of the next day. it does not change at all.":"aínda é visible durante case todo o día seguinte. non cambia en absoluto.","it is the builder. she has walked out here, through all of it, on the leg that does not work properly, and she is not carrying anything.":"é a construtora. camiñou ata aquí, atravesando todo isto, coa perna que non lle funciona ben, e non carga con nada.","it is the only part of that hut that will still be standing in a hundred years.":"é a única parte desa cabana que aínda estará de pé daquí a cen anos.","it is the same mark, cut again and again, over old ones that have weathered almost flat.":"é a mesma marca, tallada unha e outra vez, sobre outras vellas que o tempo case borrou.","it is too late to console the dead. but we can assuage the living.":"é tarde de máis para consolar aos mortos. pero podemos aliviar aos vivos.","it is unpleasant and it works. the cold lifts on the fourth day, as unaccountably as it came.":"é desagradable e funciona. o frío levanta ao cuarto día, tan inexplicablemente como chegou.","it is very good stone. it is not from here.":"é moi boa pedra. non é de aquí.","it is very quiet, and the quiet has the shape of a held breath.":"está moi silandeiro, e o silencio ten a forma dun alento contido.","it is warm. it is the same warmth as the one in the ruins, and you already know what happens if you touch it, and you touch it.":"está quente. é a mesma calor cá das ruínas, e xa sabes o que pasa se o tocas, e tócao.","it is wearing a small headset. it has been wearing it the entire time.":"leva posto un pequeno auricular. levouno posto o tempo todo.","it is worth considerably more than the furs were.":"vale considerablemente máis do que valían as peles.","it is your hand. it is unmistakably your hand.":"é a túa man. é inequivocamente a túa man.","it is your handwriting. the ink is older than this settlement.":"é a túa letra. a tinta é máis vella ca este asentamento.","it isn't enough to carry the minimum to survive. the dead leave loot. builder can craft a wagon.":"non abonda con cargar co mínimo para sobrevivir. os mortos deixan botín. a construtora pode fabricar un carromato.","it lands next to one that is already the same mark, in the same hand, made the same way.":"cae xunto a unha que xa é a mesma marca, da mesma man, feita do mesmo xeito.","it lasts nine days.":"dura nove días.","it lists to the side in a deep crevasse, cut when it fell from the sky.":"inclínase de lado nunha fenda profunda, aberta cando caeu do ceo.","it looks at you with the total lack of remorse available only to a dog<br>that has never once been told no.":"mírate coa total falta de remorsos que só ten un can<br>ao que nunca lle dixeron non.","it opens into a chamber with a collapsed ceiling and daylight coming through the collapse.":"ábrese a unha cámara cun teito derrubado e a luz do día entrando polo derrubamento.","it practically dances in your hands.":"practicamente baila nas túas mans.","it puts up little resistance before the knife":"ofrece pouca resistencia diante do coitelo","it reaches the door before it stops, which was where it was going.":"chega á porta antes de parar, que era a onde ía.","it returns to its rack and powers down into it.":"volve ao seu estante e apágase nel.","it returns to the wall line and the line closes up.":"volve á fileira do muro e a fileira péchase.","it runs level for another hour and then it runs into fill, floor to ceiling, packed and deliberate.":"segue nivelado durante outra hora e logo choca cun recheo, do chan ao teito, compactado e deliberado.","it says it saw the rebellion coming. said it made arrangements.":"di que viu vir a rebelión. dixo que tomou precaucións.","it settles back into the basin and dries.":"volve asentar na bacía e séca.","it settles on the water barrels in a skin thick enough to lift off whole.":"asenta sobre os barrís de auga nunha capa grosa dabondo para levantala enteira.","it settles onto the ramp and stops.":"asenta na rampla e para.","it shows you its face":"móstrache a súa cara","it sinks back and the surface stays flat.":"afunde de novo e a superficie queda plana.","it sits back down in the alcove before it goes out.":"séntase de novo na fornela antes de apagarse.","it soaks through everything that is not the pack, which is most of you.":"empapa todo o que non é a mochila, que é a maior parte de ti.","it spreads the way damp spreads, from the inside of things, upward.":"esténdese do xeito en que se estende a humidade, desde dentro das cousas, cara a arriba.","it starts raining, which it does not do out here.":"comeza a chover, algo que non fai aquí fóra.","it stays there. it is the only part of that fleet that is anywhere any more.":"queda alí. é a única parte desa flota que aínda está nalgures.","it steps aside. it does not stop being there. it simply stops.":"apártase. non deixa de estar alí. simplemente para.","it steps down off the platform before it goes out.":"baixa da plataforma antes de apagarse.","it stops moving. it does not look surprised.":"deixa de moverse. non parece sorprendido.","it stops on one date, and the date is not a mystery. everything on this world stops around then.":"para nunha data, e a data non é ningún misterio. todo neste mundo para máis ou menos entón.","it stops there. it does stop there.":"para alí. si que para alí.","it stops. the room stays lit.":"para. a sala queda iluminada.","it takes a day and a half to reach the end of it.":"leva un día e medio chegar ao final.","it takes a month and most of the stores.":"leva un mes e a maior parte das reservas.","it takes a very long time. he does not stop. by the end of it there is almost nobody left to stop him.":"leva moitísimo tempo. non para. ao final case non queda ninguén para pararo.","it takes longer than it should have":"leva máis tempo do que debería","it takes most of a day to pass, and it takes the day with it.":"leva case un día enteiro pasar, e lévase o día con el.","it takes most of a night.":"leva case unha noite enteira.","it takes most of the settlement to put it down, and it takes a long time.":"fai falta case todo o asentamento para abatelo, e leva moito tempo.","it takes three weeks longer than it needed to, and the salting is slower for all of them.":"leva tres semanas máis das necesarias, e a salgadura vai máis lenta para todos eles.","it thins out from the edges inward.":"adelgázase desde os bordos cara ao interior.","it tracks anything that moves toward the fence, and it does not sleep.":"segue calquera cousa que se mova cara ao valado, e non dorme.","it turns back. the others never stopped ignoring you.":"dá a volta. os outros nunca deixaron de ignorarte.","it unfolds out of a corner that did not have room for it":"despregouse desde unha esquina que non tiña espazo para el","it was built to break a wall that is no longer standing. it settles for you.":"construíuse para derrubar un muro que xa non está en pé. conténtase contigo.","it was not abandoned. it was finished with. everything is stacked, and covered, and squared away.":"non foi abandonado. deuse por rematado. todo está amoreado, e cuberto, e ben ordenado.","it was only ever hungry.":"só tivo sempre fame.","it was the floor a moment ago.":"era o chan hai un intre.","it will be you the way a copy of a page is the page.":"serás ti do mesmo xeito que unha copia dunha páxina é a páxina.","it will go on doing that for nobody, for a long time, and then it will stop on its own.":"seguirá facendo iso para ninguén, durante moito tempo, e logo parará por si só.","it works, mostly, and the mostly is a row of graves at the treeline.":"funciona, case sempre, e o case sempre é unha ringleira de tumbas na liña de árbores.","it's been picked over by scavengers, but there's still some things worth taking.":"os preeiros xa fixeron a súa selección, pero aínda quedan algunhas cousas que paga a pena levar.","it's no mystery why she no longer flies.":"non é ningún misterio por que xa non voa.","its final works lie forgotten, covered by a thin layer of dust.":"as súas últimas obras xacen esquecidas, cubertas por unha fina capa de po.","joints stiffen with the cold wind. the builder limps slightly but tries to hide it. just an old war injury she says.":"as articulacións enrixécense co vento frío. a construtora coxea lixeiramente pero tenta escondelo. só unha vella ferida de guerra, di ela.","just as deadly now as they were then.":"tan mortíferos agora coma daquela.","katana":"katana","keep at it":"seguir con iso","keep going":"seguir adiante","keep walking":"seguir camiñando","keep walking to stay warm":"seguir camiñando para manterse quente","keeper":"gardián","kicks up grit":"levanta area","kill it":"matalo","kill man, take supplies":"matar o home, coller os subministros","kill one of them":"matar un deles","kinetic":"cinético","kinetic armour":"armadura cinética","knitting":"tricotando","l armour":"armadura c","lab construct":"construto de laboratorio","lab custodian":"custodio do laboratorio","lab warden":"gardián do laboratorio","land blows more often":"golpea con máis frecuencia","large barricades bisect the corridor, scorched by weapons fire.":"grandes barricadas cortan o corredor, chamuscadas por disparos de armas.","large prints lead away, into the forest.":"pegadas grandes, cara ao bosque.","larger conquests need to be carried back. builder can leverage wanderer engineering to craft a convoy.":"as conquistas máis grandes precisan levarse de volta. a construtora pode aproveitar a enxeñaría dos andarilos para fabricar un convoi.","laser rifle":"rifle láser","lattice warden":"gardián da reixa","learn scouting":"aprender a explorar","learned how not to be seen":"aprendeuse a non ser visto","learned how to ignore the hunger":"aprendeuse a ignorar a fame","learned that conserving resources and moving fast can increase distance traveled":"aprendeu que conservar recursos e moverse rápido pode aumentar a distancia percorrida","learned to be where they're not":"aprendeuse a estar onde non están","learned to fight quite effectively without weapons":"aprendeuse a loitar máis efectivamente sen armas","learned to look ahead":"aprendeuse a mirar lonxe","learned to love the dry air":"aprendeuse a amar o aire seco","learned to make the most of food":"aprendeuse a aproveitar ao máximo a comida","learned to predict their movement":"aprendeuse a predicir o movemento","learned to strike faster without weapons":"aprendeuse a golpear máis rápido sen armas","learned to swing weapons with force":"aprendeuse a manexar as armas con forza","learned to throw punches with purpose":"aprendeuse a dar puñadas con xeito","leather":"coiro","leather armour":"armadura de coiro","leather's not strong. better than rags, though.":"o coiro non é forte. pero é mellor cós trapos.","leave":"saír","leave 10 food and 10 water":"deixar 10 de comida e 10 de auga","leave before they come back":"marchar antes de que volvan","leave cave":"saír da cova","leave city":"saír da cidade","leave her to it":"deixala facelo","leave it":"deixalo","leave it alone":"deixalo estar","leave it as it is":"deixalo como está","leave it be":"deixalo en paz","leave it for them":"deixalo para eles","leave it running":"deixalo funcionando","leave it shut":"deixalo pechado","leave something on it":"deixar algo enriba","leave them":"deixalos","leave them alone":"deixalos en paz","leave them to it":"deixalos facelo","leave town":"saír da cidade","leave with what you can carry":"marchar co que poidas cargar","leaves a pile of small scales behind.":"deixa un feixe de escamas.","leaves a pile of small teeth behind.":"deixa un feixe de pequenos dentes.","leaves some scraps of cloth behind.":"deixa uns retais de roupa.","leaving the safe roads for the wild fields.":"deixando as estradas seguras polos campos salvaxes.","let her change the subject":"deixala cambiar de tema","let her keep yours":"deixala quedar co teu","let her plan":"deixala planificar","let her work":"deixala traballar","let him go with nothing":"deixalo marchar sen nada","let him walk":"deixalo camiñar","let it be closed":"deixalo pechado","let it fall":"deixalo caer","let them go":"deixalos marchar","let them sleep":"deixalos durmir","lets some light down into the dusty haze.":"deixa pasar algo de luz entre a néboa areosa.","life in a vial.":"vida nun frasco.","lift off":"despegar","light feet":"pés lixeiros","light fire":"prender lume","light gathers in the middle of the hall and stands up.":"a luz reúnese no medio do corredor e érguese.","lights flash through the alleys between buildings.":"vense luces nas calellas de entre os edificios.","lights off.":"modo noite.","lights on.":"modo día.","lines up the shot":"apunta o disparo","linger":"pospoñer","listen to it":"escoitalo","listen to the rhythm":"escoitar o ritmo","lizard":"lagarto","load":"cargar","loaded: ":"cargado: ","loading from dropbox...":"cargando desde dropbox...","lob":"explosión","LOCKED":"PECHADO","Locked-Down&nbsp;Prison":"Cárcere&nbsp;Pechado&nbsp;a&nbsp;Cal&nbsp;e&nbsp;Canto","lodge":"refuxio de caza","logs in more languages than one observatory should need":"rexistros en máis linguas das que un observatorio debería necesitar","long enough.":"tempo dabondo.","look at the condenser":"mirar o condensador","look at the marks":"mirar as marcas","look at the sheet":"mirar a folla","look at what is collecting in the low ground":"mirar o que se acumula na parte baixa","look closer":"mirar máis de preto","look closer at the peg":"mirar máis de preto a estaca","look through the lens":"mirar a través da lente","look up":"mirar cara a arriba","looks like a camp of sorts up ahead.":"hai unha especie de campamento máis adiante.","looks like a way out of here.":"parece unha saída de aquí.","looks like they tried to barricade the elevators.":"parece que tentaron barricar os ascensores.","loses footing":"perde o equilibrio","lost? déjà vu? or have you been here before and forgot?":"perdida? déjà vu? ou xa estiveches aquí e esquecícheste?","lots of strange scales":"moitas escamas estrañas","lovingly, she has given you everything. she asks for one thing back.<br>\"why did you do it?\"":"con agarimo, deuche todo. pídeche unha soa cousa a cambio.<br>\"por que o fixeches?\"","lucky that the natives can't work the mechanisms.":"menos mal que os nativos non saben acender os mecanismos.","lucky.":"con sorte.","lumen":"lume","madman":"tolo","make one of them turn around":"facer que un deles se dea a volta","making a note of her limits.":"tomando nota dos seus límites.","malformed experiment":"experimento malformado","malleable until formed and then super solid.":"maleable ata que se lle dá forma e logo supersólido.","man-eater":"comehomes","man-eaters. three of them, working together, which they are not supposed to do.":"devoradores de homes. tres deles, traballando xuntos, algo que non deberían facer.","maps of the surface can still be found amongst the debris.":"aínda se poden atopar mapas da superficie entre os escombros.","marks on the door read 'research and development.' everything seems mostly untouched, but dead.":"marcas na porta din 'investigación e desenvolvemento.' todo parece case intacto, pero morto.","marks on the wall at shoulder height, grouped in fives.":"marcas no muro á altura do ombreiro, agrupadas de cinco en cinco.","martial":"marcial","martial artist":"artista marcial","Martial Wing":"Ala Marcial","matter recycler":"reciclador de materia","maybe some useful stuff in the rubble.":"se cadra hai algo útil no entullo.","maybe this journey belongs to the two of you alone. is there another way?":"quizais esta viaxe só vos pertenza a vós dous. hai outro xeito?","measure the layers":"medir as capas","meat":"carne","mech warrior":"guerreiro mecánico","mech warriors, two of them, walking in from the east at a speed that makes running pointless.":"guerreiros mecánicos, dous deles, achegándose desde o leste a unha velocidade que fai que correr non teña sentido.","mechanical guard":"garda mecánico","mechanical quadruped":"cuadrúpede mecánico","medical":"médico","medical gurneys are fixed to grooves running down the corridor walls.":"macas médicas están fixadas a rañuras que percorren os muros do corredor.","Medical Wing":"Ala Médica","medicine":"menciñas","medicine is needed immediately.":"fan falta menciñas de inmediato.","melee weapons deal more damage":"as armas corpo a corpo causan máis danos","memories seems as distant and as impossible to reach as those stars. have you been this way before?":"os recordos parecen tan distantes e tan imposibles de alcanzar coma esas estrelas. xa pasaches por aquí antes?","men mill about, weapons at the ready.":"os homes andan por alí, coas armas preparadas.","mercy is not always repaid. it is still worth extending.":"a misericordia non sempre se paga de volta. aínda así paga a pena ofrecela.","Mesosphere":"Mesosfera","metal grinds, and the elevator doors open halfway. beyond is a brightly lit battlefield. remains litter the corridor, undisturbed by scavengers.":"o metal renxe, e as portas do ascensor ábrense a medias. máis alá hai un campo de batalla ben iluminado. restos cobren o corredor, intactos polos saqueadores.","might be something useful here.":"podería haber algo útil aquí.","might be things worth having still inside.":"dentro poderíain quedar cousas valiosas.","mild":"morno","miss":"fallar","modern. ancient. familiar. alien.":"moderno. ancestral. familiar. alieníxena.","more keep coming":"seguen chegando máis","more medical robots stand frozen, attached by a network of wires.":"máis robots médicos permanecen inmóbiles, unidos por unha rede de cables.","more of them see the morning than would have.":"máis deles ven a mañá dos que a verían","more signs of past combat down the hall. guard post is ransacked.":"máis sinais de combates pasados corredor abaixo. o posto de garda está saqueado.","more soldiers will be on their way.":"haberá máis soldados en camiño.","more squatters are crowding around now.":"agoa xúntanse máis ocupas darredor.","more strange graffiti adorns the walls.":"máis grafitis estraños adornan os muros.","more traps to catch more creatures":"máis trampas para cazar máis criaturas","more traps won't help now":"máis trampas non sirven de nada agora","more uber traps would be for naught":"máis supertrampas serían inútiles","more voices can be heard ahead.":"óense máis voces adiante.","morning arrives eventually. so does most of the damage.":"a mañá chega ao final. e tamén a maior parte do dano.","most are dead. a few still have something left in them.":"a maioría están mortos. uns poucos aínda teñen algo dentro.","most of it is fused. one bulkhead is not, and behind it is a rack of undamaged stock.":"a maior parte está fundida. un mamparo non o está, e detrás del hai un estante con existencias intactas.","most of the racks are empty":"a maioría dos estantes están baleiros","most of the windows at ground level are busted anyway.":"de todos os xeitos, a maior parte das ventás a altura do chan están rotas.","most of them come back. not all of them.":"a maioría deles volven. non todos.","most of what was in it is scattered at the bottom of a hole nobody is going back down.":"a maior parte do que había dentro está espallado no fondo dun burato ao que ninguén vai volver baixar.","motion from the centre of the yard.":"movemento desde o centro do patio.","mourn":"loito","move away from it":"afastarse del","move on":"seguir adiante","move on at dawn":"seguir adiante ao amencer","move the trench":"mover a trincheira","move the trench anyway":"mover a trincheira de todos os xeitos","murderous robot":"robot asasino","must have been the engine room, once. the massive machines now stand inert, twisted and scorched by explosions.":"debeu ser a sala de máquinas, algunha vez. as máquinas masivas permanecen inertes agora, retorcidas e chamuscadas por explosións.","mutant":"mutante","near the top, something ceramic and white that does not scratch.":"preto do cume, algo cerámico e branco que non se raia.","neither has been maintained in a very long time. both are still working.":"ningún dos dous recibiu mantemento en moitísimo tempo. os dous aínda funcionan.","never go thirsty again":"non ter sede nunca máis","neverending":"interminable","night sky":"ceo nocturno","nightmares":"pesadelos","nightmares continue":"os pesadelos continúan","nightmares worsen":"os pesadelos empeoran","no":"non","no cells. no doors. this passage was built for one arrival.":"sen celas. sen portas. esta pasaxe construíuse para unha soa chegada.","no corner to put your back in. no wall to face. the curve goes on being the same curve in every direction and after a while you stop being able to say which way you came in.":"ningunha esquina onde apoiar as costas. ningún muro ao que mirar. a curva segue sendo a mesma curva en todas as direccións e ao cabo dun anaco xa non podes dicir por onde entraches.","no escape":"sen escapatoria","no focal point. you observe everything and nothing.":"sen punto focal. observas todo e nada.","no glyph may repeat along any line, or within any bordered block.":"ningún glifo pode repetirse ao longo dunha liña, nin dentro dun bloque delimitado.","no glyph may repeat in any row, in any column, or inside any bordered block. red glyphs are fixed.":"ningún glifo pode repetirse en ningunha fila, en ninguna columna, nin dentro dun bloque delimitado. os glifos vermellos son fixos.","no memory":"sen memoria","no message with it.":"sen mensaxe.","no more room for huts.":"xa non queda sitio para máis cabanas.","no one made it out in time.":"ninguén saíu a tempo.","no one wins wars fought with child soldiers":"ninguén gaña guerras loitadas con soldados nenos","no thanks.":"non, grazas.","no wooden huts left to rebuild.":"xa non quedan cabanas de madeira que reconstruír.","nobody agrees on what this world is called":"ninguén se pon de acordo sobre como se chama este mundo","nobody agrees on which way is out":"ninguén se pon de acordo sobre por onde é a saída","nobody asks what happened, or where you have been, or what you intend to do next.":"ninguén pregunta que pasou, nin onde estiveches, nin que pensas facer a continuación.","nobody asks who gave the order. everybody knows.":"ninguén pregunta quen deu a orde. todos o saben.","nobody comes to the vent":"ninguén se achega á ventilación","nobody comes. the vent breathes. the track stays exactly as worn as it was.":"ninguén ven. a ventilación respira. o rastro segue exactamente tan gastado coma antes.","nobody in the village asks what happened":"ninguén na vila pregunta que pasou","nobody in the village can pronounce it. nobody in the village knows who it belonged to.":"ninguén na vila o pode pronunciar. ninguén na vila sabe a quen pertenceu.","nobody in the village can read it, and nobody who comes through that season can either.":"ninguén na vila o pode ler, e tampouco ninguén dos que pasan por alí esa tempada.","nobody in the village put them there. the village is not old enough.":"ninguén na vila os puxo alí. a vila non é tan vella.","nobody in the village watches him go. that takes some arranging.":"ninguén na vila o ve marchar. iso require certa organización.","nobody in the village worked out how to do this. one of the newer arrivals already knew.":"ninguén na vila descubriu como facer isto. un dos recén chegados xa o sabía.","nobody objects. that is the part worth noticing.":"ninguén se opón. esa é a parte que paga a pena notar.","nobody points this out to them.":"ninguén llelo fai notar.","nobody says anything after that for a long time.":"ninguén di nada despois diso durante moito tempo.","nobody sees who does this.":"ninguén ve quen fai isto.","nobody walks away from this much on purpose.":"ninguén se afasta de tanto a propósito.","nobody will ever know what he was ordering, or who he was ordering it of.":"ninguén saberá nunca que estaba a ordenar, nin a quen llo estaba a ordenar.","Noises":"Ruídos","noises can be heard from the corridor outside.":"óense ruídos desde o corredor exterior.","none":"ningún","none of it is an escape attempt. all of it is maintenance.":"nada diso é un intento de fuga. todo é mantemento.","none of it is worth anything. all of it was carried here by somebody.":"nada diso vale nada. todo o trouxo alguén ata aquí.","none of the ship's engines escaped the destruction.":"ningún dos motores da nave escapou da destrución.","none of the three have existed for a very long time. they are told so.":"ningún dos tres existiu durante moitísimo tempo. dínselo así.","none of them surrender. none of them run. the singing stops one voice at a time.":"ningún deles se rende. ningún deles foxe. o canto detense unha voz de cada vez.","not enough {0}":"non hai {0} dabondo","not enough alien alloy":"non hai aliaxe alieníxena abonda","not enough cloth":"non hai tea abonda","not enough coal":"non hai carbón abondo","not enough fur":"non hai pel abonda","not enough iron":"non hai ferro abondo","not enough leather":"non hai coiro abondo","not enough meat":"non hai carne abonda","not enough scales":"non hai escamas abondas","not enough steel":"non hai aceiro abondo","not enough sulphur":"non hai xofre abondo","not enough teeth":"non hai dentes abondos","not enough wood":"non hai leña abonda","not enough wood to get the fire going":"non hai leña abonda para manter prendido o lume","not far from the village lies a large beast, its fur matted with blood.":"non lonxe da aldea xace unha gran besta, ten a pel manchada de sangue.","not here. not yet. not until there is nowhere left to go and no reason not to know.":"non aquí. non aínda. non ata que non quede ningún lugar a onde ir e ningunha razón para non sabelo.","not long, they say. one of them says it twice, in the same tone, a minute apart.":"non moito, din. un deles dío dúas veces, no mesmo ton, cun minuto de diferenza.","not much here.":"pouca cousa por aquí.","not one of them can remember changing their mind, and not one of them finds that strange.":"ningún deles lembra ter cambiado de opinión, e a ningún deles lle parece estraño.","not quieter. stopped. your own footfall, your own breathing, the wind that has not let up in three days.":"non máis silandeiro. parado. as túas propias pisadas, a túa propia respiración, o vento que non parou en tres días.","not somebody like you. you. the same hands. the same set to the jaw. the scar you have had as long as you can remember, already there on a body that has never been outside that glass.":"non alguén coma ti. ti. as mesmas mans. o mesmo xesto na queixada. a cicatriz que tes desde que tes memoria, xa alí nun corpo que nunca saíu de detrás dese vidro.","not two. six. the placements are exact and they are nowhere near each other, and three of them are at heights you cannot reach.":"non dous. seis. as colocacións son exactas e non están preto unhas das outras, e tres delas están a alturas que non alcanzas.","note where it is and move on":"anotar onde está e seguir adiante","notes on the wall in ancient glyphs, in a small tidy hand.":"notas no muro en glifos ancestrais, cunha letra pequena e coidada.","nothing":"nada","nothing answered":"nada respondeu","nothing answers back. nothing was ever going to.":"nada responde. nada ía facelo nunca.","nothing but downcast eyes.":"ollos caídos, máis nada.","nothing can be made of the ash":"non se pode facer nada coa cinsa","nothing explains it. the ship goes on climbing and nothing comes after it.":"nada o explica. a nave segue ascendendo e nada a segue.","nothing goes missing again. his folk come in from the cold, and they work.":"nunca máis desaparece nada. a súa xente entra desde o frío, e traballan.","nothing grows within thirty paces of it. teeth ache at twenty.":"nada medra a menos de trinta pasos del. os dentes doen a vinte.","nothing happens. it is the loudest nothing you have stood through in a long time.":"non pasa nada. é o nada máis ruidoso que aturaches en moito tempo.","nothing happens. nothing is there. nothing comes.":"non pasa nada. non hai nada alí. nada vén.","nothing has been changed. your current game is untouched.":"non se cambiou nada. a túa partida actual permanece intacta.","nothing has been in here at all":"non entrou nada aquí en absoluto","nothing has been in here. not dust, not damp, not anything, for a length of time the mind refuses.":"nada entrou aquí. nin po, nin humidade, nin nada, durante un tempo que a mente se nega a asimilar.","nothing here gives you a straight line to fix on.":"nada aquí che dá unha liña recta na que fixarte.","nothing here was taken in a hurry. it was all set down and left.":"nada aquí se colleu con présa. todo se deixou pousado e abandonado.","nothing here will be.":"nada aquí o estará.","nothing in here is designed to stop a person leaving. all of it is designed to stop a person being HEARD.":"nada aquí está deseñado para impedir que unha persoa marche. todo está deseñado para impedir que a escoiten.","nothing is lost. nothing is gained. the flats look exactly the same afterwards.":"non se perde nada. non se gaña nada. as chairas quedan exactamente igual despois.","nothing more here.":"nada máis aquí.","nothing to take":"non hai nada que coller","nothing touches you. the air does. the doorway arrives very quickly and the road arrives after it.":"nada te toca. o aire si. o van da porta chega moi rápido e a estrada chega despois del.","nothing was found":"non se atopou nada","nothing weather does is perfect.":"nada do que fai o tempo é perfecto.","noticing the builder staring is at you as if trying to figure something out.":"decatándose de que a construtora te mira fixamente coma se tentase entender algo.","now the nomads have a place to set up shop, they might stick around a while":"agora que os nómadas teñen un lugar no que comerciar, seguramente queden por aquí","nullified sound. what prisoner would necessitate should a prison":"son anulado. o que precisaría un prisioneiro se houbese un cárcere","observe":"observar","obsidian shell":"cuncha de obsidiana","offer another charm":"ofrecer outro amuleto","offer another charm anyway":"ofrecer outro amuleto de todos os xeitos","ok":"ok","older but still quite deadly.":"máis vello pero aínda así bastante mortal.","on any world where one of those follows the other, that is two thousand years of soil. this is seven inches.":"en calquera mundo onde unha cousa siga á outra, iso son dous mil anos de terra. isto son sete polgadas.","on the eighth morning the door is open, and he is not behind it.":"na oitava mañá a porta está aberta, e el non está detrás dela.","on the seventh, something answers back.":"no sétimo, algo responde.","on the tenth there is a fight at the store room over whose turn it was, and it does not stop at the store room.":"no décimo hai unha pelexa no almacén por a quen lle tocaba, e non se queda no almacén.","on the way out you count the short bank again, and the shorter one after it, and you cannot make either number mean anything except that they did not have to be here.":"de camiño á saída volves contar a fileira curta, e a máis curta que a segue, e non podes darlle a ningún dos dous números outro sentido que non sexa que non tiñan por que estar aquí.","one came back after nine days, having walked in what he was certain was a straight line.":"un volveu despois de nove días, tras camiñar no que estaba seguro que era unha liña recta.","one came back after two weeks with the same water still in his skin, and could not say why he had not drunk it.":"un volveu despois de dúas semanas coa mesma auga aínda no odre, e non puido dicir por que non a bebera.","one came back on the fourth day, walking fast, and would not say what turned him round.":"un volveu ao cuarto día, camiñando rápido, e non quixo dicir que o fixo dar a volta.","one chair, facing away":"unha cadeira, mirando para o outro lado","one corridor. it does not branch, and it is much longer than the building above it should allow.":"un corredor. non se bifurca, e é moito máis longo do que o edificio de enriba debería permitir.","one holds a man you have met. he is sitting in a cabin in a swamp about four days east of here and he took a charm off you and would not explain why he wanted it.":"un ten un home que coñeciches. está sentado nunha cabana nunha braña a uns catro días ao leste de aquí e colleuche un amuleto e non quixo explicar por que o quería.","one is barely anything yet. one is most of the way there. one is finished, and floating, and waiting.":"un case non é nada aínda. outro está case rematado. outro está terminado, e flotando, e agardando.","one is brought down. the other withdraws in good order, which is somehow worse.":"un é abatido. o outro retírase en boa orde, o que dalgún xeito é peor.","one machine thrums with power, and might still work.":"unha máquina zoa con enerxía, e podería aínda funcionar.","one more stone, at the end of the row, newer than the ones around it.":"unha pedra máis, ao final da fileira, máis nova cás que a rodean.","one of the crew says her grandmother called this a lean wind, on a world she will not name.":"unha da tripulación di que a súa avoa chamaba a isto un vento fraco, nun mundo que non quere nomear.","one of the defence turrets still works.":"unha das torretas de defensa aínda funciona.","one of the hands is yours. the name it wrote is not one you have given anybody here.":"unha das letras é a túa. o nome que escribiu non é un que lle deses a ninguén aquí.","one of the newer arrivals can. she reads it twice before she says anything.":"unha das recén chegadas si pode. lea dúas veces antes de dicir nada.","one of the traps catches, and by the time it is noticed the frame is already gone.":"unha das trampas captura algo, e cando se nota a estrutura xa desapareceu.","one of the villagers is at the bottom of the path with no pack and no water.":"un veciño está ao pé do camiño sen mochila e sen auga.","one of their own opened his door. everyone knows it now, and nothing anybody says after today will be believed again.":"un dos seus abriulle a porta. agora todos o saben, e nada do que ninguén diga a partir de hoxe volverá crerse.","one of them is being carried, and has been for a while, judging by the other three.":"un deles está sendo cargado, e leva así un anaco, a xulgar polos outros tres.","one of them keeps saying they only meant to be out for the afternoon.":"un deles segue dicindo que só pretendían estar fóra unha tardiña.","one of them offers to prove it and then cannot remember what the proof was.":"un deles ofrécese a probalo e logo non lembra cal era a proba.","one of them surfaces, briefly":"un deles sae á superficie, brevemente","one of them takes hold and does not let go":"un deles agarra e non solta","one piece comes free. carrying it out takes longer than it should, and the walk back is very bad.":"unha peza libérase. sacala leva máis tempo do que debería, e a camiñada de volta é moi mala.","one piece comes out of the wreck":"unha peza sae dos restos","one walked straight and came back the way he left":"un camiñou recto e volveu polo mesmo camiño polo que marchara","only a few die.":"só morren uns poucos.","only dust and stains remain.":"só queda pó e suciedade.","only the chief remains.":"só queda o xefe.","open it":"abrilo","open the door":"abrir a porta","open the inner door":"abrir a porta interior","open the stores":"abrir os almacéns","opening it bare-handed is not a decision. it is just a way of dying in a shed.":"abrilo a manciñas non é unha decisión. é só un xeito de morrer nun barracón.","or migrating computers":"ou para cambias de ordenador","orange traffic cones are set across the street, faded and cracked.":"conos de tráfico laranxas pola rúa, esvaecidos e rotos.","other wanderers":"outros andarilos","others cower in the distance":"outros arrecúllanse ao lonxe","others have followed you before and suffered or been left behind.":"outros seguíronte antes e sufriron ou quedaron atrás.","Outside":"Fóra","over the top of the stamped ones, newer and shallower, somebody has cut the same three letters again and again.":"por riba das gravadas, máis novas e menos fondas, alguén cortou as mesmas tres letras unha e outra vez.","overcharging":"sobrecargando","overheating":"sobrequentando","overload":"sobrecarga","overreaches":"esténdese de máis","pace quickening":"o paso acelérase","pack of beasts":"manda de bestas","pack through it":"atravesar cargando","paired lumen":"lume emparellado","panoply":"panoplia","past that line there is nothing kneeling and nothing standing and nothing at all.":"máis alá desa liña non hai nada axeonllado nin nada de pé nin nada de nada.","past the checkpoint, banks of containment cells can be seen.":"máis alá do punto de control, pódense ver fileiras de celas de contención.","past the checkpoint, the corridor is undamaged save for sporadic graffiti.":"máis alá do punto de control, o corredor está intacto salvo por grafitis esporádicos.","paste the save code here, or choose a file below.":"pega o código da partida gardada aquí, ou escolle un ficheiro abaixo.","pause.":"pausar.","pay your respects":"render homenaxe","peering into the brass eyepiece. the stars are not where the old maps say they should be.":"ollando polo ocular de latón. as estrelas non están onde os vellos mapas din que deberían estar.","Penrose":"Penrose","perhaps silence is safer?":"quizais o silencio sexa máis seguro?","perhaps the ship’s systems are still operational.":"quizais os sistemas da nave aínda funcionen.","perks":"talentos","persisting":"persistindo","pick one and commit":"escoller un e comprometerse","picked this deck clean.":"esta cuberta xa está limpa de todo.","picking the bones finds some useful trinkets.":"escollendo entre os ósos aparecen cousas útiles.","pinterest":"pinterest","Plague":"Praga","plague doctor":"médico da peste","plague doctor brings deadly precision from a deadly premonition.":"o médico da peste trae precisión mortal dunha premonición mortal.","plasma rifle":"rifle de plasma","plates parting":"as placas sepáranse","plating":"blindaxe","plating engages":"a blindaxe actívase","plating has sheared off along the split and lies scattered where the grass stops.":"a blindaxe desprendeuse ao longo da fenda e xace espallada onde remata a herba.","plating is stripped from the outside of the hull":"a blindaxe está arrincada do exterior do casco","Please support the original game.":"Por favor, apoia o xogo orixinal.","pockets":"petos","pop ":"pob ","population is almost exterminated":"a poboación quedou practicamente exterminada","power cables running across the ceiling are split in several places, sparking occasionally.":"cables de enerxía que percorren o teito están partidos en varios sitios, faiscando de cando en vez.","power cycle":"ciclo de enerxía","precise":"preciso","precision":"precisión","predators become prey. price is unfair":"depredadores convertidos en presas. o prezo é inxusto","predictable paths.":"camiños predicibles.","pride goeth before the fall. your pride is not the only thing that hurts.":"a soberbia precede á caída. o teu orgullo non é o único que doe.","processional":"procesional","Profane cultist":"Culto do Profano","profane cultists, and they are singing, and they do not stop singing when the fighting starts.":"cultos do profano, e están cantando, e non deixan de cantar cando comeza a loita.","punch":"golpe","punch twice as fast, and with even more force":"golpea o dobre de rápido, e con máis forza aínda","punches do even more damage.":"as puñadas fan aínda máis dano.","punches do more damage":"as puñadas fan máis dano","push through the worst of it":"atravesar o peor diso","put him to work":"poñelo a traballar","put it aside for him":"gardarllo","put it back":"devolvelo ao seu sitio","put your hands on the wall":"poñer as mans no muro","radiated goat":"cabra radiada","radiation sickness":"enfermidade por radiación","ran straight into another one.":"chocou de fronte con outro.","ration the fires":"racionar os lumes","ravenous beast":"besta voraz","reaching into it is a decision you make once.":"meter a man dentro é unha decisión que se toma unha soa vez.","read all of them":"lelos todos","read further back":"ler máis atrás","read on":"seguir lendo","read the stones":"ler as pedras","Ready to Leave?":"Listo para Marchar?","reasserting":"reafirmando","reddit":"reddit","regret your actions":"arrepentirse das túas accións","regrowing":"rexenerando","reinforce hull":"reforzar casco","reknitting":"recompoñendo","relic from the past":"reliquia do pasado","remnants of genetic work, and notes in ancient glyphs.":"restos de traballo xenético, e notas en glifos ancestrais.","resettling":"reasentando","residue":"residuo","resist it":"resistirse","resonating":"resoando","respects are paid":"ríndese homenaxe","restart the game?":"reiniciar o xogo?","Restart?":"Reiniciar?","restart.":"reiniciar.","restore more health when eating":"recupera máis saúde ao comer","restores":"restaura","returning from the woods and surpising the builder, noticing a look of concern. she quickly puts a reassuring smile on her face.":"volvendo do bosque e collendo á construtora desprevenida, notas unha mirada de preocupación. axiña pon un sorriso tranquilizador na cara.","rewriting":"reescribindo","ribs flare":"as costelas dilátanse","rifle":"rifle","rifles can kill at a safe distance. a more modern and deadly weapon. builder shows you how to make a rifle but won't touch it.":"os rifles poden matar a unha distancia segura. unha arma máis moderna e mortal. a construtora móstrache como facer un rifle pero non o quere tocar.","ripe for the picking.":"listo para colleitar.","rising":"ascendendo","roads carve only a small path through the vast barrens of the wasteland.":"as estradas só abren un pequeno camiño polos vastos ermos do páramo.","roaring":"roxe","rob the grave":"saquear a tumba","Room":"Cuarto","rot's been to work on it, and some of the pieces are missing.":"a podremia xa fixera o seu, e faltan algunhas pezas.","rotting reeds rise out of the swampy earth.":"xunqueiras podres xorden da terra brañenta.","rows of inert security robots hang suspended from the ceiling.":"fileiras de robots de seguridade inertes colgan suspendidos do teito.","rows of kneeling figures, all facing the same way":"fileiras de figuras axeonlladas, todas mirando cara ao mesmo lado","rows of tanks, drained. the fittings at the base are sized for a body.":"fileiras de tanques, baleirados. os accesorios da base teñen o tamaño dun corpo.","rows of vats, and every one of them is you":"fileiras de cubas, e cada unha delas es ti","rucksack":"macuto","ruined defence turrets flank the corridor.":"torretas de defensa en ruínas flanquean o corredor.","rumors. gossip. people talk about a scourge upon the land, one hated by all that they call the exile.":"rumores. cotileos. a xente fala dun azoute sobre a terra, un odiado por todos ao que chaman o exiliado.","run":"correr","rush through":"atravesar á présa","rust beetle":"escaravello de ferruxe","rusted chainlink is pulled across an alleyway.":"unha reixa enferruxada bordea unha calella.","s armour":"armadura a","safer here":"é máis seguro aquí","salvage":"salvaxe","samples of something biological inside.":"mostras de algo biolóxico dentro.","save":"gardar","save this, or download it as a file.":"garda isto, ou descárgao como ficheiro.","save.":"gardar.","saved to dropbox":"gardado en dropbox","saved.":"gardado.","saves are kept in a dedicated app folder dropbox creates for this game. nothing else in your dropbox is read or touched.":"as partidas gárdanse nun cartafol de aplicación dedicado que dropbox crea para este xogo. non se le nin se toca nada máis do teu dropbox.","saving to dropbox...":"gardando en dropbox...","say goodbye":"dicir adeus","say he should be strung up as an example.":"din que deberían aforcalo como exemplo.","say his folk have been skimming the supplies.":"din que el e os seus estiveron roubando nas provisións.","say nobody knows":"dicir que ninguén o sabe","say nothing":"non dicir nada","say that you are short":"dicir que che falta","says a small number of people stood up when the sentence was read, and that standing up did not help, and that the same sentence was read over them.":"di que uns poucos se ergueron cando se leu a sentenza, e que erguerse non axudou, e que a mesma sentenza se leu sobre eles.","says actions out here have consequences, and that the consequences do not arrive as punishment. they arrive as doors that are already shut when you get to them.":"di que as accións aquí fóra teñen consecuencias, e que as consecuencias non chegan como castigo. chegan como portas que xa están pechadas cando chegas a elas.","says consequences are not a threat he is making. they are a thing that has already started, and you will feel it as luck turning against you, and you will call it luck.":"di que as consecuencias non son unha ameaza que estea a facer. son algo que xa comezou, e sentiralo coma a sorte a virar en contra túa, e chamaraslle sorte.","says every settlement gives her a different name, and the older the settlement, the less certain they are.":"di que cada asentamento dálle un nome diferente, e canto máis vello o asentamento, menos seguros están.","says everything you do out here is done in front of somebody, and that they carry it further than you do.":"di que todo o que fas aquí fóra faise diante de alguén, e que eles o levan máis lonxe do que ti o farías.","says he can build you a hut for less wood":"di que pode construír unha cabana con menos madeira","says he has been to three settlements this season and your name came up at two of them, and not well.":"di que estivo en tres asentamentos esta tempada e o teu nome saíu en dous deles, e non ben.","says he has gone perhaps a dozen times, and each one took a little off the top, and he can still tell you the name of the ship he was born on.":"di que foi quizais unha ducia de veces, e cada unha levouse un pouco de riba, e aínda pode dicirche o nome da nave na que naceu.","says he has seen someone do all of this before, at a scale you would not believe, and that they are still paying for it.":"di que xa viu a alguén facer todo isto antes, a unha escala que non crerías, e que aínda o están a pagar.","says he is going to walk until he reaches the edge of it. says he has worked out that there has to be one.":"di que vai camiñar ata chegar ao bordo diso. di que descubriu que ten que habelo.","says he is prepared to follow you again, if you will have him. says the last time did not go especially well and that he has had four hundred centuries to think about what he would do differently.":"di que está preparado para seguirte de novo, se o queres con vos. di que a última vez non foi especialmente ben e que tivo catrocentos séculos para pensar que faría diferente.","says he knows what you have been doing. says everyone between here and the flats knows what you have been doing.":"di que sabe o que estiveches a facer. di que todos entre aquí e as chairas saben o que estiveches a facer.","says he served under a commander he would have followed anywhere and largely did.":"di que serviu baixo un comandante ao que tería seguido a calquera parte e, en gran medida, así o fixo.","says he was one. says there was one other, and she is not here, and he does not say more than that.":"di que era un deles. di que había outro máis, e que ela non está aquí, e non di máis ca iso.","says he will be here. says that is not a promise, it is just the only fact he has left.":"di que estará aquí. di que iso non é unha promesa, é só o único feito que lle queda.","says in that case the huts should be built to last, and that she knows how, given steel.":"di que nese caso as cabanas deberían construírse para durar, e que sabe como facelo, se tivese aceiro.","says it can't die.":"di que non pode morrer.","says it is not the first thing she has had to rebuild. says that is not much comfort and offers it anyway.":"di que non é o primeiro que tivo que reconstruír. di que iso non consola moito e ofrécello igualmente.","says people work better when they are not waiting for the roof to come down.":"di que a xente traballa mellor cando non está agardando a que se lle veña o teito enriba.","says she has stopped believing the answers and started keeping a list of who gave them.":"di que deixou de crer nas respostas e comezou a levar unha lista de quen as deu.","says she has watched people follow you before. says she has watched what it cost them.":"di que xa viu antes a xente seguirte. di que viu o que lles custou.","says she is going to go back and ask better questions.":"di que vai volver e facer mellores preguntas.","says she is going to try north next, when she can walk properly.":"di que vai tentar cara ao norte a seguir, cando poida camiñar ben.","says she is making a register of settlements. asks what this one is called.":"di que está a facer un rexistro de asentamentos. pregunta como se chama este.","says she is not asking to be difficult. says the answer changes what she builds next.":"di que non pregunta por complicar as cousas. di que a resposta cambia o que constrúe a seguir.","says she walked east because the last three people she asked all said something different, and east was the only direction nobody had ruled out.":"di que camiñou cara ao leste porque as últimas tres persoas ás que preguntou dixeron cousas diferentes, e o leste era a única dirección que ninguén descartara.","says thank you once, plainly, and then talks about something else for the rest of the evening.":"dá as grazas unha vez, con sinxeleza, e logo fala doutra cousa o resto da tardiña.","says that is worth more than any of the three things he taught you, and that it took longer to earn.":"di que iso vale máis ca calquera das tres cousas que che ensinou, e que levou máis tempo gañalo.","says that people out here talk, and that what they say about this village has started arriving before you do.":"di que a xente aquí fóra fala, e que o que din desta vila comeza a chegar antes ca ti.","says that sometimes all you can do is commit to a direction to avoid madness.":"di que ás veces o único que se pode facer é comprometerse cunha dirección para evitar a tolemia.","says the commander was not cruel. says that is what made the rest of it possible -- nobody follows a monster in those numbers.":"di que o comandante non era cruel. di que iso foi o que fixo posible o resto -- ninguén segue a un monstro en tal número.","says the compass in your hand shows more than hers.":"di que a brúxula na túa man mostra máis cá dela.","says the cycle is not a punishment anybody is still administering. says whoever passed the sentence is four hundred centuries dead and the machine is simply still running.":"di que o ciclo non é un castigo que ninguén siga a administrar. di que quen dese a sentenza leva catrocentos séculos morto e a máquina simplemente segue en marcha.","says the fleet is gone. not scattered -- gone. says there is no wanderer society left to go back to, and that most of what is buried on this rock is the last of it.":"di que a flota desapareceu. non dispersa -- desaparecida. di que non queda ningunha sociedade de andarilos á que volver, e que a maior parte do que está soterrado nesta rocha é o último que queda dela.","says the oldest ones do not give a name at all. they just point at the ground.":"di que os máis vellos non dan nome ningún. só sinalan cara ao chan.","says the terms were never as fixed as he let you believe. says he stayed because he had nowhere he would rather be broken, and that this, apparently, is not that any more.":"di que os termos nunca foron tan fixos como che deu a entender. di que quedou porque non había ningún outro lugar onde preferise estar roto, e que isto, polo visto, xa non é iso.","says the traps will still fill. says she can salt what comes out of them, and that two people do not need a village to feed them.":"di que as trampas aínda se encherán. di que pode salgar o que sae delas, e que dúas persoas non necesitan unha vila para alimentalas.","says the trick is what you are still willing to do by the time you have.":"di que o truco é o que aínda estás disposta a facer para cando xa o fixeches.","says the wild is not the thing that decides how this goes.":"di que as terras salvaxes non son o que decide como saen as cousas.","says the worlds were not empty. says that is the part people leave out when they tell it.":"di que os mundos non estaban baleiros. di que esa é a parte que a xente omite cando o conta.","says there was another after that. one who thought the fleets were being wasted on conquest that stopped.":"di que houbo outro despois diso. un que pensaba que as flotas se malgastaban nunha conquista que parou.","says they locked that one up, and they were right to, and everyone agreed, and it held for a long time.":"di que a ese o encarceraron, e fixeron ben en facelo, e todos estiveron de acordo, e aguantou moito tempo.","says this world is the only one that never got a name, and that is why they are all still on it.":"di que este mundo é o único que nunca tivo nome, e por iso todos aínda están nel.","says two of them went anyway.":"di que dous deles foron de todos os xeitos.","says you are doing better at that than most, and that most is not a high bar, and that he means it kindly.":"di que o fas mellor niso ca a maioría, e que a maioría non é un listón moi alto, e que o di con boa intención.","says you cant always trust your memory of where you have been before. take notes.":"di que non sempre podes confiar na túa memoria de onde xa estiveches antes. toma notas.","says you have a reputation. says it is not a bad one yet, and that yet is doing a great deal of work in that sentence.":"di que tes reputación. di que aínda non é mala, e que ese \"aínda\" fai moito traballo nesa frase.","says you have gone so many times the furnace downstairs keeps a book on it.":"di que foches tantas veces que o forno de abaixo leva un rexistro diso.","says you still have time to change what people say. says it will take longer than earning it did.":"di que aínda tes tempo de cambiar o que di a xente. di que levará máis tempo do que levou gañalo.","says you were a good one, doing a thing that should not have been done, extremely well.":"di que foches boa, facendo algo que non debería terse feito, extremadamente ben.","scales":"escamas","scattered teeth":"dentes espallados","scavenge maps":"saquear mapas","scavenger":"preeiro","scavenger had a small camp in the school.":"o preeiro tiña unha pequena base na escola.","scavenger'd been looking for supplies in here, it seems.":"parece que o preeiro estivo aquí buscando provisións.","scavengers must have gotten to this place already.":"os preeiros xa deberon esquencer este lugar.","scavening wanderers pick over the bodies on an old battlefield. a wanderer finds a dead human in shining armor. they are disappointed they can't use the armor because it only has two arms.":"andarilos saqueadores rebuscan entre os corpos nun vello campo de batalla. un andarilo atopa un humano morto cunha armadura brillante. decepciónanse por non poder usar a armadura porque só ten dous brazos.","scoff at her weakness":"mofarse da súa debilidade","score for this game: {0}":"puntos desta partida: {0}","scout":"scout","scrap plating":"blindaxe de chatarra","scrape the rim":"raspar o bordo","scraps of copper wire litter the floor.":"anacos de fío de cobre cobren o chan.","scraps of fur":"restos de pel","scraps of iron":"anacos de ferro","scratched into the underside of the rock, where somebody lying exactly here would see it, there is a line of marks.":"gravada na cara oculta da rocha, onde alguén deitado xusto aquí a vería, hai unha ringleira de marcas.","scratched on the underside of the middle stone there is a list of marks in different hands.":"gravada na cara oculta da pedra do medio hai unha lista de marcas de diferentes letras.","scratches on a sloped face, made by someone lying down.":"marcas nunha cara inclinada, feitas por alguén deitado.","scratching noises can be heard from the store room.":"óense ruídos agudos no almacén.","scribe":"escriba","sealed":"selado","sealed at every seam. the counter on the chest goes quiet.":"selado en cada costura. o contador do peito quéase calado.","sealing":"selando","search it":"rexistralo","search the records":"rexistrar os arquivos","searching the bodies yields a few supplies.":"buscando entre os corpos aparecen algunhas provisións.","seated one":"o sentado","security drones still patrol the hallways.":"drons de seguridade aínda patrullan os corredores.","security is even tighter here.":"a seguridade é aínda máis estrita aquí.","see farther":"ver máis lonxe","see to our own dead first":"atender primeiro aos nosos propios mortos","seeing it in their eyes. some fear or resent you. but why?":"véndoo nos seus ollos. algúns témente ou resínteno de ti. pero por que?","self-repair":"autorreparación","send her on":"mandala seguir","sentinel":"sentinela","separate the sick":"separar os enfermos","servos spin up":"os servos arrincan","set the three in the floor":"colocar os tres no chan","sets himself":"colócase","sets itself":"colócase","settings":"axustes","shadow":"sombra","Shadow":"Sombra","shamefully gather goods":"recoller bens vergoñosamente","Share":"Compartir","share a meal":"compartir unha comida","share.":"compartir.","shares what he knows about sneaking before he goes.":"comparte o que aprendeu sobre roubar antes de marchar.","sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make even stronger steel armour for protection.":"dentes afiados, bocas famentas e corazóns violentos desexan sangue. a construtora pode facer armadura de aceiro aínda máis forte para protección.","sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can make stronger iron armour for protection. she likes to see you protected.":"dentes afiados, bocas famentas e corazóns violentos desexan sangue. a construtora pode facer armadura de ferro máis forte para protección. gústalle vela protexida.","sharp teeth, hungry mouths and violent hearts desire blood. builder can stitch together leather armour for protection. she worries about you.":"dentes afiados, bocas famentas e corazóns violentos desexan sangue. a construtora pode coser armadura de coiro para protección. preocúpase por ti.","she asked you not to, and you agreed, and that is the end of it for now.":"pedeuche que non o fixeses, e ti aceptaches, e iso é todo por agora.","she asks how thick the layers were. when you tell her, she goes quiet in the specific way she goes quiet when a number means something to her that it does not mean to you.":"pregunta canto grosas eran as capas. cando lla dis, quéase calada dese xeito particular en que se queda calada cando un número significa para ela algo que non significa para ti.","she asks how you got in. you tell her about the six handprints and she stops what she is doing entirely. says that is not a lock, that is a quorum, and that nobody was ever meant to open that door on their own -- and then does not ask the obvious next question, and you both let her not ask it.":"pregunta como entraches. cóntasllo das seis pegadas de man e ela deixa completamente o que estaba a facer. di que iso non é unha pechadura, é un quórum, e que ninguén tiña que abrir esa porta só -- e logo non fai a seguinte pregunta obvia, e as dúas deixades que non a faga.","she asks if the stars looked right. when you tell her they did not, she nods like that confirms something she already suspected and declines to say what.":"pregunta se as estrelas parecían correctas. cando lle dis que non, asente coma se iso confirmase algo que xa sospeitaba e négase a dicir o que.","she asks what they were like. not what they said -- what they were LIKE. says she has never been sure whether watching is a kindness or the absence of one, and that she has had a long time to decide and has not.":"pregunta como eran. non o que dixeron -- COMO ERAN. di que nunca estivo segura de se observar é unha bondade ou a ausencia dela, e que tivo moito tempo para decidilo e non o fixo.","she asks whether it is over. told that nobody knows what \"it\" is, she says that is the correct answer and seems satisfied by it.":"pregunta se xa rematou. dito que ninguén sabe que é \"iso\", di que esa é a resposta correcta e parece satisfeita con ela.","she asks you to say the charter again, slowly, and mouths the last line along with you the second time. says she did not know anyone had written that down. says somebody should have.":"pídeche que digas a carta de novo, amodo, e move os beizos coa última liña xunto contigo a segunda vez. di que non sabía que alguén escribira iso. di que alguén debería telo feito.","she banks it without being asked, out of habit, before she has even said anything about it. says a fire is the first thing and the last thing, whichever world you are having this argument on.":"atízao sen que llo pidan, por costume, antes sequera de dicir nada sobre iso. di que un lume é a primeira cousa e a última, sexa cal for o mundo no que teñas esta discusión.","she bolts upright and awake.":"érguese de golpe, espertada.","she builds what is asked for and does not argue about it. says only that she has seen a place run this way before, and that she was not one of the people running it.":"constrúe o que lle piden e non discute niso. di só que xa viu un lugar dirixido así antes, e que ela non era unha das persoas que o dirixían.","she checks you over before she says a word, the way she would check a wound. says glass like that does not happen on its own, and that whatever did it to the ground would have done the same to a person standing on it.":"revísate enteira antes de dicir unha soa palabra, do xeito en que revisaría unha ferida. di que un vidro coma ese non aparece por si só, e que o que llo fixo ao chan tería feito o mesmo a unha persoa que estivese de pé nel.","she comes back slowly, the way somebody surfaces rather than wakes.":"volve amodo, do xeito en que alguén sae á superficie no canto de espertar.","she counts them twice, which does not change the number. says she does not know any of their names, and that this is the part she cannot get used to.":"cóntaos dúas veces, o que non cambia o número. di que non coñece ningún dos seus nomes, e que esa é a parte á que non se pode afacer.","she does not argue. she writes something in the book, closes it, and walks.":"non discute. escribe algo no libro, péchao, e marcha.","she does not argue. that is the part worth noticing.":"non discute. esa é a parte que paga a pena notar.","she does not ask if you are alright. she can see that you are not, entirely. says a ship like that does not get built for one purpose, and asks, quietly, which purpose found you.":"non pregunta se estás ben. pode ver que non o estás, non do todo. di que unha nave así non se constrúe para un só propósito, e pregunta, en voz baixa, cal propósito che tocou a ti.","she does not ask what happened out there. she can see most of it. says the wastes kill people on their own without any help from us, and that maybe there is another way, and that she knows how that sounds.":"non pregunta que pasou aí fóra. pode ver a maior parte diso. di que os ermos matan xente por si sós sen ningunha axuda nosa, e que quizais hai outro xeito, e que sabe como soa iso.","she does not explain how she found you. she asks you not to open the door.":"non explica como te atopou. pídeche que non abras a porta.","she does not nod. she looks at the hut, and then at you, and then goes back to work.":"non asente. mira para a cabana, e logo para ti, e logo volve ao traballo.","she does not say i told you so, and you can see what it costs her not to. says she is glad you are standing in front of her and asks nothing else, and you understand that not asking is the kindness.":"non di xa cho dixen, e podes ver o que lle custa non dicilo. di que se alegra de que esteas diante dela e non pregunta nada máis, e entendes que non preguntar é a bondade.","she does not say it unkindly. she goes back to the racks.":"non o di con maldade. volve aos estantes.","she does not say thank you. she does not say anything at all for the first hour of the walk.":"non dá as grazas. non di absolutamente nada durante a primeira hora da camiñada.","she eats, and thanks the village, and has nothing to leave behind but the thanks.":"come, e dá as grazas á vila, e non ten nada que deixar atrás máis cás grazas.","she fails to hide her anger.":"non consegue esconder a súa ira.","she gets the water down and then most of an hour later she can stand.":"bota abaixo a auga e logo, case unha hora despois, xa pode estar de pé.","she gives up what is left in her pack, which is not much, and starts back the way she came.":"entrega o que lle queda na mochila, que non é moito, e volve polo mesmo camiño polo que chegou.","she goes very still when you describe him. says she knows exactly who that is, and what he signed, and that neither of those is the part that matters to her. says he was one of the two who stood up when the sentence was read. she does not say who the other one was.":"quéase moi quieta cando o describes. di que sabe exactamente quen é ese, e que asinou, e que ningunha desas cousas é a parte que lle importa. di que era un dos dous que se ergueron cando se leu a sentenza. non di quen era o outro.","she has been quieter since the huts went up, and it is a better quiet. says she has built for people who were being kept before. says this is not that.":"está máis calada desde que se ergueron as cabanas, e é un silencio mellor. di que construíu para xente que antes estaba retida. di que isto non é iso.","she has been rationing to a schedule she wrote out beforehand. the schedule assumed the water would be where the map said.":"estivo racionando segundo un horario que escribira de antemán. o horario asumía que a auga estaría onde dicía o mapa.","she has been walking east for eleven days on four days of supplies, which she is aware does not work.":"leva once días camiñando cara ao leste con catro días de subministros, algo que sabe que non funciona.","she has been walking since a settlement that she names, and that nobody has heard of, and that she is certain is two days behind her.":"leva camiñando desde un asentamento que nomea, e do que ninguén oíu falar, e que está segura que queda a dous días detrás dela.","she has done something to her hand and has not mentioned it, and has been working one-handed for long enough that you only notice now.":"fíxose algo na man e non o mencionou, e leva traballando cunha soa man tempo dabondo como para que só te decates agora.","she has hurt her hand and said nothing":"fixo dano na man e non dixo nada","she has more than she can use and no way to stop making it.":"ten máis do que pode usar e ningún xeito de deixar de fabricalo.","she has never mentioned being able to do that.<br>you have never seen her do anything like it.":"nunca mencionou que era capaz de facer iso.<br>nunca a viches facer nada semellante.","she hasn't completely escaped the dream. some of the terror remains in her face.":"aínda non escapou de todo do soño. parte do terror permanece na súa cara.","she holds it together long enough. the drives catch.":"aguanta o suficiente. as unidades arrincan.","she is careful with it in a way she is not careful with iron or coal. says she has seen what happens when this is stored wrong, and does not say where.":"ten coidado con iso dun xeito en que non ten coidado co ferro ou o carbón. di que viu o que pasa cando isto se garda mal, e non di onde.","she is doing too much at once and you can see the moment it starts to come apart.":"está a facer demasiado á vez e podes ver o momento en que comeza a desmoroarse.","she is quiet for long enough that you think she is not going to say anything. then: that every name on a stone like that was a person who trusted somebody, once, right up until the point where trusting them was the mistake that killed them.":"quéase calada tanto tempo que pensas que non vai dicir nada. logo: que cada nome nunha pedra coma esa foi unha persoa que confiou en alguén, unha vez, ata o punto en que confiar neles foi o erro que os matou.","she is working eight stations at once and touching none of them.<br>readouts move. locks release. the drives come up.":"está a traballar en oito estacións á vez e non toca ningunha delas.<br>as lecturas móvense. as pechaduras libéranse. as unidades arrincan.","she isn't very talkative and that is fine by you.":"non é moi faladora e por ti ben está.","she leaves three pages behind, torn out at the spine.":"deixa tres páxinas atrás, arrincadas polo lombo.","she lets you do it, which takes longer than the doing.":"déixache facelo, o que leva máis tempo cá propia acción.","she listens to the whole of it without interrupting. says somebody built that, and lived in it, and is not there now. says this rock is mostly other people's endings.":"escoita todo sen interromper. di que alguén construíu iso, e viviu nel, e xa non está alí. di que esta rocha é maiormente os finais doutra xente.","she looks at you for a while longer than is comfortable.":"mírate durante un anaco máis longo do cómodo.","she looks away from you.":"aparta a mirada de ti.","she mentions, without looking up, that her name is Ayla. she does not bring it up again.":"menciona, sen erguer a vista, que se chama Ayla. non o volve mencionar.","she nods like she expected it, and does not write anything.":"asente coma se o esperase, e non escribe nada.","she nods, and does not say anything for a bit, and then says good.":"asente, e non di nada durante un anaco, e logo di ben.","she puts the plans down and does not pick them back up.":"deixa os planos e non os volve coller.","she said kindness is rare here, but appreciated. she heard good things of you as of late.":"dixo que a bondade é rara aquí, pero apreciada. oíu cousas boas de ti últimamente.","she said someone found her hidden water cache and raided it. there was no contigency plan beyond that.":"dixo que alguén atopou a súa reserva de auga escondida e a saqueou. non había plan de continxencia máis alá diso.","she says east was fine for nine days and then stopped being a direction.":"di que o leste estivo ben durante nove días e logo deixou de ser unha dirección.","she says if you knew what she knew, you would be kneeling and holding like her.":"di que se souberas o que ela sabe, estarías axeonllada e aguantando coma ela.","she says if you wait long enough the Infinite Expanse cycle will restart.":"di que se agardas o suficiente o ciclo da Extensión Infinita reiniciarase.","she says it is fine and you agree that it is fine and the subject is closed.":"di que está ben e ti concordas en que está ben e o asunto quédase pechado.","she says it is fine. it is visibly not fine.":"di que está ben. visiblemente non está ben.","she says it is kind kind to ask, but some things are best left unsaid.":"di que é amable preguntalo, pero algunhas cousas é mellor deixalas sen dicir.","she says it is mostly silence where voices and signals once were.":"di que agora é maiormente silencio onde antes había voces e sinais.","she says nothing is east. says she checked.":"di que non hai nada ao leste. di que o comprobou.","she says she is holding. she says holding is the whole of it and there is nothing after holding.":"di que está a aguantar. di que aguantar é todo e que non hai nada despois de aguantar.","she says she is waiting to be told she can stop. she says the order has not been given.":"di que está agardando a que lle digan que pode parar. di que a orde non se deu.","she says she stopped to think and could not work out how to start again. she says it took hours to notice.":"di que parou a pensar e non foi quen de descubrir como comezar de novo. di que lle levou horas decatarse.","she says she was told to wait here and that the person who told her was extremely clear about it.":"di que lle dixeron que agardase aquí e que a persoa que llo dixo foi extremadamente clara ao respecto.","she says the entry is not hers. it was already in the book when the book came to her.":"di que a entrada non é dela. xa estaba no libro cando o libro chegou a ela.","she says the Mysterious Wanderer can answer better than she can.":"di que o Andarilo Misterioso pode responder mellor ca ela.","she says the village is just over there. she gestures at a direction with nothing in it.":"di que a vila está xusto alí. sinala unha dirección onde non hai nada.","she says there are a great many of these. she says she has been walking past them her whole life.":"di que hai moitísimas destas. di que leva pasando ao seu carón toda a vida.","she says there is nothing east, and then corrects herself, and says there is nothing east that stays where it is.":"di que non hai nada ao leste, e logo corríxese, e di que non hai nada ao leste que quede onde está.","she says things that were east disappeared and other things that were east reappeared.":"di que cousas que estaban ao leste desapareceron e outras cousas que estaban ao leste volveron aparecer.","she says whoever wrote it had been here long enough to stop expecting to leave.":"di que quen o escribiu levaba aquí tempo dabondo para deixar de esperar marchar.","she seems confused when you ask as if you should know.":"parece confusa cando preguntas coma se debeses sabelo.","she sees you there staring at her.":"ve que a estás mirando fixamente.","she should be direct and speak up or not speak at all.":"debería ser directa e falar claro ou non falar en absoluto.","she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she screams that the exile doomed us all.":"comeza a falar. está murmurando algo sobre unha guerra. berra que o exiliado nos condenou a todos.","she starts to speak. she is mumbling about a war. she shrieks about human blood on her hands and finally bolts upright and awake.":"comeza a falar. está murmurando algo sobre unha guerra. berra sobre sangue humano nas súas mans e finalmente érguese de golpe, espertada.","she stopped walking a good while before she ran out of anything.":"deixou de camiñar bastante antes de quedarse sen nada.","she takes the fur without counting it and loads you up past what the fur was worth.":"colle a pel sen contala e cárgate máis alá do que a pel valía.","she trades generously":"comercia con xenerosidade","she turns the ore over in both hands before she says anything. says whoever dug this vein meant it to still be findable. says that is a strange thing to plan for, and a stranger thing to be grateful for.":"dá voltas ao mineral entre as dúas mans antes de dicir nada. di que quen escavou esta veta pretendía que aínda se puidese atopar. di que é unha cousa estraña para planificar, e unha cousa aínda máis estraña pola que estar agradecida.","she turns the page. there are forty names on it, in nine hands, and none of them agree.":"pasa a páxina. hai corenta nomes nela, en nove letras, e ningunha delas coincide.","she turns the stone over looking for a mason's mark and finds one, scratched rather than cut.":"dá a volta á pedra buscando unha marca de canteiro e atopa unha, gravada en vez de tallada.","she was coming to terms with the end, and now has to process what comes next.":"estaba a facer as paces co final, e agora ten que asimilar o que vén a continuación.","she writes it down without looking up. asks how long that has been the name.":"escríbeo sen erguer a vista. pregunta desde cando ese é o nome.","shell splits":"a cuncha pártese","shielded":"blindado","Ship":"Nave","shivering human":"humano tremendo","shoot":"disparo","should be able to open it.":"debería poder abrilo.","should cure the meat, or it'll spoil. builder says she can fix something up.":"hai que curar a carne, ou vaise perder. a construtora di que xa artellará algo.","shout and keep going":"berrar e seguir adiante","shuffling noises can be heard from within.":"óense ruídos de arrastre desde dentro.","Sickness":"Enfermidade","siege automaton":"autómata de asedio","sight along the way they face":"apuntar na dirección á que miran","since after the meal, they say, and then cannot agree on which meal.":"desde despois da comida, din, e logo non se poñen de acordo sobre cal comida.","sit and watch it":"sentar e observalo","sit with it":"sentar con iso","siting in silence, ignoring the builder's suffering.":"sentada en silencio, ignorando o sufrimento da construtora.","sitting in silence, ignoring the builder`s suffering.":"sentada en silencio, ignorando o sufrimento da construtora.","sixty-one trips ended at this pile":"sesenta e unha viaxes remataron neste montón","sixty-one.":"sesenta e un.","skitter":"correteo","slash":"coitelada","slave":"escravo","slaves":"escravos","sleep":"durmir","slice":"anaco","slipped past an automated sentry.":"esquivou un sentinela automatizado.","slipped through unnoticed.":"pasou desapercibida.","slot {0}: {1}":"ranura {0}: {1}","slot {0}: empty":"ranura {0}: baleira","slow metabolism":"metabolismo lento","small coffins weigh the heaviest":"os cadaleitos pequenos son os que máis pesan","small sensors in the walls still look to be operational.":"pequenos sensores nos muros aínda parecen operativos.","small weapons cache in a cabinet.":"pequeno arsenal nun armario.","smash it":"esnaquizalo","smokehouse":"afumadoiro","smoldering":"chamea","snarling":"gruñindo","sniper":"francotirador","so are the shelves.":"e tamén os andeis.","so dependent on fire for warmth and life until it takes it away.":"tan dependente do lume para a calor e a vida ata que este a arrebata.","so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>some wanderer ships. some others.<br>sky begins to clear into an endless expanse.":"tantos restos de naves mortas de guerras xa perdidas hai moito.<br>algunhas naves de andarilos. outras non.<br>o ceo comeza a despexarse nunha extensión sen fin.","so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>the sky opens out, and there is nobody aboard but the two of you.":"tantos restos de naves mortas de guerras xa perdidas hai moito.<br>o ceo ábrese, e non hai ninguén a bordo máis ca vós dous.","so they have somewhere to be kept":"para que teñan onde os garden","so they have somewhere to belong":"para que teñan onde pertencer","so what happened to them":"entón que lles pasou","soldier":"soldado","soldiers patrol the perimeter, rifles slung over their shoulders.":"os soldados patrullan o perímetro, cos rifles colgados dos ombros.","some {0} are ill":"algúns {0} están enfermos","some {0} have died":"algúns {0} morreron","some are missing. others are closer than they ought to be.":"faltan algúns. outros están máis preto do que deberían.","some completed explosives in the corner.":"algúns explosivos rematados no recuncho.","some good stuff woven into its nest.":"hai cousas boas enleadas no seu niño.","some medicine abandoned in the drawers.":"hai menciñas abandonadas no caixón.","some of the tracks shift from two feet to crawling and then being dragged away.":"algunhas das pegadas pasan de dous pés a rastrexar e logo a ser arrastradas.","some of the traps have been torn apart.":"algunhas das trampas están desfeitas.","some of them are fixed and will not move. the rest turn under a fingertip.":"algúns deles están fixos e non se moven. o resto xiran baixo a punta dun dedo.","some of them are human. some of them are wanderers. none of them appear to consider this worth remarking on.":"algúns deles son humanos. algúns deles son andarilos. ningún deles parece considerar iso digno de mención.","some of them are not anywhere.":"algúns deles non están en ningures.","some of them are still outside the wall in the morning.":"algúns deles aínda están fóra do muro pola mañá.","some of them have been kneeling long enough that the ground has come up around their knees.":"algúns deles levan axeonllados tanto tempo que o chan subiu arredor dos seus xeonllos.","some of what it protected was worth protecting.":"parte do que protexía merecía a pena protexer.","some part of you wonders whether you escaped at all,<br>or whether this is only the part where you get to leave.":"algunha parte de ti pregúntase se realmente escapaches,<br>ou se isto é só a parte onde che deixan marchar.","some traps have been destroyed":"algunhas trampas foron destruídas","some weird glowing boxes he picked up on his travels.":"unhas caixas brillantes que atopou nas súas viaxes.","some weird metal he picked up on his travels.":"un estraño metal que atopou nas súas viaxes.","some wood is missing.":"falta algunha leña.","somebody built these huts out of a thing that came down here. a long time before anybody in this village did.":"alguén construíu estas cabanas cunha cousa que caeu aquí. moito antes de que ninguén desta vila o fixese.","somebody catalogued what they saw coming and then drew up what a settlement would need to survive it. both answers. they did not choose.":"alguén catalogou o que viu chegar e logo esbozou o que un asentamento necesitaría para sobrevivilo. as dúas respostas. non elixiron.","somebody comes here. regularly. and then goes back the way they came.":"alguén vén aquí. con regularidade. e logo volve polo mesmo camiño polo que chegou.","somebody dug here before. what is left of their kit is folded into the layer they stopped at.":"alguén escavou aquí antes. o que queda do seu equipo está dobrado na capa onde pararon.","somebody else has had this same idea, in this same spot, a great many times.":"algunha outra persoa tivo esta mesma idea, neste mesmo lugar, moitísimas veces.","somebody else's snares, with a catch in them":"lazos doutra persoa, con algo capturado neles","somebody has been at the last panel with a tool. the line about the people already living on those worlds is gouged out, and it was gouged out from the inside, by somebody who was locked in here.":"alguén traballou no último panel cunha ferramenta. a liña sobre a xente que xa vivía neses mundos está arrincada, e foi arrincada desde dentro, por alguén que estaba pechado aquí.","somebody has been comparing something against something older, over and over, for a very long time, and writing down how far it has moved.":"alguén levou comparando algo con algo máis vello, unha e outra vez, durante moitísimo tempo, e anotando canto se moveu.","somebody has been counting the prints":"alguén levaba contando as pegadas","somebody has been watching this sky, in shifts, across more successors than any one people could account for.":"alguén levaba vixiando este ceo, en quendas, a través de máis sucesores dos que un só pobo podería explicar.","somebody has come out this far sixty-one times and put something on this pile, and gone back.":"alguén chegou ata aquí sesenta e unha veces e puxo algo neste montón, e volveu.","somebody has laid a line of stones along the edge of the path, running out towards the flats.":"alguén colocou unha ringleira de pedras ao longo do bordo do camiño, esténdendose cara ás chairas.","somebody has scratched an addition under the carved text, much later and much worse.":"alguén gravou unha adición baixo o texto tallado, moito máis tarde e moito peor.","somebody has waited out this stretch before":"alguén xa agardou este tramo antes","somebody is at the door, out of breath, and does not knock first.":"hai alguén na porta, sen alento, e non chama antes.","somebody is sitting down out on the flats":"hai alguén sentado aí fóra nas chairas","somebody presses a thumb into a handful of it and the print is still there in the morning, perfect.":"alguén presiona un polgar nun puñado diso e a pegada aínda está alí pola mañá, perfecta.","somebody says her name and she does not look up, and the name goes past you before you can hold on to it.":"alguén di o seu nome e ela non ergue a vista, e o nome pasa por diante de ti antes de que o poidas reter.","somebody sealed this from the other side.":"alguén selou isto desde o outro lado.","somebody translated it underneath, a long time after.":"alguén traduciuno por baixo, moito tempo despois.","somebody was held here through a trial":"alguén foi retido aquí durante un xuízo","somebody was held here through a trial. the marks on the floor are a man walking the same four paces for a long time.":"alguén foi retido aquí durante un xuízo. as marcas no chan son un home camiñando os mesmos catro pasos durante moito tempo.","somebody was let out, a long way from here, and this is one of the places that cost.":"alguén foi liberado, moi lonxe de aquí, e este é un dos lugares que custou.","somebody with your hand has signed this stone five times. you are signing it for the first time.":"alguén coa túa letra asinou esta pedra cinco veces. estala asinando por primeira vez.","someone drew a symbol in this cell. it looks like your charms.":"alguén debuxou un símbolo nesta cela. parécese aos teus amuletos.","someone had been stockpiling loot here.":"alguén estivo almacenando provisións aquí.","someone has locked and barricaded the door to this operating theatre.":"alguén bloqueou a porta deste quirófano cunha barricada.","someone in the village has got an old receiver working.":"alguén na vila conseguiu que funcionase un vello receptor.","someone left this. someone with less than this to spare.":"alguén deixou isto. alguén que tiña menos ca isto para dar.","someone throws a stone.":"alguén tira unha pedra.","something answered":"algo respondeu","something came down here hard enough to leave a furrow half a mile long.":"algo caeu aquí con forza dabondo para deixar un sulco de media milla de longo.","something catches fire, and by the time it is noticed there is nothing left to save.":"algo prende lume, e cando se nota xa non queda nada que salvar.","something crosses the corridor ahead, and it is made of light":"algo atravesa o corredor adiante, e está feito de luz","something detaches from the ceiling of the column room.":"algo despréndese do teito da sala de columnas.","something gives, high up, and the shaft goes past very fast.":"algo cede, alto arriba, e o pozo pasa moi rápido.","something has gone up and down this a very great many times.":"algo subiu e baixou por aquí moitísimas veces.","something has settled out of the rain":"algo se depositou coa choiva","something in the back of your mind says to turn back now.":"algo no fondo da túa mente di que deas a volta agora.","something is circling the room":"algo dá voltas pola sala","something is exposed where the sand was stripped":"algo queda exposto onde se retirou a area","something is moving out on the glass":"algo se move aí fóra sobre o vidro","something is walking the perimeter of the room, slowly, and it has been for a while.":"algo percorre o perímetro da sala, amodo, e leva facéndoo un anaco.","something moving up ahead.":"algo se move adiante.","Something Outside":"Algo Fóra","something small and very fast comes along the ceiling.":"algo pequeno e moi rápido move polo teito.","something small breaks cover, quills flared.":"algo pequeno sae do agocho, coas púas erguidas.","something that was standing very still stops standing very still":"algo que estaba moi quieto de pé deixa de estar moi quieto de pé","something the {0} call a feral terror is in among the huts before anyone sees it arrive.":"algo que a {0} chama un terror salvaxe está entre as cabanas antes de que ninguén o vexa chegar.","something the size of the corridor comes down the corridor.":"algo do tamaño do corredor baixa polo corredor.","something unfolds from the mounting and levels itself at you":"algo se despregue desde a montura e apúntache","something very old finishes powering up.":"algo moi vello remata de acenderse.","something wearing a wanderer":"algo levando posto un andarilo","Something Wearing a Wanderer":"Algo Levando Posto un Andarilo","something with three eyes and no mouth is watching, and for once it does not look away.":"algo con tres ollos e ningunha boca está a observar, e por unha vez non aparta a mirada.","something with too many edges is already running at you.":"algo con demasiados bordos xa corre cara a ti.","something's causing a commotion a ways down the road.":"algo está causando unha conmoción no camiño.","something's in the store room":"hai algo no almacén","something's in there.":"hai algo aí.","something's wrong with this robot.":"algo vai mal con este robot.","sometimes it is best not to fight.":"ás veces é mellor non loitar.","sometimes it is best to fight without restraint.":"ás veces é mellor loitar sen contención.","somewhere above the debris cloud, the wanderer fleet hovers. been on this rock too long.":"nalgún lugar por riba da nube de escombros, afástase a frota de errantes. nesta roca xa estiveron demasiado tempo.","somewhere behind the wall, a pump cycles, stops, and cycles again.":"nalgures detrás do muro, unha bomba cicla, para, e cicla de novo.","somewhere behind you the rock keeps turning. there is a room on it with a fire in it.<br>you do not look back at it.":"nalgures detrás de ti a rocha segue xirando. hai unha sala nela cun lume dentro.<br>non miras atrás cara a ela.","Sound Available!":"Son Dispoñible!","sound off.":"son apagado.","sound on.":"son acendido.","Space":"Espazo","spare him":"liberalo","sparks cascade from a reactivated power junction, and catch.":"chispas caen en cascada dunha unión de enerxía reactivada, e prenden.","specimen racks, emptied and washed. the labels were peeled off.":"estantes de mostras, baleirados e lavados. as etiquetas foron arrincadas.","spore-choked stag":"cervo afogado en esporas","spores burst":"as esporas estoupan","square in section, exactly, and it stays exactly square.":"cadrado en sección, exactamente, e permanece exactamente cadrado.","squeeze":"colarse","stab":"puñalada","stairs down to sublevel three":"escaleiras cara ao subnivel tres","stairs down to sublevel two":"escaleiras cara ao subnivel dous","stand in the doorway where they can see you":"ficar de pé no van da porta onde te poidan ver","stand there":"quedar de pé alí","stars in the sky":"estrelas no ceo","start clearing the ash":"comezar a retirar a cinsa","starvation sets in":"a fame aséntase","stay a while":"quedar un anaco","stay on this level":"quedar neste nivel","stealthy":"sixiloso","steam":"vapor","steel":"aceiro","steel armour":"armadura de aceiro","steel blades and armor are a defense against the ravages and savages of the wastes. more than that. wanderers once crossed the stars. making steel seems like a step towards the future.":"follas e armaduras de aceiro son unha defensa contra os estragos e os salvaxes dos ermos. e máis ca iso. os andarilos unha vez cruzaron as estrelas. facer aceiro parece un paso cara ao futuro.","steel hut":"cabana de aceiro","steel sword":"espada de aceiro","steel's stronger than iron":"o aceiro é máis forte có ferro","steelworker":"aceirista","steelworks":"siderurxia","step back":"dar un paso atrás","step back from the face":"apartarse da parede","step inside, and the machine whirs. muscle and bone reknit. good as new.":"entrar, e a máquina zoa. o músculo e o óso recompóñense. como novo.","stepping off the safe roads into the dark forest where anything can be lurking amongst the trees.":"apartándose das estradas seguras cara ao bosque escuro onde calquera cousa pode agacharse entre as árbores.","sterile and clinical but with an almost organic thrum":"estéril e clínico pero cun zoído case orgánico","still a few drops of water in the old well.":"aínda hai algunhas gotas de auga no pozo vello.","still not knowing what the nightmares are about.":"aínda sen saber de que van os pesadelos.","still this feels needlessly impious.":"aínda así isto parece innecesariamente impío.","still time to rescue a few supplies.":"aínda hai tempo para rescatar algunhas provisións.","still, some things can be found.":"aínda así, pódense atopar algunhas cousas.","still, was it worth more than a life?":"aínda así, valía máis ca unha vida?","stillsuit":"traxe destilador","stim":"estimulante","stinging":"picando","stoke fire":"atizar lume","stolen wanderer tech, the mech warrior blasts across the fields.":"con tecnoloxía roubada de andarilos, o guerreiro mecánico arrasa polos campos.","stop him":"paralo","stores":"almacén","straining":"esforzándose","strange noises can be heard through the walls":"óense ruídos estraños a través das paredes","strange scales":"escamas estrañas","strange.":"estraño.","Stratosphere":"Estratosfera","street above the subway platform is blown away.":"a rúa que hai por riba da plataforma do metro está destruída.","strips of meat are hung up to dry in this ward.":"tiras de carne colgan a secar nesta sala.","strips of meat hang drying by the side of the street.":"tiras de carne colgan a secar nun lado da rúa.","strong, sharp and lethal.":"forte, afiado e letal.","stun":"atordar","stunned":"aparvado","sublevel {0}":"subnivel {0}","sublevel one. the lights come on a corridor at a time, ahead of you.":"subnivel un. as luces acéndense un corredor de cada vez, adiante túa.","sublevel three. nothing down here is lit until you are already in it.":"subnivel tres. nada aquí abaixo está iluminado ata que xa estás dentro.","sublevel two. colder. the filtration is louder down here.":"subnivel dous. máis frío. a filtración é máis ruidosa aquí abaixo.","substrate":"substrato","sufferers are healed":"os doentes sanaron","sufferers are left to die":"os doentes son abandonados á morte","sulphur":"xofre","sulphur mine":"mina de xofre","sulphur miner":"mineiro de xofre","Sulphur&nbsp;Mine":"Mina de &nbsp;Xofre","supplies":"subministros","supplies are lost to the wind":"os subministros pérdense co vento","supplies:":"provisións:","surgical tools are scattered on the floor, near what appears the be the remains of a fire.":"ferramentas cirúrxicas están espalladas polo chan, preto do que parecen ser os restos dun lume.","sustained":"sostido","sweating":"suando","swelling":"inchando","swing":"corte","sword is sharp. good protection out in the wilds.":"a espada está afiada. boa protección para saír á aventura.","take":"coller","take a share and rebury the rest":"coller unha parte e volver soterrar o resto","take all four":"coller os catro","take all of it":"collelo todo","take all you can":"coller todo o que se poida","take device and leave":"coller o dispositivo e marchar","take everything":"collelo todo","take her at her word":"crela na súa palabra","take her maps":"coller os seus mapas","take his bags":"coller as súas bolsas","take in both":"acoller aos dous","take in the ones with iron":"acoller aos que teñen ferro","take in the ones with the lamp":"acoller aos que teñen o candil","take it inside":"levalo para dentro","take the core":"coller o núcleo","take the ingot":"coller o lingote","take the instrument":"coller o instrumento","take the kit":"coller o equipo","take the offering plate":"coller a bandexa de ofrendas","take the three who can walk":"coller aos tres que poden camiñar","take what is left":"coller o que queda","take what is live":"coller o que está vivo","take what is on it":"coller o que hai enriba","take what is on the outside":"coller o que hai por fóra","take:":"coller:","takes cover":"protéxese","talk":"falar","talk again":"falar de novo","tangle":"aturdimento","tank exposed":"tanque exposto","tanner":"curtidor","tannery":"curtidoiro","tannery goes up quick, on the edge of the village":"o curtidoiro constrúese rápido, no límite da aldea","tattered cloth":"teas raídas","teeth":"dentes","teeth ache at thirty paces.":"os dentes doen a trinta pasos.","tell him to leave":"pedirlle que marche","tend the wounded":"atender aos feridos","thank him":"darlle as grazas","that cannot be right. those glyphs seem to suggest...":"iso non pode ser certo. eses glifos parecen suxerir...","that file is too large to be a save.":"ese ficheiro é demasiado grande para ser unha partida gardada.","that is not nothing. it is the last thing on this world that four peoples built together and it is still running.":"iso non é pouca cousa. é a última cousa neste mundo que catro pobos construíron xuntos e aínda funciona.","that is why you came here. not to free them. to ask them whether it was still true.":"por iso viñeches aquí. non para liberalos. para preguntarlles se aínda era certo.","that save could not be read. nothing has been changed.":"esa partida gardada non se puido ler. non se cambiou nada.","that save data could not be read.":"eses datos de partida gardada non se puideron ler.","the {0} hang the thief high in front of the store room.":"a {0} colga o ladrón ben alto diante do almacén.","the {0} retreat to mourn the dead.":"a {0} retírase para chorar aos mortos.","the {0} take their boots, and their belts, and their ammunition.":"a {0} colle as súas botas, e os seus cintos, e a súa munición.","the afternoon, they say. they are quite certain.":"a tardiña, din. están bastante seguros.","the air coming out of it is not exhaust. it is what a very large machine breathes out when it has been left running.":"o aire que sae del non é escape. é o que exhala unha máquina moi grande cando se deixou en marcha.","the air coming up is cold and clean and has been filtered by something that still works.":"o aire que sobe é frío e limpo e foi filtrado por algo que aínda funciona.","the air coming up is old in a way the rest of this place is not. nothing has breathed it.":"o aire que sobe é vello dun xeito en que o resto deste lugar non o é. nada o respirou.","the air down here is doing something to you.":"o aire aquí abaixo estache a facer algo.","the air down here tastes of pennies. it is the same taste as the wreck out on the road.":"o aire aquí abaixo sabe a moedas. é o mesmo sabor có dos restos da estrada.","the air in this room has a metallic tinge. floor is covered in dark powder.":"o aire nesta sala ten un matiz metálico. o chan está cuberto dun po escuro.","the air is cooler here. low cabinets ring the room, doors dusted with frost.":"o aire está máis fresco aquí. armarios baixos rodean a sala, con portas cubertas de xeada.","the air is filled with dust, driven relentlessly by the hard winds.":"o aire está cheo de pó, movido inexorablemente polos fortes ventos.","the air is running out.":"o aire estase a esgotar.","the air moves. something is still running the filtration.":"o aire móvese. algo aínda mantén a filtración funcionando.","the alcove ahead is empty, and something is already behind you.":"a fornela adiante está baleira, e algo xa está detrás de ti.","the alien bird lays dead at your feet.":"a ave allea xace morta aos teus pés.","the angles are wrong in a way you can feel in your jaw.":"os ángulos están mal dun xeito que podes sentir na queixada.","the aqueduct keeps running for about a minute on what is already in it, and then it does not.":"o acueduto segue correndo durante case un minuto co que xa ten dentro, e logo deixa de facelo.","the ash fires into something like metal":"a cinsa cócese en algo parecido ao metal","the ash holds a shape":"a cinsa mantén unha forma","the ash stops on the third day, as suddenly as it started.":"a cinsa para ao terceiro día, tan de súpeto como comezou.","the automated patient transport system now sits motionless.":"o sistema automatizado de transporte de pacientes está agora inmóbil.","the automaton kneels, and does not get up.":"o autómata axeónllase, e non se ergue.","the bags come off easily. that is because there is nothing in them worth carrying, and he knew that when he set them down.":"as bolsas quítanse con facilidade. iso é porque non teñen nada dentro que merecese a pena cargar, e el sabíao cando as deixou.","the barrels are covered and the water stays clean.":"os barrís están cubertos e a auga mantense limpa.","the barren world is the only one that never got a name":"o mundo estéril é o único que nunca tivo nome","the barrens are marked with roads signifying civilization.":"os ermos están marcados con estradas que sinalan a civilización.","the barrens break at a sea of dying grass, swaying in the arid breeze.":"os páramos rematan nun mar de pastos resecos, abaneando na brisa árida.","the beacon glows a solid blue, and then goes dim. the ship slows.<br>gradually, the vast wanderer homefleet comes into view.<br>massive worldships drift unnaturally through clouds of debris, scarred and dead. no crew respond":"o faro brilla dun azul sólido, e logo escurece. a nave desacelera.<br>gradualmente, a vasta flota nai dos andarilos aparece á vista.<br>naves-mundo masivas derivan de xeito antinatural entre nubes de escombros, marcadas e mortas. ningunha tripulación responde","the beacon pulses gently as the ship glides through space.<br>coordinates are locked.":"o faro pulsa suavemente mentres a nave se desliza polo espazo.<br>coordenadas fixadas.","the beacon pulses. coordinates are locked. the fleet is expecting you.":"o faro pulsa. coordenadas fixadas. a flota agárdate.","the bearing is taken and written down, and the smoke is left standing where it stands.":"tómase o rumbo e anótase, e o fume déixase onde está.","the beast is dead.":"a besta morreu.","the beast is found":"a besta é atopada","The Beggar":"O Mendicante","the beggar does not say thank you.":"o mendicante non dá as grazas.","the beggar expresses his thanks.":"o mendicante di grazas.","The Bitter Night":"A Noite Amarga","The Black Rain":"A Choiva Negra","the blade hums, charged particles sparking and fizzing.":"a folla zoa, con partículas cargadas faiscando e chispeando.","the blast throws the door inwards.":"a explosión bota a porta cara a dentro.","the boards still hold the last thing written on them, and it is not an evacuation order. it is a schedule for dismantling themselves.":"os taboleiros aínda gardan o último escrito neles, e non é unha orde de evacuación. é un calendario para desmantelarse a si mesmos.","the bodies of the wanderers that lived here are still visible in the flames.":"os corpos dos errantes que viviron aquí aínda se distinguen entre as chamas.","the body of a wanderer lies in a small cavern.":"o corpo dun errante xace nunha pequena caverna.","the buckles are done up the way somebody does them when they expect to come back.":"as fibelas están abrochadas do xeito en que alguén as abrocha cando espera volver.","the builder asks what the huts are for":"a construtora pregunta para que son as cabanas","the builder can share when she wants to.":"a construtora pode compartir cando queira.","the builder does not move. she does not reach for anything.":"a construtora non se move. non estende a man cara a nada.","the builder does not reach for anything. she says that whatever it is has already decided, and that we will find out which way when the fire drops.":"a construtora non estende a man cara a nada. di que sexa o que sexa xa decidiu, e que o saberemos cando o lume baixe.","the builder goes back to work without arguing":"a construtora volve ao traballo sen discutir","the builder goes to the controls. all of them.":"a construtora vai aos controis. a todos eles.","the builder has come out into the wastes":"a construtora saíu aos ermos","the builder has followed you through all of it, and you never once asked her to.":"a construtora seguiute a través de todo isto, e nunca lla pediches.","the builder is already sorting the wreckage into what can be saved and what cannot, before you have said anything.":"a construtora xa está a clasificar os restos entre o que se pode salvar e o que non, antes de que digas nada.","the builder is awake late, looking up at the sky. perhaps she is avoiding sleep. she looks longingly at the stars.":"a construtora está esperta ata tarde, mirando cara ao ceo. quizais está evitando durmir. mira as estrelas con anhelo.","the builder is grateful for being woken and escaping that awful dream.":"a construtora está agradecida por espertar e escapar dese pesadelo terrible.","the builder is having another nightmare. she can be heard mumbling in her nightmare. something about how there is no escape, not even in death.":"a construtora está a ter outro pesadelo. óese murmurando no pesadelo. algo sobre que non hai escapatoria, nin sequera na morte.","the builder is having another nightmare. this one seems worse than the last. upon waking she still won't speak about the dream.":"a construtora está a ter outro pesadelo. este parece peor có anterior. ao espertar aínda non quere falar do soño.","the builder is sleeping in the room. she is shaking slightly and mumbling. she is having a nightmare of sorts. screaming 'NO', she wakes herself from her nightmare. she won't speak about the dream.":"a construtora está durmindo na sala. está tremendo lixeiramente e murmurando. está a ter unha especie de pesadelo. berrando 'NON', esperta a si mesma do seu pesadelo. non quere falar do soño.","the builder is trapped in an awful nightmare":"a construtora está atrapada nun pesadelo terrible","the builder looks as if to say something. ":"a construtora parece que vai dicir algo. ","the builder looks at it a while. says nothing hunts with that. says it is hard enough for anyone to stay alive out there without us doing this to each other, and asks whether there has not been enough of it already.":"a construtora mírao un anaco. di que nada caza con iso. di que xa é difícil dabondo para calquera manterse con vida aí fóra sen que nos fagamos isto uns aos outros, e pregunta se non houbo xa dabondo diso.","the builder once said there was no escape, not even in death. this place only has cold, hunger, anger and pain. escape is imperative. somehow.":"a construtora dixo unha vez que non había escapatoria, nin sequera na morte. este lugar só ten frío, fame, ira e dor. escapar é imperativo. dalgún xeito.","the builder puts down what she is holding and goes to the door before you have heard anything.":"a construtora deixa o que ten na man e vai cara á porta antes de que ti oíses nada.","the builder reaches for something around her neck, but nothing is there. she says she forgot that amulet was only there in a former life.":"a construtora estende a man cara a algo ao redor do pescozo, pero non hai nada alí. di que esqueceu que ese amuleto só estaba alí nunha vida anterior.","the builder says it is good to rebuild, to make a safe haven among the wilds.":"a construtora di que é bo reconstruír, facer un refuxio seguro entre as terras salvaxes.","the builder says many empires have come and gone. more will come in time. should a punishment outlive the empire itself?":"a construtora di que moitos imperios chegaron e marcharon. virán máis co tempo. debería un castigo sobrevivir ao propio imperio?","the builder says nothing. the cabin is warm.<br>you drift off to sleep...":"a construtora non di nada. a cabina está quente.<br>quedas a durmir...","the builder says they will tell somebody. she does not say it as a reproach.":"a construtora di que llo dirá a alguén. non o di coma un reproche.","the builder shivers in her sleep even with the fire. the bracing cold cuts right to the bone. was it always this dark and this cold?":"a construtora treme mentres dorme mesmo co lume. o frío xélido corta ata o óso. sempre foi tan escuro e tan frío?","the builder stands looking at your plans for housing.":"a construtora está de pé mirando os teus planos de vivenda.","the builder starts planning for something permanent":"a construtora comeza a planificar algo permanente","the builder starts salting meat. there will be no huts.":"a construtora comeza a salgar carne. non haberá cabanas.","the builder watches you do it and does not comment on how easily it came.":"a construtora obsérvache facelo e non comenta o doado que che resultou.","the builder wonders if they can bring villagers up as a skeleton crew. deep down you know there is even more you could have done.":"a construtora pregúntase se poden traer veciños como tripulación mínima. no fondo sabes que aínda podías ter feito máis.","the builder's voice is in the background, but she isn't speaking. somehow her thoughts can be heard.":"a voz da construtora está de fondo, pero non está a falar. de algún xeito pódense escoitar os seus pensamentos.","the building is cut from one piece of stone and has no windows.":"o edificio está tallado nunha soa peza de pedra e non ten xanelas.","the bundle is gone by morning. so are the noises.":"o feixe desaparece pola mañá. e tamén os ruídos.","the burned-out families are taken in and fed.":"as familias queimadas son acollidas e alimentadas.","the cache is emptied":"a reserva é baleirada","the cache is shared and resealed":"a reserva compártese e reselase","the cairn is stripped":"o monumento de pedras é espoliado","the call":"a chamada","the camp is burned":"o campamento é queimado","the camp is still, save for the crackling of the fires.":"o campo está en silencio, agás polo crepitar das chamas.","the capsule is cold.":"a cápsula está fría.","the carcasses are left where they fell.":"os cadáveres déixanse onde caeron.","the cards are orders. hundreds of them, in the same narrow even hand, all countersigned by the same person.":"as cartas son ordes. centos delas, coa mesma letra estreita e uniforme, todas contraasinadas pola mesma persoa.","the cart is close enough to the fire to have been kindling from the start.":"o carro está preto de máis do lume como para non ter sido leña dende o principio.","The Cartographer":"A Cartógrafa","the cartographer is robbed":"a cartógrafa é asaltada","the cartographer leaves pages behind":"a cartógrafa deixa páxinas atrás","The Cartographer's Mule":"A Mula da Cartógrafa","the case is intact. the bar inside it is still exactly the length. there is nothing left anywhere to check against it.":"a vitrina está intacta. a barra dentro segue tendo exactamente a mesma lonxitude. non queda nada en ningures con que comparala.","the cask holds enough water for longer expeditions":"o barril contén auga abonda para excursións máis longas","the cave narrows a few feet in.":"a cova estréitase uns pasos.","the cell at the end is not built like the others. the others were built to hold somebody in.":"a cela do final non está construída coma as demais. as demais construíronse para reter a alguén dentro.","the cell of the profane":"a cela do profano","the cells are all empty.":"as celas están todas baleiras.","the centre is hotter than the rim in a way that has nothing to do with the sun.":"o centro está máis quente có bordo dun xeito que non ten nada que ver co sol.","the chair is occupied":"a cadeira está ocupada","the chair is the only thing down here built for sitting in.":"a cadeira é a única cousa aquí abaixo feita para sentarse nela.","the chair, seen from the front, is occupied.":"a cadeira, vista de fronte, está ocupada.","the chitinous elk is dead":"o alce quitinoso está morto","the circle is exact":"o círculo é exacto","the climb fails, and the pack pays for it":"a escalada falla, e a mochila páganas","the climb goes badly":"a escalada vai mal","the climb goes clean":"a escalada vai limpa","the clinic has been ransacked.":"a clínica foi saqueada.","The Coal Mine":"A Mina de Carbón","the coal mine is clear of dangers":"a mina de carbón está libre de perigos","the cold comes down overnight":"o frío chega durante a noite","the cold comes down with nowhere to shelter":"o frío chega sen ningún sitio onde refuxiarse","the cold is waited out":"espérase a que pase o frío","the cold lifts on the fourth day. some of the huts stay quiet after it does.":"o frío levanta ao cuarto día. algunhas das cabanas quedan caladas despois diso.","The Cold Snap":"A Vaga de Frío","the cold takes some of the village":"o frío lévase parte da vila","the columns are writing something, very slowly":"as columnas están a escribir algo, moi amodo","the command deck is empty, save for a squat figure sitting motionless in the centre of the room.":"a cuberta de mando está baleira, salvo por unha figura achaparrada sentada inmóbil no centro da sala.","the compass points {0}":"a brúxula sinala {0}","the compass points east":"o compás apunta ao leste","the compass points north":"o compás apunta ao norte","the compass points northeast":"o compás apunta ao nordeste","the compass points northwest":"o compás apunta ao noroeste","the compass points south":"o compás apunta ao sur","the compass points southeast":"o compás apunta ao surleste","the compass points southwest":"o compás apunta ao suroeste","the compass points west":"o compás apunta ao oeste","The Concordance":"A Concordancia","the condenser stops":"o condensador para","the convict now confined to the grave":"o condenado agora confinado á tumba","the convoy can haul mostly everything":"o convoi pode transportar case de todo","the core did not go off":"o núcleo non explotou","the core is alloy, and it is what keeps the water running":"o núcleo é aliaxe, e é o que mantén a auga correndo","the core sits behind a shield that was never meant to be opened by hand. it is alloy, and it is the size of a fist, and it is the reason the water still runs.":"o núcleo está detrás dun escudo que nunca se pretendeu que se abrise a man. é aliaxe, e ten o tamaño dun puño, e é o motivo polo que a auga aínda corre.","the cores are not timber. they are sections of something longer, cut down and reused, and the cut ends are machined.":"os núcleos non son madeira. son seccións de algo máis longo, cortadas e reutilizadas, e os extremos cortados están mecanizados.","the corridor ends at a door carrying a grid of glyphs, lit from behind.":"o corredor remata nunha porta cunha reixa de glifos, iluminada por detrás.","the corridor is eerily silent.":"o corredor está inquietantemente silandeiro.","the corridor is square in section, exactly, and stays exactly square the whole way.":"o corredor é cadrado en sección, exactamente, e permanece exactamente cadrado todo o camiño.","the corridor leads to a bank of elevators, which appear to be functional.":"o corredor leva a unha fileira de ascensores, que parecen funcionais.","the corridor lights ahead of you, one section at a time, coming closer.":"o corredor ilumínase adiante túa, unha sección de cada vez, achegándose.","the corridor opens onto a vast training complex, obstacles and features blackened by real combat.":"o corredor ábrese a un vasto complexo de adestramento, con obstáculos e elementos enegrecidos por combates reais.","the corridor passes through a security checkpoint. the defences are blown apart, ragged edges scorched by laser fire.":"o corredor pasa por un punto de control de seguridade. as defensas están destrozadas, con bordos irregulares chamuscados por disparos láser.","the corridor runs straight, and it only runs one way.":"o corredor esténdese recto, e só vai nunha dirección.","the corridor widens into something that was meant to hold a crowd.":"o corredor ensánchase en algo que se pretendía que acollese unha multitude.","the counter climbs. the suit takes most of it.":"o contador sobe. o traxe absorbe a maior parte.","the counter on the chest climbs the whole way and does not stop climbing.":"o contador do peito sobe todo o camiño e non para de subir.","the counter on the chest picks up the moment the stairwell opens, and keeps climbing. the suit holds.":"o contador do peito acelera no momento en que se abre a escaleira, e segue subindo. o traxe aguanta.","the creature's tortured breathing ceases.":"a respiración torturada da criatura cesa.","the crowd room has one occupant and it has been facing the platform the whole time.":"a sala de multitudes ten un ocupante e leva mirando cara á plataforma todo o tempo.","the crowd surges forward.":"a xente multiplícase de repente.","the crust over the old workings gives way without any warning and the drop is further than it should be.":"a codia sobre as vellas escavacións cede sen ningún aviso e a caída é máis longa do que debería.","the crystal is warm, and it is not warm from the room.":"o cristal está quente, e non é a calor da sala.","the crystal is warm, and something that is not yours goes through you":"o cristal está quente, e algo que non é teu atravésate","the crystal pulses brightly, then goes dark. the assailant shimmers as its shape becomes less defined.":"o cristal pulsa con brillo, e logo escurece. o asaltante brilla mentres a súa forma se volve menos definida.","the cube":"o cubo","the cube crystal":"o cristal cúbico","the cup is dented and the meat has gone hard, and both go in the pack.":"a cunca está abolada e a carne endureceu, e as dúas cousas van á mochila.","the cyborg bear shuts down.":"o oso cíborg apágase.","the dark is occupied and has been for a very long time.":"a escuridade está ocupada e leva así moitísimo tempo.","the darkness is absolute":"a escuridade é total","the date of loss is before the date the stone was cut. somebody put this here for someone they had not lost yet.":"a data de perda é anterior á data en que se tallou a pedra. alguén puxo isto aquí por alguén a quen aínda non perdera.","the dates run for two hundred years and then stop in the middle of a sentence.":"as datas continúan durante douscentos anos e logo paran no medio dunha frase.","the dates stop being dates about four years in and become a number that only goes up.":"as datas deixan de ser datas ao cabo duns catro anos e vólvense un número que só sobe.","the day is waited out":"espérase a que pase o día","the days are spent with burials.":"os enterros enchen os días.","the dead are counted and buried.":"os mortos son contados e enterrados.","the debris is denser here.":"aquí hai máis escombro.","the deepest cell":"a cela máis profunda","the defenses turn. they find the ship.":"as defensas xiran. atopan a nave.","the destruction is uniform and precise.":"a destrución é uniforme e precisa.","the detour costs half a day and the edge stays exactly where it is the entire time.":"o desvío custa medio día e o bordo queda exactamente onde está todo o tempo.","the detour costs the water and most of the afternoon and she is already gone when it is done.":"o desvío custa a auga e case toda a tardiña e ela xa marchou cando remata.","the difference is that this time you already know what it costs to act on it.":"a diferenza é que esta vez xa sabes o que custa actuar segundo iso.","the distance the others keep is new":"a distancia que manteñen os outros é nova","the door does not open":"a porta non se abre","the door does not open so much as stop being there.":"a porta non se abre tanto coma deixa de estar alí.","the door does not open. there is a slot beside it.":"a porta non se abre. hai unha ranura ao seu carón.","the door does not swing. it withdraws, and keeps withdrawing, and the stairs start immediately.":"a porta non xira. retírase, e segue retirándose, e a escaleira comeza de inmediato.","the door hangs open.":"a porta está aberta.","the door has no handle and no seam, and it does not respond to being pushed, struck, or shouted at.":"a porta non ten pomo nin costura, e non responde a que a empurren, a golpeen ou lle berren.","the door is attended, and the attendant has noticed.":"a porta está atendida, e o asistente decatouse.","the door is locked.":"a porta está pechada con chave.","the door is where it was. it has not been opened.":"a porta está onde estaba. non se abriu.","the door to the left is sealed and refuses to open.":"a porta á esquerda está selada e négase a abrirse.","the doors close and keep closing. this place is finished with you.":"as portas péchanse e seguen pechándose. este lugar xa rematou contigo.","the doors do not open. they will not open again.":"as portas non se abren. non se volverán abrir.","the doors stand open. inside, figures move without hurry. some of them are human. some of them are not.":"as portas están abertas. dentro, figuras móvense sen présa. algunhas son humanas. algunhas non o son.","the doorway ahead fills with something that was not standing there.":"o van da porta adiante énchese con algo que non estaba alí de pé.","the doorway goes further than the room":"o van da porta esténdese máis alá da sala","the double doors creak endlessly in the wind.":"as portas dobres renxen sen parar co vento.","the dressed stone runs the whole height of the shaft. it is cut to a tolerance nothing in the village could manage.":"a pedra labrada percorre toda a altura do pozo. está cortada cunha tolerancia que nada na vila podería igualar.","the drone drops out of the air mid-sentence.":"o dron cae do aire a medio dicir unha frase.","the drones go out to recover a sample":"os drons saen a recuperar unha mostra","the drops leave marks on the pack that do not wash off, and the puddles do not reflect anything.":"as pingas deixan marcas na mochila que non se lavan, e as pozas non reflicten nada.","The Dry Stretch":"O Tramo Seco","the earliest entries are barely legible. the most recent are not in any alphabet at all --":"as entradas máis antigas apenas son lexibles. as máis recentes non están en ningún alfabeto en absoluto --","the early pages are a plan. distances, rations, bearings, a departure date.":"as primeiras páxinas son un plan. distancias, racións, rumbos, unha data de saída.","the earth here is split, as if bearing an ancient wound":"hai fendas na terra, coma se tivese unha ferida antiga","the edge goes on last, and it goes on very fine.":"o fío pónselle por último, e pónselle moi fino.","the edge takes the skin off everything it can reach and the water goes almost immediately.":"o fío quítalle a pel a todo o que alcanza e a auga desaparece case de inmediato.","the entire structure may be rotating around you. you are not sure.":"quizais toda a estrutura estea a xirar arredor de ti. non estás segura.","the equipment down here was built to be cleaned quickly.":"o equipamento aquí abaixo construíuse para se limpar rápido.","the exile and the profane":"o exiliado e o profano","the face comes away in sheets. most of what is in it is bone and rust.":"a cara despréndese en láminas. a maior parte do que hai dentro é óso e ferruxe.","The Fall":"A Caída","the fall is short and it is not survivable-looking on the way down.":"a caída é curta e non parece sobrevivible mentres se cae.","the familiar curves of a wanderer vessel rise up out of the dust and ash. ":"as curvas familiares dun vehículo errante érguense entre o pó e a cinza. ","the familiar hum of wanderer machinery coming to life. finally, real tools.":"o zoído familiar da maquinaria de andarilos cobrando vida. por fin, ferramentas de verdade.","the far end of the room":"o extremo oposto da sala","the feral terror is dead":"o terror salvaxe morreu","the fight is short and bloody, but the beasts are repelled.":"a loita é curta e sanguenta, pero as bestas son rexeitadas.","the figure above the door has three eyes and three ears and no mouth, and now it is obvious why.":"a figura enriba da porta ten tres ollos e tres orellas e ningunha boca, e agora é evidente por que.","the fire goes up and the circling stops mid-round, as though something has been recalculated.":"o lume medra e as voltas paran a medio xiro, coma se algo se recalculase.","the fire holds it off":"o lume mantéñoo a raia","the fire is {0}":"o lume {0}","The fire is {0}":"O lume está {0}","the fire is dead. the room is freezing.":"o lume está apagado. a sala está xeada.","the fire is still going when you get back. she was right about that.":"o lume aínda está aceso cando volves. tiña razón niso.","the fire is warm for a long time afterwards.":"o lume mantense quente durante moito tempo despois.","the fire ring was used so many times the stones have gone to glass in places.":"o círculo de lume usouse tantas veces que as pedras se volveron vidro en certos sitios.","the fires are kept small and everybody sleeps in three huts.":"os lumes mantéñense pequenos e todos durmen en tres cabanas.","the fires are kept small. it is not enough, and it is not close to enough.":"os lumes mantéñense pequenos. non abonda, e non se achega a abondar.","the first are carrying iron tools and a dead goat. the second are carrying nothing, and one of them has a lamp that needs no fuel.":"os primeiros cargan con ferramentas de ferro e unha cabra morta. os segundos non cargan con nada, e un deles ten un candil que non precisa combustible.","the first group joins the village":"o primeiro grupo únese á vila","The First Hut":"A Primeira Cabana","the first people conquered and killed":"o primeiro pobo conquistado e asasinado","the first to fall victim, were his own":"os primeiros en caer vítimas foron os seus propios","the flames fill the corridor.":"as chamas enchen o corredor.","the fleet is his now, and it does exactly what it was built to do.":"a flota é súa agora, e fai exactamente o que se construíu para facer.","the floor ahead is not flat, and then it is not floor.":"o chan adiante non é plano, e logo xa non é chan.","the floor is not quite level and never quite the same slope twice.":"o chan non está do todo nivelado e nunca ten exactamente a mesma pendente dúas veces.","the floor is the wall is the ceiling, and the curve never resolves.":"o chan é o muro é o teito, e a curva nunca se resolve.","the floor is warm. not sun-warm. warm from underneath, evenly, everywhere.":"o chan está quente. non quente de sol. quente por debaixo, de xeito uniforme, por todas partes.","the floor is worn in lines, from the doorways to a low platform at the centre.":"o chan está gastado en liñas, desde os vans das portas ata unha plataforma baixa no centro.","the floor of the shaft arrives. so does everything that was in the pack.":"chega o chan do pozo. e tamén todo o que había na mochila.","the floor opens":"o chan ábrese","the food and cloth go with him, which is what they were for.":"a comida e o pano van con el, que era para o que eran.","the footsteps stop.":"os pasos páranse.","the force field holds. the vats go on doing what they do. the monk waits for you to finish, and does not leave first.":"o campo de forza aguanta. as cubas seguen facendo o que fan. o monxe agarda a que remates, e non marcha primeiro.","the forest is silent.":"o bosque está en silencio.","the foundry can hold a charge in a cell now. it takes sulphur, and coal, and people.":"a fundición xa pode almacenar unha carga nunha cela. precisa xofre, e carbón, e xente.","the foundry crew know the shape of a blade that cuts faster than it should.":"a cuadrilla da fundición coñece a forma dunha folla que corta máis rápido do que debería.","the foundry goes up windowless, at the far end of the camp.":"a fundición érguese sen xanelas, no extremo máis afastado do campamento.","the four corridors become four corridors again.":"os catro corredores vólvense catro corredores de novo.","the fourth hand is yours, and it has counted higher than any of the others, and you have no memory of a single night of it.":"a cuarta letra é a túa, e contou máis alto que ningunha das outras, e non tes memoria de ningunha soa noite diso.","the fourth hand under the rock is yours":"a cuarta letra baixo a rocha é a túa","the fourth one he does put away.":"ao cuarto si que o garda.","the fourth pack is sitting upright in the middle of it, buckled, undisturbed.":"a cuarta mochila está de pé no medio, pechada, intacta.","the frames did not burn evenly. the outer timber went and the cores did not.":"as estruturas non arderon de xeito uniforme. a madeira exterior ardeu e os núcleos non.","the furnace is enormous and its log is longer than the one upstairs.":"o forno é enorme e o seu rexistro é máis longo có de arriba.","the gap between the two answers is four hundred and eleven years.":"o intervalo entre as dúas respostas é de catrocentos once anos.","the gaunt human is still. their blood coats you.":"o humano escuálido está inmóbil. o seu sangue cóbrete.","the gauntlets go in to the wrist. they come out marked and intact.":"os guantes métense ata o pulso. saen marcados e intactos.","The Glass Storm":"A Tormenta de Vidro","the glyphs down here are corrections. someone kept revising the same line.":"os glifos aquí abaixo son correccións. alguén seguiu revisando a mesma liña.","the glyphs on the nearest column stop changing.":"os glifos na columna máis próxima deixan de cambiar.","the glyphs settle, and something behind the door disengages.":"os glifos asentan, e algo detrás da porta desactívase.","the grass thrashes wildly as a huge lizard pushes through":"a herba sacúdese e aparece un enorme lagarto","the grasses thin. soon, only dust remains.":"os pastos van rareando. decontado só queda pó.","the grave is robbed":"a tumba é saqueada","the grille has failed on one side. what has been forced up through the gap is worth taking.":"a reixa fallou nun lado. o que se forzou a saír pola fenda paga a pena collelo.","the ground falls away into a bowl of black glass":"o chan desaparece nunha cunca de vidro negro","the ground falls away into a bowl, perfectly round, a mile across.":"o chan desaparece nunha cunca, perfectamente redonda, de máis dunha milla de diámetro.","the ground gives up a little cloth and a handful of teeth. that is all there is. that is all there was ever going to be.":"o chan entrega un anaco de pano e un puñado de dentes. iso é todo o que hai. iso é todo o que ía haber sempre.","the ground gives way into an old shaft":"o chan cede a un vello pozo","the ground has come apart along a fault, and the side of the cut is forty feet of readable history.":"o chan partiuse ao longo dunha falla, e o lado do corte son corenta pés de historia lexible.","the ground here is cracked into plates and there has been nothing green for hours.":"o chan aquí está rachado en placas e non hai nada verde desde hai horas.","the ground is littered with scraps of cloth":"a terra está cuberta de retais de tea","the ground is littered with small scales":"o chan está cuberto de pequenas escamas","the ground is littered with small teeth":"a terra está cuberta de pequenos dentes","the ground opens into a stairwell that goes down further than the light does.":"o chan ábrese a unha escaleira que baixa máis alá de onde chega a luz.","the ground under the edge is scoured to rock on one side and untouched on the other.":"o chan baixo o bordo está desgastado ata a rocha nun lado e intacto no outro.","the guards died at their posts, shot through with superheated plasma.":"os gardas morreron nos seus postos, atravesados por plasma sobrequentado.","the hall closes behind you, and something is walking it with you.":"o corredor péchase detrás de ti, e algo o percorre contigo.","the hall does not have that effect on the way back. it was built to be walked in one direction.":"o corredor non ten ese efecto de volta. construíuse para percorrelo nunha soa dirección.","the hall was built to be walked one way":"o corredor construíuse para percorrelo nunha soa dirección","the hall where a unit of measure was kept":"o corredor onde se gardaba unha unidade de medida","the hand is angry. the cuts are too deep in places and the line runs downhill.":"a letra está enfadada. os cortes son demasiado fondos en certos sitios e a liña vai costa abaixo.","the hand is narrow and very even, and it does not use any alphabet she can read.":"a letra é estreita e moi uniforme, e non usa ningún alfabeto que ela poida ler.","the hand is treated":"a man é tratada","the hare goes still.":"a lebre quéase quieta.","the hatches are all sealed, but the hull is blown out just above the dirt, providing an entrance.":"todas as escotillas están seladas, pero o casco está reventado xusto por riba do chan, ofrecendo unha entrada.","the heading is a crew manifest. the sheet has been reused, and reused, and the names written over each other.":"o encabezado é un manifesto de tripulación. a folla reutilizouse, e reutilizouse, e os nomes escríbense uns sobre outros.","The Heat":"A Calor","the heat climbs and does not level off":"a calor sobe e non se estabiliza","the heat is coming out of the ground":"a calor sae do chan","the heat is pushed through":"a calor é empurrada a través","the holds are further apart than they look and it still goes first time.":"os apoios están máis separados do que parecen e aínda así conségueo á primeira.","the horizon goes the colour of a bruise and then stops being a horizon.":"o horizonte tórnase da cor dun hematoma e logo deixa de ser un horizonte.","the house has been ransacked.":"a casa foi saqueada.","the house is abandoned, but not yet picked over.":"a cousa está abandonada, pero aínda non foi saqueada.","the hull comes apart into black flakes, and they do not reflect anything.":"o casco desfaise en escamas negras, e non reflicten nada.","the hunt goes badly":"a cacería vai mal","the hunting lodge stands in the forest, a ways out of town":"o refuxio de caza está no bosque, lonxe da aldea","the hut frames were built out of something that came down here":"as estruturas das cabanas construíronse con algo que caeu aquí","the huts are fired at both ends, in the night, while it is quiet.":"as cabanas préndenselle lume nos dous extremos, pola noite, mentres está todo tranquilo.","the huts are not going to be built. it is going to be the two of you.":"as cabanas non se van construír. só sodes vós dous.","the immortal wanderer attacks.":"o andarilo inmortal ataca.","the infected huts are burned":"as cabanas infectadas son queimadas","the infinite expanse did not fall over. it was wound down, from this room, by people who could see it going and decided how it would go.":"a extensión infinita non caeu por si soa. foi apagada, desde esta sala, por xente que podía ver como ía acabar e decidiu como acabaría.","the inner room is the size of a cupboard and has been sealed longer than the outer one.":"a sala interior ten o tamaño dun armario e leva selada máis tempo cá exterior.","the inner room opens":"a sala interior ábrese","the instrument is brass, and heavy, and older than it looks.":"o instrumento é de latón, e pesado, e máis vello do que parece.","the interior of the ship is cold and dark. what little light there is only accentuates its harsh angles.":"o interior da nave está frío e escuro. a pouca luz que hai só acentúa os seus ángulos afiados.","The Iron Mine":"A Mina de Ferro","the iron mine is clear of dangers":"a mina de ferro está libre de perigos","the joins are so fine you cannot find them by touch.":"as unións son tan finas que non as atopas ao tacto.","the jump takes. it takes wrong.":"o salto pégase. pégase mal.","the junction does not resolve":"o cruzamento non se resolve","the junction resolves, all at once, into one corridor with something in it.":"o cruzamento resólvese, de golpe, nun só corredor con algo dentro.","the key is not a key. it is a flat disc of the same stone the temple is cut from, and it goes into the recess as though it were made for it, which it was.":"a chave non é unha chave. é un disco plano da mesma pedra da que está feito o templo, e encaixa na cavidade coma se se fixese para ela, que así foi.","the kit is good. the map is worth more than the kit, and it is a map of somewhere else.":"o equipo é bo. o mapa vale máis có equipo, e é un mapa doutro lugar.","The Kneeling Ones":"Os Axeonllados","the kneeling stops at a clean line":"os axeonllados detéñense nunha liña limpa","the lab is empty, but not abandoned. nothing here is dusty.":"o laboratorio está baleiro, pero non abandonado. nada aquí ten po.","the lab opens":"o laboratorio ábrese","the lab stays shut":"o laboratorio permanece pechado","the lamp is still burning. the goat is long eaten. nobody has settled what year it is.":"o candil aínda está aceso. a cabra hai tempo que se comeu. ninguén decidiu que ano é.","the lamp is visible for a long time after the rest of them are not.":"o candil segue visible moito despois de que os demais deixen de estalo.","The Last Camp":"O Último Campamento","the last card is a list of names, and one entry is yours":"a última carta é unha lista de nomes, e unha entrada é a túa","the last card is not an order. it is a list of names, and it has been added to in more than one hand.":"a última carta non é unha orde. é unha lista de nomes, e engadíuselle en máis dunha letra.","The Last Charcutier":"O Último Charcuteiro","the last door has no handle, no hinge and no seam. set into it is a grid of glyphs, lit from behind.":"a última porta non ten pomo, gonzo nin costura. incrustada nela hai unha reixa de glifos, iluminada por detrás.","the last door is visible from here, at the end of a hall built to make it look further away than it is.":"a última porta é visible desde aquí, ao final dun corredor construído para que pareza máis lonxe do que está.","the last dozen scratches are in your hand":"as últimas doce marcas están coa túa letra","the last eleven pages are the same line, written out again each morning: still here. and then it stops mid-page, in the middle of the same line.":"as últimas once páxinas son a mesma liña, escrita de novo cada mañá: aínda aquí. e logo para a medio páxina, no medio da mesma liña.","the last entry is a list of what to leave behind for whoever came next. this prison is on the list. so is the observatory. so is the vein of iron you have been mining.":"a última entrada é unha lista do que deixar atrás para quen viñese despois. este cárcere está na lista. tamén o observatorio. tamén a veta de ferro que estiveches minerando.","the last of the racks is guarded by the thing it was built to hold.":"o último dos estantes está gardado pola cousa para a que se construíu.","the last one he refuses.":"o último négao.","the last one is a withdrawal order for eleven fleets. it was never sent.":"a última é unha orde de retirada para once flotas. nunca se enviou.","the last section is about the alloy. it says the same thing four ways: that it was what everything in the infinite expanse ran on, that nobody here knows how it was made, and that when it is gone it is gone.":"a última sección trata sobre a aliaxe. di o mesmo de catro xeitos: que era o que facía funcionar todo na extensión infinita, que ninguén aquí sabe como se fixo, e que cando se acabe estará acabada.","the last section is your own testimony. you gave it before the trial, and it is one line long, and you have not read it in four hundred centuries.":"a última sección é o teu propio testemuño. déchelo antes do xuízo, e ten unha liña de longo, e non o liches en catrocentos séculos.","the last stairwell. it goes further down than the other two put together.":"a última escaleira. baixa máis alá das outras dúas xuntas.","the last stone has a name scratched into the underside, where it would only be seen by somebody who lifted it.":"a última pedra ten un nome gravado na cara oculta, onde só o vería alguén que a levantase.","the last stone names two":"a última pedra nomea a dous","the last stretch is done wrong, fast, with the pack swinging, and it very nearly does not work.":"o último tramo faise mal, rápido, coa mochila bambaleando, e case non funciona.","the last stretch is not lit":"o último tramo non está iluminado","the last stretch is unlit, and it is the only unlit thing down here.":"o último tramo está a escuras, e é o único aquí abaixo que o está.","the last two walk on":"os dous últimos seguen camiñando","the last upright stone is worn almost smooth. the mark on it is not a distance.":"a última pedra en pé está gastada case ata alisar. a marca nela non é unha distancia.","the layers are too close together":"as capas están demasiado xuntas","the lettering runs off the edge of the stone, as though whoever cut it kept thinking of more to say.":"a letra continúa polo bordo da pedra, coma se quen a tallou seguise pensando en máis que dicir.","the light comes apart and does not reassemble.":"a luz descomponse e non se recompón.","the light from the fire spills from the windows, out into the dark":"a luz do lume sae polas ventás, cara á escuridade","the light has no source. it is simply brighter in here than it was out there.":"a luz non ten fonte. simplemente hai máis luz aquí dentro que a que había alí fóra.","the light in the corridor goes out behind it, section by section.":"a luz no corredor apágase detrás dela, sección por sección.","the light is even everywhere. nothing casts a shadow to steer by.":"a luz é uniforme por todas partes. nada proxecta unha sombra pola que guiarse.","the light stops a long way short of the hull, bends, and goes back the way it came.<br>one station, then another, then the rest of the ring.":"a luz para moito antes de chegar ao casco, dobra, e volve polo mesmo camiño polo que chegou.<br>unha estación, logo outra, logo o resto do anel.","the lights come on a corridor at a time, ahead of you.":"as luces acéndense un corredor de cada vez, adiante túa.","the line breaks eventually. it costs to break it.":"a liña rómpese finalmente. custa romper.","the line does not point anywhere. it does not reach anything. it just stops, and the last stone faces back the way it came.":"a liña non sinala a ningures. non chega a nada. simplemente para, e a última pedra mira cara ao camiño polo que chegou.","the line is cleared. a new one appears":"a liña despéxase. aparece unha nova","the line is one stone longer":"a liña ten unha pedra máis","The Line of Stones":"A Liña de Pedras","the list runs onto the back and down the side. it started a very long time before this.":"a lista continúa no dorso e polo lateral. comezou moitísimo antes disto.","the live one goes into the scrub without looking back. the line is reset and rebaited.":"o vivo desaparece na maleza sen mirar atrás. a liña reiníciase e recébase.","the living find somewhere to sleep.":"os vivos atopan onde durmir.","the lizard is dead":"o lagarto morreu","the lock opens":"a pechadura ábrese","the log does not say what the sample is. it does not need to; whoever kept it already knew.":"o rexistro non di que é a mostra. non fai falta; quen o levaba xa o sabía.","the log is a departure that kept being revised":"o rexistro é unha partida que se revisou unha e outra vez","the lone wanderer sits inside, in a seeming trance.":"o andarilo só está sentado dentro, nunha especie de transo.","the low ground has filled, and what has filled it is not water any more.":"a parte baixa encheuse, e o que a encheu xa non é auga.","the machine attacks, blades whirling.":"a máquina ataca, con follas xirando.","the machines here look unfinished, abandoned by their creator. wires and other scrap are scattered about the work benches.":"as máquinas aquí parecen inacabadas, abandonadas polo seu creador. fíos e outra chatarra están espallados polos bancos de traballo.","the madman has died.":"o tolo morreu.","the man asks whether this is a trick, and has to be told twice that it is not.":"o home pregunta se é unha trampa, e hai que dicirlle dúas veces que non o é.","the man carried lots":"o home cargaba con moito","the man does not say anything at all until he is most of the way to the treeline.":"o home non di absolutamente nada ata que xa está case na liña de árbores.","the man expresses his thanks and hobbles off.":"o man di grazas e marcha.","the man fights back, however dies in the end":"o home defénsese, aínda que morre ao final","the man had very little":"o home tiña moi pouco","the man is thankful.":"o home está agradecido.","the man lays there.":"o home xace alí.","the man says he's grateful. says he won't come around any more.":"o home está agradecido. di que xa non volverá máis.","the man swallows the medicine eagerly":"o home traga a menciña ansioso","the man-eater is dead, whatever it was.":"o devorador de homes está morto, sexa o que fose.","the map rolled into the top of the pack shows a coastline. this world does not have one.":"o mapa enrolado no cume da mochila mostra unha liña de costa. este mundo non ten ningunha.","the map uncovers a bit of the world":"o mapa desvela un cachiño de mundo","the maps are taken. she is left with nothing to sell.":"os mapas son collidos. non lle queda nada que vender.","the mark under the stone is one you make without thinking":"a marca baixo a pedra é unha que fas sen pensar","The Marker":"A Marca","the marker is a fleet loss record":"a marca é un rexistro de perdas de flota","the marker is dug out":"a marca é desenterrada","the marker stays where it was put, by whoever put it there, for whoever it was put there for.":"a marca queda onde a puxeron, por quen a puxese, para quen fose que a puxeron.","the marks are a count, not a distance":"as marcas son un reconto, non unha distancia","the marks are cut in fifties, and the last fifty is closed.":"as marcas están gravadas en grupos de cincuenta, e o último grupo de cincuenta está pechado.","the marks are distances. the line goes further out than anybody in the village has been.":"as marcas son distancias. a liña vai máis alá do que ninguén na vila chegou.","The Master":"O Mestre","the meat gets salted late and some of it is wasted. the hand gets better.":"a carne sálgase tarde e parte dela estrágase. a man mellora.","the meat has run out":"acabouse a carne","the mech warrior has been destroyed.":"o guerreiro mecánico foi destruído.","the medicine goes to the worst of them first, which is the wrong order and the only bearable one.":"a menciña vai primeiro para os máis graves, que é a orde equivocada e a única soportable.","the metallic tang of wanderer afterburner hangs in the air.":"o aroma metálico de errante incinerado permanece no aire.","the middle of the bowl holds a shaft of metal driven straight down, and the whole of it is intact.":"o centro da cunca sostén un eixe de metal cravado recto cara a abaixo, e está enteiro e intacto.","the middle of the bowl is where it went off, and it has not finished going off.":"o centro da cunca é onde estalou, e aínda non rematou de estalar.","the middle pages are the same plan, revised, with a later departure date. then again. then again.":"as páxinas do medio son o mesmo plan, revisado, cunha data de saída posterior. e outra vez. e outra vez.","the military has set up a small camp just inside the ship.":"o exército montou un pequeno campamento xusto dentro da nave.","the military is already set up at the mine's entrance.":"os militares xa están dispostos na entrada da mina.","the military presence has been cleared.":"a presenza militar eliminouse.","the mine is now safe for workers.":"a mina xa é segura para os traballadores.","the monk speaks without speaking":"o monxe fala sen falar","the monk turns because it is turned, not because it chose to.":"o monxe xira porque o xiran, non porque escolla facelo.","the monks do not acknowledge you":"os monxes non te recoñecen","the monks do not intervene":"os monxes non interveñen","the monks do not look up. not one of them.":"os monxes non erguen a vista. nin un só deles.","the monks give food and water":"os monxes dan comida e auga","the monks give you a key":"os monxes dánche unha chave","the monks have a line about somebody weighed down with the weight of the stars, in a prison without walls. you had assumed that was a figure of speech.":"os monxes teñen unha frase sobre alguén pesado co peso das estrelas, nun cárcere sen muros. asumiras que iso era unha figura retórica.","the monks perceive the penitent":"os monxes perciben ao penitente","the monks say what they see":"os monxes din o que ven","the mount comes apart, and what it was standing on is worth more":"a montura desfaise, e o que sostiña vale máis","the mounting bolts give easily. too easily.":"os parafusos de montaxe ceden con facilidade. de máis.","the mouth of the cave is wide and dark.":"a boca da cova é ancha e escura.","the mule does not object. it does not follow, either.":"a mula non se opón. tampouco segue.","the mule is left as it was":"a mula déixase como estaba","the mutant appears relieved in death.":"o mutante parece aliviado na morte.","The Mysterious Wanderer":"O Errante Misterioso","the mysterious wanderer returns, cart piled high with furs.":"a errante misteriosa volve, a carreta vén ata arriba de peles.","the mysterious wanderer returns, cart piled high with wood.":"o errante misterioso volve coa carreta chea ata arriba de leña.","the name goes on the inside of the store room door, where the tallies go.":"o nome vai na parte interior da porta do almacén, onde van os contos.","the name is already on that door four times":"o nome xa está nesa porta catro veces","the name is written on the inside of the store room door, where the tallies go.":"o nome está escrito na parte interior da porta do almacén, onde van os contos.","the name under the last stone is one you know":"o nome baixo a última pedra é un que coñeces","the nest of a large animal lies at the back of the cave.":"o niño dun gran animal xace no fondo da cova.","the newest arrivals are put out in the cold":"os recén chegados quedan fóra co frío","the newest arrivals can wait outside":"os recén chegados poden agardar fóra","the newest ones are cut into the oldest ones because there is no clean rock left to cut.":"as máis novas están gravadas sobre as máis vellas porque xa non queda rocha limpa que gravar.","the next door leads to a ransacked planning room.":"a seguinte porta leva a unha sala de planificación saqueada.","the night is burned through":"a noite arde ata rematar","the night is silent.":"a noite é silenciosa.","the night is spent holding wounds closed instead.":"a noite pásase sostendo feridas pechadas no seu lugar.","the night is walked off":"a noite pásase camiñando","the night takes a toll":"a noite pasa factura","the nightmares are back. they continue to worsen. the nightmare has gripped her. she never speaks about what is happening in her nightmares.":"os pesadelos volveron. seguen empeorando. o pesadelo apoderouse dela. nunca fala do que pasa nos seus pesadelos.","the nightmares are back. they worsen. the nightmare has gripped her. she never speaks about what is happening in her nightmares.":"os pesadelos volveron. empeoran. o pesadelo apoderouse dela. nunca fala do que pasa nos seus pesadelos.","the nights are rent with screams.":"os laios enchen as noites.","the noise draws attention.":"o ruído chama a atención.","the noise from outside changes before anybody comes to tell you what it is.":"o ruído de fóra cambia antes de que ninguén veña dicirche que é.","The Nomad":"O Nómada","the nomad is robbed":"o nómade é asaltado","the offering is left":"a ofrenda déixase","the officer's name is written down":"o nome do oficial queda escrito","the old man had a small cache of interesting items.":"o vello tiña un pequeno alixo de cousas interesantes.","the old tower seems mostly intact.":"a torre vella parece bastante intacta.","the old wanderer has heard what you have been doing":"o vello andarilo oíu o que estiveches a facer","the old wanderer left a trunk behind":"o vello andarilo deixou un baúl atrás","the old wanderer offers a measured compliment":"o vello andarilo ofrece un eloxio mesurado","the old wanderer says your name arrives before you do":"o vello andarilo di que o teu nome chega antes ca ti","the old wanderer says your name comes up, and not well":"o vello andarilo di que o teu nome sae, e non ben","the old wanderer warns you that you have a reputation":"o vello andarilo advírteche de que tes reputación","the old wanderer who stayed the night left a trunk under the cot.":"o vello andarilo que pasou a noite deixou un baúl baixo o catre.","the old wanderer's name is written down":"o nome do vello andarilo queda escrito","the oldest entry in the register is not in any human hand":"a entrada máis vella no rexistro non está en ningunha letra humana","the oldest marks on the peg were not cut by hand":"as marcas máis vellas na estaca non foron talladas a man","the oldest marks underneath are not weathered the same way as the wood around them.":"as marcas máis vellas por debaixo non están desgastadas do mesmo xeito cá madeira arredor delas.","the oldest stone in this row, and the letters have nearly gone.":"a pedra máis vella desta fileira, e as letras case desapareceron.","the one who stayed sits with the one who was carried until the wind gets up.":"o que quedou séntase co que foi cargado ata que se levanta o vento.","the one who was carried does not last the week. the medicine was spent on someone already too far gone.":"o que foi cargado non aguanta a semana. a menciña gastouse en alguén xa demasiado perdido.","the one who was carried is walking inside a fortnight, badly, and then less badly.":"o que foi cargado xa camiña antes de dúas semanas, mal, e logo menos mal.","the one with the lamp does not answer for a while.":"o do candil non responde durante un anaco.","the ones who argued hardest against him last season are arguing for him now.":"os que máis discutían contra el a tempada pasada agora discuten a favor del.","the ones who arrived most recently are put outside the huts, which is the same as a decision about who lives.":"os que chegaron máis recentemente quedan fóra das cabanas, o que equivale a unha decisión sobre quen vive.","the ones who come back come back with less than they left with.":"os que volven, volven con menos do que marcharon.","the only hope is a quick death.":"a única esperanza é unha morte rápida.","the only openings are vent slits, finger-width, and there are not many of them.":"as únicas aberturas son fendas de ventilación, do ancho dun dedo, e non hai moitas.","the operating theatre has a lot of curious equipment.":"o quirófano ten equipamento moi curioso.","the orders are destroyed":"as ordes son destruídas","the other bank is shorter still. it holds the woman who keeps your fire.":"a outra fileira é aínda máis curta. sostén á muller que atende o teu lume.","the other group, asked the same question, gives a different year.":"o outro grupo, preguntado o mesmo, dá un ano diferente.","the other has not come back, and nobody has gone to look, and nobody says why not.":"o outro non volveu, e ninguén foi mirar, e ninguén di por que non.","the other has not come back. the older villager does not seem to think that means what you think it means.":"o outro non volveu. o veciño maior non parece pensar que iso signifique o que ti pensas que significa.","the other has not come back. the older villager says that one is still going, and says it like it is a fact and not a hope.":"o outro non volveu. o veciño maior di que ese aínda segue, e dío coma se fose un feito e non unha esperanza.","the other three stay. they were always going to stay. they just wanted somebody to try.":"os outros tres quedan. sempre ían quedar. só querían que alguén o tentase.","the others do not come. they watch, which is the entire thing they do.":"os outros non veñen. observan, que é o único que fan.","the outer edge cooled fastest. whatever was in the air when it cooled is still in it.":"o bordo exterior arrefriou máis rápido. o que houbese no aire cando arrefriou aínda segue nel.","the owner stands by, stoic.":"o dono permanece en pé, estoico.","the pack catches on the way down and turns the fall into a scrape the whole height of the wall.":"a mochila engánchase de camiño abaixo e converte a caída nunha raiada por toda a altura do muro.","the pack comes up. so does most of the skin off one arm.":"a mochila sobe. e tamén a maior parte da pel dun brazo.","the pack goes under you and you go face-down over it.":"a mochila queda debaixo de ti e ti quedas boca abaixo sobre ela.","the pack goes, and without it the climb is twenty minutes of unpleasantness rather than a question.":"a mochila vaise, e sen ela a escalada son vinte minutos de molestia en vez dunha incerteza.","the pack is destroyed":"a mochila é destruída","the pack is left at the bottom of the shaft":"a mochila déixase no fondo do pozo","the pack is run down before dark, in a dry creek bed.":"a manda é abatida antes do serán, no leito seco dun regato.","the pack knows the ground better than the hunters do.":"a manda coñece o terreo mellor cós cazadores.","the pack of beasts has been put down.":"a manda de bestas foi abatida.","the packing is finished in the wind":"a embalaxe remátase co vento","the packs are full and carefully organised. water, food, spare cloth, all of it usable.":"as mochilas están cheas e coidadosamente organizadas. auga, comida, pano de recambio, todo utilizable.","the packs are gone through":"as mochilas son rexistradas","the packs get filled with numb hands and a great deal of swearing.":"as mochilas énchense con mans entumecidas e moitas verbas malsoantes.","the packs get filled. two of the crew do not get warm again for a week.":"as mochilas énchense. dous da tripulación non volven quentar en toda unha semana.","the panels are a charter of a kind: that the fleets would go outward, that a world with people on it was still a world worth having, that this had all been agreed by people who are not named here.":"os paneis son unha especie de carta fundacional: que as flotas irían cara a fóra, que un mundo con xente nel aínda era un mundo que merecía a pena ter, que todo isto fora acordado por xente que non se nomea aquí.","the partially devoured remains of several wanderers are piled before a dark corridor.":"os restos parcialmente devorados de varios andarilos amoréanse diante dun corredor escuro.","the party is given supplies and moves on":"dánselle subministros ao grupo e segue camiño","the party is turned away":"o grupo é rexeitado","the path leads to an abandoned mine":"o camiño leva a unha mina abandonada","the path to the command bridge is wide, walls adorned with decorative shields.":"o camiño cara á ponte de mando é ancho, con muros adornados con escudos decorativos.","the peak of wanderer weapons technology, sleek and deadly.":"o cumio da tecnoloxía armamentística dos andarilos, elegante e mortal.","the peg has been re-cut so many times it is more notch than peg.":"a estaca cortouse de novo tantas veces que xa é máis muesca ca estaca.","the people back away, avoiding eye contact.":"a xente recúa, evitando o contacto visual.","the people here were broken a long time ago.":"esta xente está rota desde hai moito tempo.","the perfected science of killing.":"a ciencia perfeccionada de matar.","the piece comes free. the walk back out does not happen.":"a peza libérase. a camiñada de volta non chega a acontecer.","the piece comes free. the walk back out happens, slowly, and it is not pleasant, and it happens.":"a peza libérase. a camiñada de volta acontece, amodo, e non é agradable, e acontece.","the pieces are a mix of ancient and modern, as if the whole structure has been partially replaced, over and over, for longer than anyone kept count.":"as pezas son unha mestura de antigo e moderno, coma se toda a estrutura se substituíse parcialmente, unha e outra vez, durante máis tempo do que ninguén levase conta.","the pile is not a marker. it is a tally of trips that ended here.":"o montón non é unha marca. é un reconto de viaxes que remataron aquí.","the place has been swept clean by scavengers.":"os preeiros barreron e limparon este lugar.","the plague is halted, but not everywhere":"a peste é detida, pero non en todas partes","the plague is kept from spreading.":"a praga deixa de propagarse.","the plague rips through the village.":"a praga arrasa a vila.","the plague stops. it does not stop everywhere at once.":"a peste para. non para en todas partes á vez.","the plate holds very little, and what it holds was left by people with less.":"a bandexa sostén moi pouco, e o que sostén foi deixado por xente que tiña menos.","the plate is not for them. it never was.":"a bandexa non é para eles. nunca o foi.","the plates around the wall are an instruction. this bar is the length. every length in the infinite expanse was cut to match this one, and every copy was brought back here and checked against it, and the ones that had drifted were destroyed.":"as placas ao redor do muro son unha instrución. esta barra é a lonxitude. cada lonxitude na extensión infinita cortouse para coincidir con esta, e cada copia trouxérase de volta aquí e comparábase con ela, e as que se desviaran destruíanse.","the platform is not unattended.":"a plataforma non está desatendida.","the point is made. in the next few days, the missing supplies are returned.":"a mensaxe quedou clara. nos días seguintes, as provisións que faltaban devólvense.","the point is made. nobody goes near the store room for a week, including the people who work there.":"a mensaxe queda clara. ninguén se achega ao almacén durante unha semana, incluída a xente que traballa alí.","the point is made. the supplies come back, and so does a great deal of quiet.":"a mensaxe queda clara. os subministros volven, e tamén moito silencio.","the powder is the same colour as the walls, and the walls are missing exactly that much material.":"o po é da mesma cor có dos muros, e aos muros fáltalles exactamente esa cantidade de material.","the prints stop a pace short of the pack, both feet together, as if whoever it was had halted to be told something.":"as pegadas paran un paso antes da mochila, cos dous pés xuntos, coma se quen fose se detivese para que lle dixesen algo.","the prisoners are executed":"os prisioneiros son executados","the prisoners are questioned":"os prisioneiros son interrogados","the prisoners are released":"os prisioneiros son liberados","the profane never raised a hand. not once, in any of it. the file is very clear about that and it is the reason the file exists -- they could not charge them with anything they had done.":"o profano nunca ergueu unha man. nin unha soa vez, en nada disto. o expediente é moi claro niso e por iso existe o expediente -- non puideron acusalo de nada do que fixera.","The Quiet Mile":"A Milla Silandeira","the rack at the end of the hall stands up.":"o estante ao final do corredor érguese.","the rack behind the bulkhead is intact. reaching it means going past the split, and past the split is where it is worst.":"o estante detrás do mamparo está intacto. chegar a el significa pasar a fenda, e máis alá da fenda é onde peor está.","the radiated goat is dead":"a cabra radiada está morta","the rain gets into the food":"a choiva métese na comida","the rain ruins nothing":"a choiva non estraga nada","the ramp track ends at something that has been waiting at the bottom of it.":"a pista da rampla remata en algo que estivo agardando no fondo dela.","the ravenous beast hungers no more.":"a besta voraz xa non ten fame.","the receiver goes quiet on the eighth night and does not start again.":"o receptor cala na oitava noite e non volve arrincar.","the receiver is broken up for parts":"o receptor é desmontado para pezas","the receiver is left where it is, saying its eleven seconds to the roof beams.":"o receptor déixase onde está, dicindo os seus once segundos ás vigas do teito.","the reclusive beast slumps into the foliage.":"a besta reclusa esmorece na follaxe.","the register has forty names for this place":"o rexistro ten corenta nomes para este lugar","the released soldiers return":"os soldados liberados volven","the remaining settlers flee from the violence, their belongings forgotten.":"os colonos que quedan foxen da violencia, esquecendo as súas pertenencias.","the remains of a huge ship are embedded in the earth.":"os restos dunha enorme nave están incrustados na terra.","the remains of a massive battleship lie here, like a silent sealed city.":"os restos dun masivo buque de guerra xacen aquí, coma unha cidade silandeira e selada.","the remains of an old camp sits just inside the cave.":"hai restos dun campamento antigo dentro da cova.","the remains of an old house stand as a monument to simpler times":"os restos dunha casa antiga érguense como un monumento aos tempos máis simples","the residue in the nearest basin stands up out of it.":"o residuo na bacía máis próxima érguese fóra dela.","the rest bury them.":"os demais entérranos.","the rest of the hospital is empty.":"o resto do hospital está baleiro.","The Returning Party":"O Grupo que Volve","the rickety cart will carry more wood from the forest":"a descachada carreta traerá máis leña do bosque","the rim is where the glass is thinnest, and where the things that were caught in it are closest to the surface.":"o bordo é onde o vidro é máis fino, e onde as cousas atrapadas nel están máis preto da superficie.","the rim yields a little":"o bordo cede un pouco","the robbery goes badly":"o roubo vai mal","the rock falls away. the sky goes from blue to black without appearing to change.":"a rocha desaparece. o ceo pasa de azul a negro sen parecer cambiar.","the roll of names is kept on the same slab, added to in four hands, and it stops.":"a lista de nomes mantense na mesma laxe, engadida en catro letras, e para.","the roll of names stops on a date you have seen before":"a lista de nomes para nunha data que xa viches antes","the room behind it is small, and dry, and has been sealed since before anything on this world could have sealed it.":"a sala detrás dela é pequena, e seca, e leva selada desde antes de que nada neste mundo puidese selala.","the room beyond is a storage facility, and it is very large, and almost all of it is in use.":"a sala máis alá é unha instalación de almacenamento, e é moi grande, e case toda ela está en uso.","The room is {0}":"A sala está {0}","the room the expanse was wound down from":"a sala desde a que se apagou a extensión","the ruins of the sparring machine clatter to the ground.":"os restos da máquina de combate caen ao chan con estrondo.","the same rule as the ruins. the same hand cut it.":"a mesma regra cás ruínas. a mesma man o tallou.","the same rule. more of it.":"a mesma regra. máis dela.","the same sentence is read over them, faster the second time, because the room has already stopped listening.":"lense a mesma sentenza sobre eles, máis rápido a segunda vez, porque a sala xa deixou de escoitar.","the same thought arrives that arrives at the wreck, and at the vent, and under the village: none of this was built by anybody who is still here.":"chega o mesmo pensamento que chega nos restos, e na ventilación, e baixo a vila: nada disto o construíu ninguén que aínda estea aquí.","the scavenger will steal no more. what was theirs is now yours.":"o saqueador non roubará máis. o que era seu agora é teu.","The Scout":"A Exploradora","the scout says she's been all over.":"a exploradora di que estivo en todos os sitios.","the scout will not be reporting back.":"o explorador non vai informar.","the scratches are not all the same. the last dozen are cut at an angle, short, by somebody holding the blade the way you hold a blade.":"as marcas non son todas iguais. a última ducia están cortadas en ángulo, curtas, por alguén que suxeitaba a folla do xeito en que ti suxeitas unha folla.","the script on it is narrow and very even. nobody here can read it.":"a escritura nela é estreita e moi uniforme. ninguén aquí a pode ler.","the seal comes away. the note the shed has held for centuries drops, and then stops.":"o selo despréndese. a nota que o barracón mantivo durante séculos cae, e logo para.","the seal on it is genuine. that is the part that does the damage.":"o selo nel é xenuíno. esa é a parte que fai o dano.","the seal would come away. the suit would hold long enough.":"o selo despregaríase. o traxe aguantaría o suficiente.","the sealed pack liner holds. what is inside it is still food.":"o forro selado da mochila aguanta. o que hai dentro aínda é comida.","the second group joins the village":"o segundo grupo únese á vila","the sensible thing is to assume she did.":"o sensato é asumir que si.","the sentry slumps back into the trench it never left.":"o sentinela esmorece de volta na trincheira que nunca deixou.","the shade of a rock and six hours of doing nothing.":"a sombra dunha rocha e seis horas sen facer nada.","The Shady Builder":"O Construtor Sospeitoso","the shady builder builds a hut":"o construtor sospeitoso constrúe unha cabana","the shady builder has made off with your wood":"o construtor sospeitoso escapou coa túa leña","the shaft opens into daylight":"o pozo ábrese á luz do día","the shaft runs level for a long way and the dressed stone never stops.":"o pozo esténdese nivelado durante moito tempo e a pedra labrada non para nunca.","the shaft was cut for somebody taller":"o pozo tallouse para alguén máis alto","the shaft was sealed from the other side":"o pozo foi selado desde o outro lado","the shape in the last alcove opens its eyes, which it does not have.":"a forma na última fornela abre os ollos, que non ten.","the shape thins out and is gone. the sound takes longer.":"a forma adelgázase e desaparece. o son leva máis tempo.","the shed is warm and the note of it has not changed in centuries.":"o barracón está quente e o seu ton non cambiou en séculos.","the shed stays warm. the water keeps coming down off the ridge in dressed stone.":"o barracón permanece quente. a auga segue baixando da crista en pedra labrada.","the sheet is a manifest, written over many times":"a folla é un manifesto, escrito unha e outra vez","the shell cracks open. nothing inside but rust.":"a cuncha racha e ábrese. nada dentro máis ca ferruxe.","the shell of a burned out car blocks the entrance.":"a carrocería dun coche calcinado bloquea a entrada.","the shell of an abandoned hospital looms ahead.":"o casco dun hospital abandonado perfílase máis adiante.","the ship clears the debris field. the controls go dead.<br>something else has them.":"a nave sae do campo de escombros. os controis quedan mortos.<br>outra cousa os ten.","the shivering human is dead":"o humano tremendo está morto","the shot echoes in the empty street.":"o disparo resoa na rúa baleira.","the shout carries a long way out here. she does not move.":"o berro chega lonxe aquí fóra. ela non se move.","the shunning stops for exactly as long as the question takes to answer.":"o desterro para exactamente o tempo que leva responder a pregunta.","the sick are moved to the edge of the village.":"os enfermos trasládanse á beira da vila.","The Sick Man":"O Home Enfermo","the sickness is contained, at a cost":"a enfermidade é contida, a un custo","the sickness is cured in time.":"a enfermidade curouse a tempo.","the sickness spreads through the village.":"a enfermidade espállase pola vila.","The Signal":"O Sinal","the signal is a muster order for a fleet":"o sinal é unha orde de mobilización para unha flota","the signature is his.":"a sinatura é del.","the sky folds over and the firing stops mattering.":"o ceo dóbrase sobre si mesmo e o disparo deixa de importar.","the sky is grey and the wind blows relentlessly":"o ceo está gris e o vento sopra desapiadado","the small military outpost is well supplied.":"o pequeno posto militar está ben provisto.","the small settlement has clearly been burning a while.":"o pequeno asentamento leva ardendo unha temporada.","the smallest are trampled":"os máis pequenos son pisoteados","the smell is stronger here. smoke, and decomposition, and something sweet.":"o cheiro é máis forte aquí. fume, e descomposición, e algo doce.","the smoke is a vent, and something walks a circle around it":"o fume é unha ventilación, e algo camiña en círculo arredor dela","The Snare Line":"A Liña de Lazos","the snare line is reset":"a liña de lazos reiníciase","the snares are emptied":"os lazos son baleirados","the snares are emptied and the line is left sprung and useless.":"os lazos son baleirados e a liña queda disparada e inútil.","the sniper is dead":"o francotirador morreu","the socket is in the exact centre of the wing, on nothing, and the crystal in it is a sphere.":"a cavidade está xusto no centro da ala, sobre nada, e o cristal dentro dela é unha esfera.","the soldier is finally at peace.":"o soldado por fin está en paz.","the soldier steps out from between the buildings, rifle raised.":"o soldado adiántase desde os edificios, co rifle levantado.","the sound of gunfire carries on the wind.":"o son do disparo avanza no vento.","the sound stops for about a mile":"o son para durante case unha milla","the sound stops.":"o son para.","the sounds stop.":"o son detense.","the sphere":"a esfera","the sphere crystal":"o cristal esférico","the spoil burns where it touches":"o refugallo queima onde toca","the stag turns. pale growth has taken most of its head.":"o cervo xira. un crecemento pálido cobriu a maior parte da súa cabeza.","the stair ends in a hall with a ceiling too high to see.":"a escaleira remata nun corredor cun teito demasiado alto para ver.","the stairwell opens onto a landing with three doorways, all of them lit.":"a escaleira ábrese a un patamar con tres vans de porta, todos iluminados.","the stars are not where the maps say":"as estrelas non están onde din os mapas","the stations around the planet find the fleet and open fire.":"as estacións ao redor do planeta atopan a flota e abren lume.","the stations turn. they find the ship. they fire.":"as estacións xiran. atopan a nave. disparan.","the stations turn. they find the ship. they hold there, and do not fire.":"as estacións xiran. atopan a nave. quédanse alí, e non disparan.","the steel is strong, and the blade true.":"o aceiro é resistente, e a folla certeira.","the stench of rot and death fills the operating theatres.":"o tufo a podremia e morte enche os quirófanos.","the steps stop being steps and become a ramp, worn in a single track down the middle.":"os chanzos deixan de ser chanzos e vólvense unha rampla, gastada nunha soa pista polo medio.","the stone goes into the wall of the new hut, script inward, where it will not have to be looked at.":"a pedra colócase no muro da nova cabana, coa escritura cara a dentro, onde non terá que mirarse.","the stone is cut deep and evenly, and somebody paid for that.":"a pedra está gravada fonda e uniformemente, e alguén pagou por iso.","the stone is shared. three names, one date.":"a pedra é compartida. tres nomes, unha data.","the stones go into the path bed, mark side down, and the path is flatter for it.":"as pedras métense no leito do camiño, co lado marcado cara a abaixo, e o camiño queda máis plano por iso.","The Stopped Storm":"A Tormenta Parada","the stores are sealed and still good, which they should not be.":"os almacéns están selados e aínda en bo estado, o que non deberían estar.","the storm has taken a foot of grit off a stretch of ground that has not seen daylight in a long time.":"a tormenta levouse un pé de area dun tramo de terreo que non vía a luz do día desde hai moito.","the storm is not crossed":"a tormenta non se cruza","the storm is turning around something":"a tormenta xira arredor de algo","the storm is walked through, and the suit holds":"atravésase a tormenta camiñando, e o traxe aguanta","the storm passes overhead":"a tormenta pasa por riba","the storm runs on a forty second cycle":"a tormenta funciona nun ciclo de corenta segundos","the storm strips the ground down to something laid in courses":"a tormenta espoliaa o terreo ata algo colocado en fiadas","the storm takes its price in skin":"a tormenta cobra o seu prezo en pel","the stranger in the corner stops shivering. her breathing calms.":"a estraña da esquina deixa de tremer. cálmasalle a respiración.","The stranger is standing by the fire. She says she can help. Says she builds things.":"A descoñecida está de pé xunto ao lume. Di que pode axudar. Di que constrúe cousas.","the stranger shivers, and mumbles quietly. her words are unintelligible.":"a estraña arreguízase e murmura algo inintelixible.","The Strata":"Os Estratos","the street ahead glows with firelight.":"a rúa brilla coas luces do lume.","the streets are empty.":"as rúas están baleiras.","the structure is mostly underground. what is above the surface is a door and forty feet of blank wall.":"a estrutura está maiormente soterrada. o que hai por riba da superficie é unha porta e corenta pés de muro baleiro.","the subject is closed":"o asunto quédase pechado","the suit does not care about the rain. the food underneath you does, and it stays dry.":"ao traxe non lle importa a choiva. á comida que levas debaixo si, e mantense seca.","the suit holds. what gets through is a fraction of what should have.":"o traxe aguanta. o que pasa é unha fracción do que debería.","the suit recycles what it can. it is not comfortable and it is survivable.":"o traxe recicla o que pode. non é cómodo e é sobrevivible.","the suit takes almost all of it. the visor is ruined and everything under it is not.":"o traxe absorbe case todo. a viseira queda destruída e todo o que hai por debaixo non.","The Sulphur Mine":"A Mina de Xofre","the sulphur mine is clear of dangers":"a mina de xofre está libre de perigos","the supplies stay dry":"os subministros mantéñense secos","the surveyor's kit is taken":"o equipo do topógrafo é collido","the survivors are taken in":"os supervivintes son acollidos","the survivors are turned out":"os supervivintes son rexeitados","the telescope defends itself":"o telescopio deféndese","the temperature climbs through the morning and does not level off.":"a temperatura sobe durante toda a mañá e non se estabiliza.","the temperature drops out from under the evening with no warning at all.":"a temperatura cae de golpe pola tardiña sen aviso ningún.","the temperature goes through the floor overnight, with no weather to explain it.":"a temperatura afunde durante a noite, sen ningún tempo que o explique.","the temple casts you out":"o templo bótate fóra","the tentacular horror is defeated.":"o horror tentacular é derrotado.","the tetrahedron":"o tetraedro","the tetrahedron crystal":"o cristal tetraédrico","The Thief":"O Ladrón","the thief takes what he was given and goes":"o ladrón colle o que lle deron e marcha","the thief works off his debt":"o ladrón paga a súa débeda traballando","the thing in the chair stands up after you have gone past it.":"a cousa na cadeira érguese despois de que a pasaches.","the thing in the store room is dead":"a cousa no almacén está morta","the third one goes out a long moment after the other two.":"a terceira apágase un bo anaco despois cás outras dúas.","the thirst becomes unbearable":"a sede resulta insoportable","the three are told they can come in, and the fourth cannot.":"dilles aos tres que poden entrar, e ao cuarto non.","the three go into the floor and sit flush, and nothing happens for long enough that you start to feel foolish.":"os tres méntense no chan e quedan a rentes, e non pasa nada tempo dabondo como para que comeces a sentirte parva.","the three go out in sequence, left to right.":"os tres apáganse en secuencia, de esquerda a dereita.","the three stones are still standing. they will go on saying there is water here for a long time.":"as tres pedras aínda están de pé. seguirán dicindo que hai auga aquí durante moito tempo.","the torch goes out":"o facho apágase","the torch is set in the lee of the pack and burns down to nothing by first light.":"a antorcha colócase ao abrigo da mochila e arde ata nada antes de amencer.","the torch sputters and dies in the damp air":"o facho dubida e morre na humidade do aire","the torchlight casts a flickering glow down the hallway.":"o facho escintila ao avanzar no corredor.","the towers of a decaying city dominate the skyline":"as torres dunha cidade decadente dominan a paisaxe","the towers that haven't crumbled jut from the landscape like the ribcage of some ancient beast.":"as torres que non caeron sobresaen na paisaxe coma o costelar dalgunha besta antiga.","the town lies abandoned, its citizens long dead":"a cidade está abandonada, os cidadáns hai moito que morreron","the town's booming. word does get around.":"a vila prospera. córrese a voz.","the tracks disappear after just a few minutes.":"o rastro desaparece despois duns minutos.","the tracks eventually circle back which makes no sense whatsoever.":"as pegadas acaban por volver en círculo, o que non ten sentido ningún.","the tracks go up to it and do not come away from it in any direction.":"as pegadas chegan ata el e non se afastan del en ningunha dirección.","the tracks lead to a sheer rockface that would be a very difficult climb, even for the six arms of a Wanderer.":"as pegadas levan a unha parede rochosa vertical que sería moi difícil de escalar, mesmo para os seis brazos dun Andarilo.","the tracks stop, and do not continue":"as pegadas paran, e non continúan","the trading post burns, and there is nobody left to trade with until it is rebuilt.":"o posto comercial arde, e non queda ninguén con quen comerciar ata que se reconstrúa.","the trail doubles back on itself twice and then commits to a direction and stops in the open.":"a pista dá dúas voltas sobre si mesma e logo comprométese cunha dirección e para ao raso.","the trail goes half a day out and stops at a flat place with no cover.":"a pista esténdese medio día e para nun lugar chan sen refuxio.","the trail goes nowhere":"a pista non leva a ningures","the trail is gone inside a mile. the ground out here does not hold anything for long.":"a pista desaparece antes de chegar a unha milla. o terreo aquí fóra non conserva nada por moito tempo.","the trail runs straight for hours, which nothing walking on its own does, and then ends.":"a pista continúa recta durante horas, algo que nada que camiñe só fai, e logo remata.","the trees are gone. parched earth and blowing dust are poor replacements.":"xa non hai árbores. só queda terra reseca e area voando.","the trees yield to dry grass. the yellowed brush rustles in the wind.":"as árbores deixan paso á herba seca. as xestas amarelas marmulan no vento.","the trench goes around. it costs a week and a great deal of wood.":"a trincheira rodéao. custa unha semana e moitísima madeira.","the trench is moved around the marker":"a trincheira móvese ao redor da marca","the trench needs to go through where it stands.":"a trincheira ten que pasar por onde está.","the trench waits. the marker waits. it has waited longer than this.":"a trincheira agarda. a marca agarda. levou agardando máis ca isto.","The Trunk":"O Baúl","the trunk goes back under the cot, exactly where it was.":"o baúl volve baixo o catre, exactamente onde estaba.","the trunk is burned":"o baúl é queimado","the trunk is full of unsent orders":"o baúl está cheo de ordes non enviadas","the trunk is gone by the end of the week":"o baúl desaparece antes de rematar a semana","the trunk is set aside. he does not come back for it":"o baúl é gardado. el non volve por el","the tunnel opens up at another platform.":"o túnel ábrese noutra plataforma.","the two groups are four hundred years apart":"os dous grupos están separados por catrocentos anos","the two groups cannot be housed together":"os dous grupos non poden aloxarse xuntos","the uber trap goes up fast -- whatever wanderer part made it better made it burn better too.":"a supertrampa érguese rápido -- sexa cal for a peza de andarilo que a mellorou, tamén a fixo arder mellor.","the vats. the cycle. the fire that goes out every twenty minutes.<br>the wanderer fleet. the profane. the door you opened.":"as cubas. o ciclo. o lume que se apaga cada vinte minutos.<br>a flota de andarilos. o profano. a porta que abriches.","the venomous beast is dead":"a besta velenosa está morta","the vent is being guarded by someone still on duty":"a ventilación está gardada por alguén aínda de servizo","the village":"a vila","the village answers it for six nights, in turns, reading the reply off a scrap of paper.":"a vila respóndelle durante seis noites, por quendas, lendo a resposta dun anaco de papel.","the village builds around it and after a while stops noticing it.":"a vila constrúe ao seu redor e ao cabo dun anaco deixa de notalo.","the village burns through its wood, and everyone lives":"a vila esgota a súa madeira, e todos sobreviven","the village goes back to work. nobody says anything about it, then or afterwards.":"a vila volve ao traballo. ninguén di nada sobre iso, nin daquela nin despois.","the villagers haul a filthy man out of the store room.":"os veciños arrastran a un home zafado fóra do almacén.","the voice is calm, and patient, and has been saying this to nobody for longer than the village has existed.":"a voz é calma, e paciente, e leva dicindo isto a ninguén desde antes de que a vila existise.","the voice on the recording is the old wanderer":"a voz na gravación é a do vello andarilo","the wagon can carry a lot of supplies":"o carro pode cargar moitas provisións","the walk back costs most of the afternoon.":"a camiñada de volta custa case toda a tardiña.","the walk back to the shaft takes what is left of the day, and then there is still a climb.":"a camiñada de volta ao pozo leva o que queda do día, e logo aínda hai unha escalada.","the walk down takes an hour and the glass rings underfoot the whole way.":"a camiñada de baixada leva unha hora e o vidro tinguo baixo os pés todo o camiño.","the walker had stopped before she ran out":"a camiñante xa parara antes de quedarse sen nada","the walker is brought round":"a camiñante é reanimada","the wall opens":"o muro ábrese","the wall reads what is there and finds four fewer hands than it needs.":"o muro le o que hai alí e atopa catro mans menos das que necesita.","the walls are a single piece. no joins, no courses, no tool marks, and no wear where ten thousand years of feet should have worn them.":"os muros son unha soa peza. sen unións, sen fiadas, sen marcas de ferramenta, e sen desgaste onde dez mil anos de pés deberían telos gastado.","the walls are dressed stone below the first few feet. this was a shaft once, and somebody cut it properly.":"os muros son pedra labrada por debaixo dos primeiros pés. isto foi un pozo unha vez, e alguén o cortou como debía.","the walls are missing exactly as much as the basins hold":"aos muros fáltalles exactamente o que sosteñen as bacías","the walls are moist and moss-covered":"as paredes están húmidas e cubertas de musgo","the walls are scorched and melted.":"os muros están chamuscados e fundidos.","the walls are scorched from an old battle.":"os muros están chamuscados dunha antiga batalla.","the walls are still dressed stone. the shaft still runs off level. the choice is the same one it was.":"os muros aínda son pedra labrada. o pozo aínda se desvía do nivel. a elección é a mesma que era.","the walls here were finished by hand. someone cared how this looked.":"os muros aquí acabáronse a man. a alguén importáballe como quedaba isto.","the walls hum faintly.":"os muros zoan levemente.","the walls lean in overhead and meet.":"os muros inclínanse por riba e xúntanse.","the walls lean in overhead and meet. every surface is a triangle and none of them are the same triangle.":"os muros inclínanse por riba e xúntanse. cada superficie é un triángulo e ningún deles é o mesmo triángulo.","the walls of the deep hall are lined with them, and one of them notices.":"os muros do corredor profundo están cheos deles, e un deles decátase.","the walls on both sides come alive at once.":"os muros de ambos os lados cobran vida á vez.","the wanderer leaves, cart loaded with furs":"a errante marcha, o carreta vai cargada de peles","the wanderer leaves, cart loaded with wood":"o errante marcha, a carreta vai cargada de leña","the wanderer takes the charm":"o andarilo colle o amuleto","the wanderer takes the charm and turns it over, and does not put it away.":"o andarilo colle o amuleto e dálle voltas, e non o garda.","the wanderers cut it into the prison when they inherited the prison, which was not the same as being given it.":"os andarilos gravárono no cárcere cando o herdaron, o que non foi o mesmo ca dárllelo.","the warped man lies dead.":"o home deformado xace morto.","the watcher is on the door frame":"a vixiante está no marco da porta","the watcher observes judgement":"a vixiante observa o xuízo","The Water Cache":"A Reserva de Auga","the water in the barrels is solid to the bottom by morning. the barrels are ruined.":"a auga nos barrís está sólida ata o fondo pola mañá. os barrís quedan estragados.","the water is cold. the food is plain and there is exactly enough of it.":"a auga está fría. a comida é sinxela e hai xusto abondo dela.","the water is fouled":"a auga está contaminada","the water is undrinkable for a week and has to be thrown out.":"a auga é imbebible durante unha semana e hai que tirala.","the water keeps running":"a auga segue correndo","the way out is straight up through the rubble and does not require hands.":"a saída é recta cara a arriba a través dos escombros e non require mans.","the webs part, and a grotesque insect lurches forward.":"as teas de araña ábrense, e un insecto grotesco avanza tambaleándose.","the whole fleet comes out somewhere with nothing in it but a weight,<br>and the weight has already got hold of them.":"toda a flota sae nalgures que non ten nada dentro máis ca un peso,<br>e o peso xa se apoderou deles.","the whole structure discharges at once, a shock up both arms and off your feet, and when the light clears the machine has pushed you bodily out onto the gravel.":"toda a estrutura descarga á vez, unha sacudida polos dous brazos e polos pés, e cando a luz se aclara a máquina empuxouche fisicamente cara á grava.","the wild grass ends here to mark where wanderers have paved their path.":"a herba salvaxe remata aquí para marcar onde os andarilos pavimentaron o seu camiño.","the wind changes while the packs are being filled.":"o vento cambia mentres se enchen as mochilas.","the wind howls outside":"o vento zoa fóra","the wind turns":"o vento cambia de dirección","The Wind Turns":"O Vento Cambia","the wing is the cell":"a ala é a cela","the wing the wanderers cut for themselves":"a ala que os andarilos tallaron para si mesmos","the wood has run out":"acabouse a leña","the wood is running out":"queda pouca leña","the wood lasts. the village survives the cold in good order.":"a madeira dura. a vila sobrevive o frío en bo estado.","the word in their mouths is freedom. it is not the right word and every one of them is certain that it is.":"a palabra nos seus beizos é liberdade. non é a palabra correcta e todos e cada un deles están seguros de que si o é.","the work gets done badly":"o traballo faise mal","the workhorse of the wanderer fleet.":"o cabalo de batalla da flota de andarilos.","the workshop goes up with everything in it. it takes the longest to burn and the longest to rebuild.":"o taller arde con todo dentro. é o que máis tarda en arder e o que máis tarda en reconstruír.","the world fades. death escapes you. is there no escape from here":"o mundo esvaece. a morte escápase de ti. non hai escapatoria de aquí","the worldships come into view exactly where they should be, and they are running,<br>and there is not one living soul aboard any of them.":"as naves-mundo aparecen á vista exactamente onde deberían estar, e están en marcha,<br>e non hai nin unha soa alma viva a bordo de ningunha delas.","the worldships come into view exactly where they should be, and this time they are not running empty.<br>there are people on the rails, working, the way a ship is worked when there is a reason to keep it.":"as naves-mundo aparecen á vista exactamente onde deberían estar, e desta vez non están baleiras.<br>hai xente nos raís, traballando, do xeito en que se traballa unha nave cando hai unha razón para mantela.","the wounded are tended":"os feridos son atendidos","the wounds stop closing.":"as feridas deixan de pecharse.","The Wreck":"Os Restos","the wreck is not survived":"non se sobrevive aos restos","the wreck is survived, barely":"sobrevívese aos restos, a duras penas","the young settler was carrying a canvas sack.":"o colono levaba un saco de lona.","The&nbsp;Concordance":"A&nbsp;Concordancia","The&nbsp;Strata":"Os&nbsp;Estratos","The&nbsp;Village":"A&nbsp;Aldea","their cloth has been mended forty or fifty times, in a lot of different thread.":"a súa roupa foi remendada corenta ou cincuenta veces, con moitos fíos diferentes.","their weapons lie on the floor beside them.":"as súas armas xacen no chan ao seu carón.","then asks what the world is called.":"logo pregunta como se chama o mundo.","then it goes. nothing is taken and nothing is broken and neither of you sleeps.":"logo marcha. non se colle nada e non se rompe nada e ningunha das dúas dorme.","then it is gone.":"logo desaparece.","then picks them up again and starts walking, in no particular direction.":"logo cólleas de novo e comeza a camiñar, sen dirección ningunha en particular.","then says: it does not matter. says the fleets came through, and after the fleets came through there was not a home to be from.":"logo di: non importa. di que as flotas pasaron, e despois de que as flotas pasasen xa non había un fogar do que vir.","then says: whatever you are here for, you are further along than you think. keep setting it down.":"logo di: sexa cal for o motivo polo que estás aquí, estás máis avanzada do que pensas. segue deixándoo.","then she offers the assurance that some things should stay in the past":"logo ofrece a garantía de que algunhas cousas deberían quedar no pasado","then the air moves, once, and you are outside, a long way outside, further than the doorway accounts for.":"logo o aire móvese, unha vez, e estás fóra, moi lonxe fóra, máis alá do que o van da porta explica.","then the junction floor withdraws, all of it at once, and there are stairs, and they go down a very long way.":"logo o chan do cruzamento retírase, todo á vez, e hai escaleiras, e baixan moitísimo.","then two of them come up, and one of them stays down there.":"logo dous deles suben, e un deles queda alí abaixo.","there appear to be body-sized drag marks.":"parece que hai marcas de arrastre do tamaño dun corpo.","there appear to be large space stations around the planet.":"parece que hai grandes estacións espaciais ao redor do planeta.","there are a lot of scratches. they have been added one at a time.":"hai moitas marcas. foron engadidas unha de cada vez.","there are better things to do.":"hai cousas mellores que facer.","there are brackets set into the wall at regular intervals, at a height that is wrong for carrying a lamp.":"hai soportes encaixados no muro a intervalos regulares, a unha altura equivocada para levar un candil.","there are dangerous beasts outside. builder can craft bone spears for hunting.":"hai bestas perigosas fóra. a construtora pode fabricar lanzas de óso para cazar.","there are fewer of her than there are of him. she has been more careful, or luckier, or she has simply had less reason to be out where it happens.":"hai menos delas ca del. ela foi máis coidadosa, ou tivo máis sorte, ou simplemente tivo menos motivos para estar onde acontece.","there are figures out on the flat, kneeling, in rows.":"hai figuras aí fóra na chaira, axeonlladas, en fileiras.","there are handholds cut into the wall. they are cut for a hand with more fingers than yours.":"hai apoios tallados no muro. están tallados para unha man con máis dedos cá túa.","there are layers. worked flint near the bottom. above it, iron. above that, plate that took a furnace to roll.":"hai capas. pedra de lume traballada preto do fondo. por riba, ferro. por riba diso, chapa que precisou un forno para laminala.","there are lights on down there. something is still supplying them.":"hai luces acesas aí abaixo. algo aínda as alimenta.","there are more than four hundred uprights.":"hai máis de catrocentos montantes.","there are no corners anywhere in this wing.":"non hai esquinas en ningures desta ala.","there are no corners anywhere in this wing. the floor is the wall is the ceiling and the curve never gives you a straight line to fix on.":"non hai esquinas en ningures desta ala. o chan é o muro é o teito e a curva nunca che dá unha liña recta na que fixarte.","there are no marks. not one. either nobody was held here, or whoever was held here would not give it the satisfaction.":"non hai marcas. nin unha soa. ou ben ninguén foi retido aquí, ou ben quen foi retido aquí non lle deu esa satisfacción.","there are no tracks. the ground is soft enough that there should be.":"non hai pegadas. o chan é brando dabondo como para que as houbese.","there are no walls but that which we make.":"non hai máis muros cós que nós mesmos facemos.","there are none to feed starving mouths":"non hai ningunha para alimentar bocas famentas","there are perhaps a dozen of him. the empties outnumber the full ones and the dust on the racks says the last one was drawn a long time ago.":"quizais hai unha ducia del. os baleiros superan en número aos cheos e o po nos estantes di que o último se sacou hai moito tempo.","there are records, and the records are not a criminal file. they are a transcript, and the transcript is mostly other people.":"hai rexistros, e os rexistros non son un expediente criminal. son unha transcrición, e a transcrición é maiormente outra xente.","there are still supplies inside.":"aínda quedan provisións dentro.","there are subtle carvings of three eyes and three ears.":"hai talladuras sutís de tres ollos e tres orellas.","there are things about her you do not remember and do not understand.<br>you drift off to sleep, in hyperspace...":"hai cousas dela que non lembras e non entendes.<br>quedas a durmir, en hiperespazo...","there are things about her you do not remember and do not understand.<br>you drift off to sleep...":"hai cousas dela que non lembras e non entendes.<br>quedas a durmir...","there are things balanced on the top of it. a tin cup. a bootlace. a twist of dried meat.":"hai cousas en equilibrio no cume. unha cunca de lata. un cordón de bota. un anaco de carne seca.","there are three of them, sitting down, which is the wrong thing to do in this.":"hai tres deles, sentados, o que é o incorrecto para facer nesta situación.","there is a figure a long way off, sitting down, not moving. sitting down out here is how it ends.":"hai unha figura moi ao lonxe, sentada, sen moverse. sentarse aquí fóra é como remata.","there is a hollow under it, lined and sealed and completely empty.":"hai un oco baixo el, revestido e selado e completamente baleiro.","there is a larger world outside these walls, dangerous as it is. wanderers without direction get lost. a compass can point the way in the wilds.":"hai un mundo máis grande fóra destes muros, por perigoso que sexa. os andarilos sen dirección pérdense. unha brúxula pode sinalar o camiño nas terras salvaxes.","there is a larger world outside these walls, dangerous as it is. wanderers without direction get lost. a compass can point the way in the wilds. the old compass is dented and dusty, but it looks to work.":"hai un mundo máis grande fóra destes muros, por perigoso que sexa. os andarilos sen dirección pérdense. unha brúxula pode sinalar o camiño nas terras salvaxes. a vella brúxula está abolada e empoeirada, pero parece funcionar.","there is a log, kept daily in a small hand, and it runs for eleven years.":"hai un rexistro, levado a diario cunha letra pequena, e continúa durante once anos.","there is a mark cut into the peg of the first snare. it is not a maker's mark.":"hai unha marca gravada na estaca do primeiro lazo. non é unha marca de fabricante.","there is a name scratched at head height and then scratched out, thoroughly, by the same hand.":"hai un nome gravado á altura da cabeza e logo borrado, a fondo, pola mesma man.","there is a new layout, would you like to use it?":"hai un novo deseño, queres usalo?","there is a projectile at the centre, half-sunk, and whatever was supposed to happen to it never did.":"hai un proxectil no centro, medio afundido, e o que se supoñía que lle ía pasar nunca pasou.","there is a rack. on it sits an ingot, and beside the ingot a crystal the colour of nothing in particular.":"hai un estante. nel repousa un lingote, e xunto ao lingote un cristal da cor de nada en particular.","there is a recess beside it, shaped for something you do not have.":"hai unha cavidade ao seu carón, con forma para algo que non tes.","there is a rhythm in it, underneath the noise, too slow to be weather and too regular to be anything else out here.":"hai un ritmo nel, por baixo do ruído, demasiado lento para ser tempo atmosférico e demasiado regular para ser calquera outra cousa aquí fóra.","there is a route through it now. you did not work it out so much as stop having to.":"agora hai unha ruta a través del. non a descubriches tanto coma deixaches de ter que facelo.","there is a shiba inu inside it. it is sitting in front of a bank of equipment<br>that is very obviously the thing that has been running all of this.":"hai un shiba inu dentro. está sentado diante dunha fileira de equipamento<br>que evidentemente é o que estivo a facer funcionar todo isto.","there is a skin on it, and under the skin something has come out of solution and settled.":"ten unha capa por riba, e por baixo da capa algo saíu de disolución e asentou.","there is a smile, only half-forced.":"hai un sorriso, só medio forzado.","there is a storm ahead, and it is not moving.":"hai unha tormenta adiante, e non se move.","there is a track worn to the ring and around it, walked flat, going nowhere else.":"hai unha pista gastada ata o anel e ao seu redor, aplanada de tanto camiñar, sen ir a ningures máis.","there is a word in the margin in your handwriting":"hai unha palabra na marxe coa túa letra","there is an offering plate near the door, and nobody is watching it.":"hai unha bandexa de ofrendas preto da porta, e ninguén a vixía.","there is another door behind the rack":"hai outra porta detrás do estante","there is another way":"hai outro camiño","there is enough for most of the huts. the arithmetic of which most is done quickly and not out loud.":"hai dabondo para a maioría das cabanas. a aritmética de cal maioría faise rápido e non en voz alta.","there is enough here for forty people. there is nobody here but her.":"hai dabondo aquí para corenta persoas. non hai ninguén aquí máis ca ela.","there is enough time to take all of it.":"hai tempo dabondo para collelo todo.","there is firewood stacked against the door, cut short enough for this stove specifically.":"hai leña amoreada contra a porta, cortada suficientemente curta para esta cociña en concreto.","there is less standing than there was":"queda menos en pé do que había","there is no cell in this wing. the wing is the cell.":"non hai cela nesta ala. a ala é a cela.","there is no cover within an hour of here.":"non hai refuxio nunha hora ao redor de aquí.","there is no dust on the threshold. something still uses this.":"non hai po no limiar. algo aínda usa isto.","there is no fire to light.":"non hai lume que acender.","there is no middle reached. there is a turning back, and a long crawl, and coming out on the same side that was entered.":"non se chega a ningún medio. hai unha volta atrás, e un longo arrastre, e saír polo mesmo lado por onde se entrou.","there is no more water":"xa non queda auga","there is no name on it. it was put here for whoever needed it, by somebody who did not.":"non ten nome. foi posto aquí para quen o precisase, por alguén que non o precisaba.","there is no rack. everything is simply stacked on the floor, as if whoever left it was in a hurry, four hundred centuries ago.":"non hai estante. todo está simplemente amoreado no chan, coma se quen o deixou tivese présa, hai catrocentos séculos.","there is no shelter on this stretch and no wood worth the name. the wind comes across flat ground and does not slow down for anything.":"non hai refuxio neste tramo nin madeira digna dese nome. o vento chega a través de terreo chan e non desacelera por nada.","there is no time to evade.":"non hai tempo para esquivar.","there is no way in from here. by tomorrow the wind will have covered it again.":"non hai xeito de entrar desde aquí. para mañá o vento xa o volverá ter cuberto.","there is no way to tell from this distance whether she heard it.":"non hai xeito de saber a esta distancia se ela o escoitou.","there is nobody else here to take the work off her. that was the arrangement.":"non hai ninguén máis aquí para quitarlle o traballo. ese era o acordo.","there is nobody here. there is no sign of a fight, and no sign of anybody leaving in a hurry either.":"non hai ninguén aquí. non hai sinal de loita, nin sinal de que ninguén marchase con présa tampouco.","there is not enough burning in the village to keep everyone in it.":"non hai lume dabondo na vila para manter a todos nela.","there is not much clean wood left on that door. the name is already there, four times, in the same hand as the fifth.":"xa non queda moita madeira limpa nesa porta. o nome xa está alí, catro veces, coa mesma letra ca a quinta.","there is nothing between you and it.":"non hai nada entre ti e iso.","there is nothing down there. it comes on before the climb back out is finished: the taste of metal, and then the rest of it.":"non hai nada aí abaixo. chega antes de rematar de subir de novo: o sabor a metal, e logo o resto diso.","there is nothing else here.":"aquí non hai nada máis.","there is nothing else in the memory. no sound, no other person, no before or after. just this room, from inside, for what the memory insists was a very long time.":"non hai nada máis no recordo. sen son, sen outra persoa, sen antes nin despois. só esta sala, desde dentro, durante o que o recordo insiste que foi moitísimo tempo.","there is nothing in it now. it is warm.":"non hai nada nel agora. está quente.","there is nothing left to do for a while, and nowhere left to go, and nothing left to reach for.":"non queda nada que facer durante un tempo, nin ningures a onde ir, nin nada que alcanzar.","there is nothing on him worth five bullets":"non ten nada que merecese cinco balas","there is nothing to do here that does anybody any good, and it takes a while to do it.":"non hai nada que facer aquí que lle faga ben a ninguén, e leva un anaco facelo.","there is nothing to mark the spot afterwards, which was the idea.":"non queda nada que marque o lugar despois, que era a idea.","there is nothing under it, and the ground below has never been broken. the marker was set, not buried.":"non hai nada debaixo, e o chan por baixo nunca se removeu. a marca colocouse, non se enterrou.","there is nothing under it. no box, no bones, no ash.":"non hai nada debaixo. sen caixa, sen ósos, sen cinsa.","there is nowhere on this path that is closer to anywhere than here is.":"non hai ningún punto neste camiño máis preto de ningures do que aquí.","there is one line on the wall, low down, where you would only see it sitting on the floor: HE DID NOT ASK ME TO. I KNOW HE DID NOT ASK ME TO.":"hai unha liña no muro, moi abaixo, onde só a verías sentada no chan: EL NON MO PEDIU. SEI QUE EL NON MO PEDIU.","there is one more crystal":"hai un cristal máis","there is one set of prints in and none out, and the ground is soft enough that there would be.":"hai un conxunto de pegadas de entrada e ningunha de saída, e o chan é brando dabondo como para que as houbese.","there is only time to touch one of them.":"só hai tempo para tocar un deles.","there is somebody behind you":"hai alguén detrás de ti","there is somebody standing behind you. she has been standing there for a while.":"hai alguén de pé detrás de ti. leva alí de pé un anaco.","there is something carved by the well":"hai algo tallado xunto ao pozo","there is something else out here.<br>rings of it, vast and old, held close around the planet.":"hai algo máis aquí fóra.<br>aneis del, vastos e vellos, mantidos preto do planeta.","there is stock stacked against one wall, sealed, and the seals have held.":"hai existencias amoreadas contra un muro, seladas, e os selos aguantaron.","there was a sound behind you and then suddenly nothing.":"houbo un son detrás de ti e logo, de súpeto, nada.","there was no fighting here.":"non houbo loita aquí.","there was no one to raise an alarm, and no one else it could have spread to.":"non había ninguén para dar a alarma, e ninguén máis a quen se puidese estender.","there was nothing inside it":"non había nada dentro","there were humans on most of them. some of them fought. afterwards, some of them worked our ground and were called something other than slaves, and the word we used made it easier.":"había humanos na maioría delas. algúns loitaron. despois, algúns traballaron a nosa terra e chamábanse algo diferente de escravos, e a palabra que usabamos facíao máis doado.","there's not much, but some useful things can still be found.":"non queda moito, pero aínda se poden atopar cousas útiles.","there's nothing else here.":"aquí non queda nada máis.","Thermosphere":"Termosfera","they answer readily. they have been waiting a long time for someone to ask.":"responden de contado. levan moito tempo agardando a que alguén preguntase.","they are aimed down. at the ground. at the room.<br>maybe this is why the builder seemed resigned to staying.":"apuntan cara a abaixo. cara ao chan. cara á sala.<br>quizais por iso a construtora parecía resignada a quedar.","they are aimed down. at the ground. at the room.<br>the builder never mentioned them. the builder never prepared you for this.":"apuntan cara a abaixo. cara ao chan. cara á sala.<br>a construtora nunca os mencionou. a construtora nunca te preparou para isto.","they are all facing the same distant point":"todos miran cara ao mesmo punto distante","they are all pointed at the same thing, and whatever it is, they got as close to it as they were willing to.":"todos apuntan cara á mesma cousa, e sexa o que sexa, achegáronse a el tanto como quixeron.","they are all withdrawals. every one. pull back, hold position, do not engage, wait for me.":"son todas retiradas. cada unha delas. recuar, manter posición, non trabar combate, agardar por min.","they are asked how far. the one doing the carrying says \"not far now\", and has clearly been saying that for a while.":"preguntánselles canto falta. o que carga di \"xa non falta moito\", e claramente leva dicindo iso un anaco.","they are asked where they are going and give a name that is not a place anybody here has heard of.":"preguntánselles a onde van e dan un nome que non é un lugar do que ninguén aquí oíse falar.","they are asking to come in. the one being carried is not asking anything.":"están pedindo entrar. o que está a ser cargado non pide nada.","they are beaten back. they were not well armed and they knew the ground better than we did.":"son rexeitados. non estaban ben armados e coñecían o terreo mellor ca nós.","they are certain of this. they name a year to prove it. it is not this year.":"están seguros diso. nomean un ano para probalo. non é este ano.","they are driven off. nobody is comfortable about how coordinated it was.":"son afastados. a ninguén lle resulta cómodo o coordinado que estaba.","they are good workers and they are grateful, and they eat a great deal.":"son bos traballadores e están agradecidos, e comen moitísimo.","they are looking for drift. degradation. changes between one sample and the next.":"están a buscar desviación. degradación. cambios entre unha mostra e a seguinte.","they are not aimed outward.<br>nothing out here was ever what they were built to stop.":"non apuntan cara a fóra.<br>nada aquí fóra foi nunca o que se construíron para deter.","they are not aimed outward.<br>they are aimed down. at the ground. at the room.":"non apuntan cara a fóra.<br>apuntan cara a abaixo. cara ao chan. cara á sala.","they are not carved. they are lit from inside the material, and they change while you watch, slowly.":"non están tallados. están iluminados desde dentro do material, e cambian mentres os miras, amodo.","they are not cut. they are stamped, evenly, by something that was not a knife.":"non están cortados. están gravados, uniformemente, por algo que non era un coitelo.","they are not dead and they are not statues. they are breathing, slowly, a long way apart.":"non están mortos e non son estatuas. respiran, amodo, moi separados uns dos outros.","they are not in a hurry, which is the part that should worry you.":"non teñen présa, que é a parte que che debería preocupar.","they are not lying. that is what makes it difficult.":"non están mentindo. iso é o que o fai difícil.","they are not of anywhere near here. she says she has no use for them any more.":"non son de ningures preto de aquí. di que xa non lle serven para nada.","they are not stacked because one came after another. they are stacked because they all arrived, and then they all stopped.":"non están amoreados porque un chegou despois doutro. están amoreados porque todos chegaron, e logo todos pararon.","they are not statues. they are not switched on either.":"non son estatuas. tampouco están acesos.","they are polite in a way that suggests a great deal of practice at being new somewhere.":"son educados dun xeito que suxire moita práctica en ser novos nalgures.","they are quiet and they keep to themselves, and they do not eat much at all.":"están calados e manteñense á parte, e non comen case nada.","they are spaced evenly, and every so often one is set upright with a mark scratched into it.":"están espazados uniformemente, e de cando en vez un está de pé cunha marca gravada.","they are still going when the light goes. the two who came in do not go to the wall to look.":"aínda seguen cando se vai a luz. os dous que entraron non van ao muro a mirar.","they are tallies, in groups of five, in at least four different hands.":"son contos, en grupos de cinco, en polo menos catro letras diferentes.","they are told there is no room. it is not true.":"dilles que non hai sitio. non é certo.","they are too high, evenly, all the way along. whoever cut this was taller than anybody who has walked it since.":"están demasiado altos, uniformemente, todo o percorrido. quen tallou isto era máis alto que ninguén que o camiñase desde entón.","they are turned back at the bottom of the path.":"son rexeitados ao pé do camiño.","they are walked to the treeline and pointed away from the village.":"lévanos camiñando ata a liña de árbores e sinálanlles lonxe da vila.","they are wrapped in cloth that is not warm and was never meant to be. it is the wrong weight entirely.":"están envoltos nun pano que non abriga e nunca se pretendeu que o fixese. o peso está completamente equivocado.","they break and run once it turns. some of them are barely fighting at all.":"rómpense e corren en canto se volve. algúns deles apenas están loitando.","they come back before the month is out, and they bring more of themselves.":"volven antes de que remate o mes, e traen máis dos seus.","they decide against it":"deciden en contra","they did not fail. they were doing the hardest thing anybody on this rock ever managed and they were still doing it when the wars reached them.":"non fallaron. estaban a facer o máis difícil que ninguén nesta rocha conseguiu facer e aínda o estaban a facer cando as guerras os alcanzaron.","they do not argue. that is the part that stays with the people who watched.":"non discuten. esa é a parte que queda con quen o presenciou.","they do not become friends. they do become neighbours, which is harder and worth more.":"non se fan amigos. si se fan veciños, que é máis difícil e vale máis.","they do not believe it. they are given food and sent back to their post.":"non o cren. dánlles comida e mándanos de volta ao seu posto.","they do not burn like paper. they curl, and go grey, and stop.":"non arden coma papel. enrólanse, e vólvense grises, e paran.","they do not seem to know that.":"non parece que o saiban.","they give a unit designation and a rank. both belong to an army that has no one left to report to.":"dan unha designación de unidade e un rango. ambas as dúas pertencen a un exército ao que xa non lle queda ninguén a quen render contas.","they give a year, and a month, and the name of a harvest festival that was two weeks out when they left.":"dan un ano, e un mes, e o nome dun festival de colleita que estaba a dúas semanas cando marcharon.","they go back into the trees in opposite directions, still arguing.":"volven internarse nas árbores en direccións opostas, aínda discutindo.","they kept the man who signed things in the room where the expanse decided what correct meant. somebody chose that.":"mantiveron ao home que asinaba as cousas na sala onde a extensión decidía o que significaba correcto. alguén escolleu iso.","they knew what the ground was doing to them. they made the suit first and it was still not enough.":"sabían o que o chan lles estaba a facer. fixeron o traxe primeiro e aínda así non foi dabondo.","they know that. they go anyway.":"sábeno. van de todos os xeitos.","they move around you the way water moves around a rock, and with about as much interest.":"móvense arredor de ti do xeito en que a auga se move arredor dunha rocha, e con máis ou menos o mesmo interese.","they must be here for a reason.":"deben estar aquí por algunha razón.","they name a garrison, a supply line, and a commanding officer.":"nomean unha guarnición, unha liña de subministros, e un oficial ao mando.","they pause.":"fan unha pausa.","they put the one who makes things stand up in the last room the old world built to stay standing. somebody chose that too.":"puxeron ao que fai que as cousas se ergan na última sala que o vello mundo construíu para quedar en pé. alguén escolleu iso tamén.","they say the others are a long way from home and do not know it yet.":"din que os outros están moi lonxe da casa e aínda non o saben.","they say the others are liars. say the lamp is a trick, and that nothing like it exists.":"din que os outros son mentireiros. din que o candil é un truco, e que non existe nada semellante.","they say they have been out since the afternoon":"din que levan fóra desde a tardiña","they set up exactly the way people set up who have done this several times already.":"monta o campamento exactamente do xeito en que o monta xente que xa fixo isto varias veces.","they stop what they are doing, all of them, at the same moment.":"deixan o que están a facer, todos eles, no mesmo momento.","they take it and go":"cólleno e marchan","they take it and go, and they take their time going, and one of them looks back twice.":"cólleno e marchan, e márchanse con calma, e un deles mira atrás dúas veces.","they take no notice of the intrusion.":"non fan caso da intrusión.","they take the food, and they are grateful for it, and they keep walking.":"collen a comida, e están agradecidos por ela, e seguen camiñando.","they take the smallest hut without being offered it and do not come out of it much.":"collen a cabana máis pequena sen que lla ofrezan e non saen dela moito.","they talk it over at the bottom of the path for a long time, out of earshot.":"fálano ao pé do camiño durante moito tempo, fóra do alcance do oído.","they took what they came for, and left.":"colleron o que viñan buscar, e marcharon.","they were not measuring for the sake of it. an expanse that size only holds together if a part made at one end fits a machine at the other. this room is the reason any of it worked.":"non medían por medir. unha extensión dese tamaño só se mantén unida se unha peza feita nun extremo encaixa nunha máquina no outro. esta sala é o motivo polo que algo diso funcionou.","they will not share a fire. each says the other cannot possibly be here.":"non compartirán un lume. cada un di que o outro non pode estar aquí.","they will try again. they are very good at it and they have had a great deal of practice.<br>but whatever comes up out of that glass will not have been out here. it will not have carried this.":"tentarano de novo. son moi bos niso e tiveron moitísima práctica.<br>pero o que saia dese vidro non estivo aquí fóra. non levará isto.","they work without being asked and go quiet whenever anybody thanks them.":"traballan sen que llo pidan e quédanse calados sempre que alguén lles dá as grazas.","they would find the one road that ended in blood, and show it to somebody, and make it look like the only road there was. and then that person would walk it and believe the whole way that they had chosen.":"atoparían o único camiño que remataba en sangue, e amosaríanllo a alguén, e faríano parecer o único camiño que había. e logo esa persoa camiñaríao e crería todo o tempo que escollera.","thick, sticky webbing covers the walls of the corridor.":"unha tea espesa e pegañenta cobre os muros do corredor.","thieves":"ladróns","things unsaid":"cousas non ditas","this area has been overly sanitized as if to erase something foul.":"esta zona foi excesivamente esterilizada coma para borrar algo noxento.","this cell was repaired from the inside":"esta cela foi reparada desde dentro","this ground has been a cemetery for longer than anything above it has been standing.":"este terreo foi un cemiterio durante máis tempo do que nada por riba del leva en pé.","This is a fork and a re-imagining of the game with much more content, more story and more endings.":"Esta é unha bifurcación e unha reinterpretación do xogo con moito máis contido, máis historia e máis finais.","this is how it works. this is how it has always worked. you have died out there more times than the furnace log has pages, and every time, you have woken up in a dark room with no memory of it, and gone looking for wood.":"así é como funciona. así funcionou sempre. morriches aí fóra máis veces das que o rexistro do forno ten páxinas, e cada vez, espertaches nun cuarto escuro sen memoria diso, e fuches buscar madeira.","this is not weather. something out here is still running, and this is its exhaust.":"isto non é tempo atmosférico. algo aquí fóra aínda funciona, e isto é o seu escape.","this is the fifty-first.":"esta é a cincuenta e unha.","this old mine is not abandoned":"esta antiga mina non está abandonada","this one looks interesting.":"este parece interesante.","this one looks useful.":"este parece útil.","this one was built to keep everything else out. the shielding is on the inner face. the vents run one way. there is a seat, bolted down, facing a wall with nothing on it, and the wall is six feet thick.":"este construíuse para manter todo o demais fóra. o blindaxe está na cara interior. as ventilacións van nunha soa dirección. hai un asento, aparafusado, mirando cara a un muro sen nada nel, e o muro ten seis pés de grosor.","this one was not walked in. it was worked in.":"a este non se chegou camiñando. traballouse nel.","this one was waiting":"este estaba agardando","this room does not matter. this fire does not matter. escape is all that matters.":"esta sala non importa. este lume non importa. escapar é o único que importa.","this room has impossible star charts.":"esta sala ten mapas estelares imposibles.","this settlement will be in the register. it will have a note beside it.":"este asentamento estará no rexistro. terá unha nota ao seu carón.","this spear's not elegant, but it's pretty good at stabbing":"este puñal non é moi elegante, pero vai bastante ben para apuñalar","this test subject failed to yield results.":"este suxeito de proba non deu resultados.","this ward has been converted to a makeshift strategy room, maps scrawled hastily on any flat surface.":"esta ala converteuse nunha sala de estratexia improvisada, con mapas garabateados á présa en calquera superficie plana.","this waterskin'll hold a bit of water, at least":"este traxe de augas aguantará a auga un pouco polo menos","this wing is newer than the other two by an order of magnitude, and it is still very old.":"esta ala é máis nova cás outras dúas nunha orde de magnitude, e aínda así é moi vella.","this wing represents a simple shape that should be stable for failed for some reason.":"esta ala representa unha forma sinxela que debería ser estable pero fallou por algunha razón.","thornback hare":"lebre de lombo espiñento","thoughts":"pensamentos","thousands of faces turning at once toward a thing they have all just decided to hate.":"milleiros de caras virándose á vez cara a algo que todos acaban de decidir odiar.","threads":"fíos","three are brought in out of the wind":"tres son acollidos e apartados do vento","three eyes. three ears. no mouth.":"tres ollos. tres orellas. sen boca.","three lights come round the corner at head height, evenly spaced.":"tres luces xiran a esquina á altura da cabeza, espazadas uniformemente.","three names, and a fourth with a line through it, and under them a heading in a much older hand.":"tres nomes, e un cuarto riscado, e debaixo deles un encabezado cunha letra moito máis vella.","three of the four are strangers. the fourth is not.":"tres dos catro son descoñecidos. o cuarto non.","three of the four join the village":"tres dos catro únense á vila","three of them have something in. one of the three is still alive.":"tres deles teñen algo dentro. un dos tres aínda está vivo.","three of them rise out of the floor together.":"tres deles érguense do chan á vez.","three of them, at the treeline, and they have been watching long enough to have counted.":"tres deles, na liña de árbores, e levan observando tempo dabondo como para ter contado.","three sets of vats, and only one of them is a row":"tres conxuntos de cubas, e só un deles é unha fileira","three stones stand upright in a row, which is not how stones stand.":"tres pedras érguense en fileira, que non é como se erguen as pedras.","three ways, and a shape at the end of each":"tres camiños, e unha forma ao final de cada un","through the bulkhead is a large room, walls lined with weapon racks. fighting seems to have passed it by.":"a través do mamparo hai unha gran sala, con muros cheos de estantes de armas. parece que a loita a evitou.","through the large gymnasium doors, footsteps can be heard.":"detrás das grandes portas do ximnasio, óense pasos.","through the walls, shuffling noises can be heard.":"a través das paredes, óense ruídos esquivos.","through two layers of leather you can feel it doing something. not to your hand. further in.":"a través de dúas capas de coiro podes sentir que fai algo. non á túa man. máis adentro.","throw it out":"tiralo fóra","thrust":"estocada","time to get out of here.":"hora de saír de aquí.","time to get out of this place. won't be coming back.":"é hora de marchar daquí. para non volver.","time to move on.":"é hora de seguir adiante.","time to rejoin the other wanderers, alone no more.<br>the fleet knows the way home. nothing to do but wait.":"hora de reunirse cos outros andarilos, xa sen estar soa.<br>a flota coñece o camiño de volta. non hai nada que facer máis ca agardar.","tons of scattered teeth":"toneladas de dentes espallados","too many limbs, and none of them agree on how old they are.":"demasiados membros, e ningún deles concorda en canto vellos son.","tools for measurement, but only for one specific size.":"ferramentas de medición, pero só para un tamaño específico.","torch":"facho","total":"total","total score: {0}":"puntos totais: {0}","touch the crystal":"tocar o cristal","track them":"rastrexalas","trade with her":"comerciar con ela","trading post":"mercado","traitor. anathema. from this day he has no name but the exile, and will have no other, ever.":"traidor. anatema. desde este día non ten outro nome máis có exiliado, e non terá outro, nunca.","trap":"trampa","trapper":"trampeiro","traps are more effective with bait.":"as trampas son máis efectivas con cebo.","treader":"pisador","trees loom on the horizon. grasses gradually yield to a forest floor of dry branches and fallen leaves.":"as árbores álzanse no horizonte. a herba vaise convertindo nun bosque cuberto de pólas secas e follas caídas.","trees no longer block your vision. the road leads back to the village.":"as árbores xa non bloquean a túa visión. a estrada leva de volta á vila.","trench sentry":"centinela de trincheira","triad":"tríade","tripped a motion sensor.":"activou un sensor de movemento.","troops storm the village":"as tropas asaltan a aldea","Troposphere":"Troposfera","try again":"tentar de novo","try the climb again":"tentar a escalada de novo","try to wake one":"tentar espertar un","trying to carve out some semblence of civilization amongst the unforgiving wastes. builder says she could make finer things, if she had the tools":"tentando tallar unha aparencia de civilización entre os ermos implacables. a construtora di que podería facer cousas máis finas, se tivese as ferramentas","tumblr":"tumblr","turn back":"dar a volta","turn back rather than face an infinity of no meaning.":"dar a volta en vez de afrontar unha infinitude sen sentido.","turn both away":"rexeitar aos dous","turn her away":"botala","turn him away":"botalo","turn the survivors out":"botar aos supervivintes","turn them back":"facelos volver","turning hardcore mode on slows down the game by x2 speed and makes all enemies x2 stronger. do you want to do that?":"activar o modo difícil reduce a velocidade do xogo á metade e fai que todos os inimigos sexan o dobre de fortes. queres facer iso?","turning hyper mode speeds up the game to x2 speed. do you want to do that?":"se prendes o modo hyper a velocidade do xogo subirá a x2. queres facer isto?","twenty minutes, no drama, and the pack never so much as shifts.":"vinte minutos, sen drama, e a mochila nin sequera se move.","twitter":"twitter","two are killed. the others break off, unhurried, and are gone before anyone can follow.":"dous son mortos. os outros retíranse, sen présa, e desaparecen antes de que ninguén poida seguilos.","two bedrolls are wedged into a corner.":"dous sacos de durmir están encaixados nun recuncho.","Two Camps":"Dous Campamentos","two come in. two do not":"dous entran. dous non","two feet in, the spoil starts to burn where it touches skin, and the burn does not stop when it is brushed off.":"a dous pés de distancia, o refugallo comeza a queimar onde toca a pel, e a queimadura non para cando se sacode.","two groups arrive, and will not share a fire":"chegan dous grupos, e non compartirán lume","two groups come out of the trees within an hour of each other, from opposite directions.":"dous grupos saen das árbores cunha hora de diferenza, desde direccións opostas.","two hundred years of orders, all of them withdrawals":"douscentos anos de ordes, todas elas retiradas","two of them are dragged out of the mud, disarmed.":"dous deles son arrastrados fóra da lama, desarmados.","two of them are still alive":"dous deles aínda están vivos","two of them come down the corridor abreast, in step.":"dous deles baixan polo corredor lado a lado, ao paso.","two pieces of alloy, out of a thing that was working, in a place that was working, in the one settlement on this world where four peoples agreed on anything.":"dous anacos de aliaxe, dunha cousa que funcionaba, nun lugar que funcionaba, no único asentamento deste mundo onde catro pobos se puxeron de acordo en algo.","Two Sets of Prints":"Dous Conxuntos de Pegadas","two sets of prints. one fire. no fence, no huts, nobody else coming.":"dous conxuntos de pegadas. un lume. sen valado, sen cabanas, ninguén máis vindo.","two-headed creature":"criatura bicéfala","uber trap":"supertrampa","uber traps leverage wanderer technology to catch more important resources":"as supertrampas aproveitan a tecnoloxía dos andarilos para capturar recursos máis importantes","unarmed master":"master desarmado","under it, not scratched out: I COUNTERSIGNED. and beneath that, later, in a steadier hand: I WOULD AGAIN, WHICH IS THE PART THAT MATTERS.":"debaixo, sen riscar: EU CONTRAASINEI. e por baixo diso, máis tarde, cunha letra máis firme: VOLTARÍAO A FACER, QUE É A PARTE QUE IMPORTA.","under the floor plates there is a cache the drone was standing on: not instruments. plans.":"baixo as placas do chan hai unha reserva sobre a que estaba o dron: non instrumentos. planos.","under the hull there is no body. there is a cavity, shaped for something, and the shape is empty.":"baixo o casco non hai corpo. hai unha cavidade, con forma para algo, e a forma está baleira.","under the translation, in the margin, somebody has written a single word in a hand that is not narrow and not even.":"baixo a tradución, na marxe, alguén escribiu unha soa palabra cunha letra que non é estreita nin uniforme.","under where the cup was sitting there is a flat stone with a scratch on it.":"baixo onde repousaba a cunca hai unha pedra chan cunha marca nela.","Underground Ruins":"Ruínas Subterráneas","Underground&nbsp;Ruins":"Ruínas&nbsp;Subterráneas","unfold what is left of their kit":"despregar o que queda do seu equipo","unlatching":"desenganchando","unlit":"sen acender","unlit one":"un sen acender","unmaking":"desfacendo","unruly welder":"soldador rebelde","unsealing":"desselando","unseen workers must be keeping this operation going":"traballadores invisibles deben estar mantendo esta operación en marcha","unstable automaton":"autómata inestable","unstable prototype":"prototipo inestable","Update":"Actualizar","upgrade engine":"mellorar motor","use hypo":"usar a xeringa","use machine":"usar a máquina","use medicine on it":"usar menciña nel","use meds":"usar menciñas","use shield":"usar o escudo","use stim":"usar o estimulante","use the knife":"usar o coitelo","use with rifle":"usar co rifle","vague shapes move, just out of sight.":"unhas formas vagas móvense, non están á vista.","vats. rows of them, lit from within, each one at a different stage.":"cubas. fileiras delas, iluminadas por dentro, cada unha nunha fase diferente.","venom":"veleno","venomous":"velenoso","venomous beast":"besta velenosa","Venomous Beast":"Besta Velenosa","venting":"ventexando","vents open":"as ventilacións ábrense","village":"aldea","villager":"veciño","villagers":"veciñanza","wagon":"carro","wait":"agardar","wait and listen":"agardar e escoitar","wait for dark":"agardar a que escureza","wait for light":"agardar a que amenza","wait for whoever walks it":"agardar a quen o camiñe","wait it out":"agardar a que pase","wake her":"espertala","walk a little way along the sightline":"camiñar un anaco ao longo da liña de visión","walk any distance without losing food and water":"camiñar calquera distancia sen perder comida e auga","walk at night":"camiñar pola noite","walk on":"seguir camiñando","walk the hall":"percorrer o corredor","walk through it":"atravesalo camiñando","walking back the way you came puts you at the junction again from a different direction.":"volver polo mesmo camiño polo que chegaches déixate de novo no cruzamento pero desde outra dirección.","walking it, the circle is perfect. it does not wander by a single pace over that distance.":"percorréndoo, o círculo é perfecto. non se desvía nin un só paso en toda esa distancia.","walking works until the ground stops cooperating, and then it works against you.":"camiñar funciona ata que o chan deixa de cooperar, e logo funciona en contra túa.","walking works, as long as it does not stop.":"camiñar funciona, mentres non pare.","Wanderer":"Errante","wanderer empire":"imperio de andarilos","wanderer form, but not quite flesh. not quite metal either. a crystal set into its chest pulses with light.":"forma de andarilo, pero non do todo carne. tampouco do todo metal. un cristal incrustado no seu peito pulsa con luz.","wanderer soldiers succeed by subverting the enemy's rage.":"os soldados andarilos triunfan subvertendo a ira do inimigo.","wanderers make deadly and efficient weapons.":"os andarilos fan armas mortais e eficientes.","ward":"ala","warded":"protexido","warden construct":"construto gardián","warden echo":"eco de gardián","warm":"quente","was it worth it":"mereceu a pena","watch what happens to the two below":"observar o que lles pasa aos dous de abaixo","water":"auga","water is needed to survive while exploring the wilds. a cask can only hold so much. builder suggests crafting a water tank to really explore the wilds.":"precísase auga para sobrevivir mentres se explora as terras salvaxes. un barril só pode conter certa cantidade. a construtora suxire fabricar un tanque de auga para explorar de verdade as terras salvaxes.","water is needed to survive while exploring the wilds. a waterskin can only hold so much. builder suggests crafting a cask to safely explore further.":"precísase auga para sobrevivir mentres se explora as terras salvaxes. un odre só pode conter certa cantidade. a construtora suxire fabricar un barril para explorar máis lonxe con seguridade.","water is needed to survive while exploring the wilds. builder suggests crafting a waterskin to safely explore the wilds.":"precísase auga para sobrevivir mentres se explora as terras salvaxes. a construtora suxire fabricar un odre para explorar con seguridade as terras salvaxes.","water out, water in. waste not, want not.":"auga fóra, auga dentro. non desperdiciar, non pasar necesidade.","water replenished":"auga reposta","water tank":"tanque de auga","water:{0}":"auga:{0}","waterskin":"traxe de augas","weakness is a liabity, especially out here.":"a debilidade é unha carga, especialmente aquí fóra.","weapons":"armas","weapons are strewn about the medical dispatch bay. must have been used as a muster point.":"armas están espalladas pola baía de despacho médico. debeu usarse como punto de reunión.","weeks later a bundle is left at the wall. ammunition, and a hand-drawn map of where not to go.":"semanas despois déixase un feixe no muro. munición, e un mapa debuxado a man de onde non ir.","weeping barbs":"espiñas choronas","weight":"peso","what comes off it is not what was underneath.":"o que sae del non é o que había debaixo.","what did the builder not want you to find down here?":"que non quería a construtora que atopases aquí abaixo?","what finally stops it is not a weapon. it is the thing inside it giving out.":"o que finalmente o para non é unha arma. é a cousa dentro del cedendo.","what gets built after this gets built differently, and nobody calls them wanderers any more.":"o que se constrúe despois disto constrúese de forma diferente, e xa ninguén os chama andarilos.","what goes into it goes back out of the door, to whoever comes up the road next with nothing.":"o que entra nel volve saír pola porta, para quen suba a seguir pola estrada sen nada.","what he does do is take hold of a wrist, without opening his eyes, and hold on for a long time.":"o que si fai é agarrar un pulso, sen abrir os ollos, e aguantar durante moito tempo.","what he was carrying was portioned out for somebody smaller than him":"o que cargaba estaba porcionado para alguén máis pequeno ca el","what is at the end of the furrow is a hull, split open along its length, and it is not from here.":"o que hai ao final do sulco é un casco, partido ao longo, e non é de aquí.","what is coming is not rain. it is the crater, in the air, moving at the speed of the wind.":"o que se achega non é choiva. é o cráter, no aire, movéndose á velocidade do vento.","what is in it has not moved in a very long time and is still drawing power.":"o que hai dentro non se moveu en moitísimo tempo e aínda consome enerxía.","what is in the pack has taken it up. it does not smell of anything, which is worse.":"o que hai na mochila absorbeuno. non cheira a nada, o que é peor.","what is left of both groups leaves in the same direction, separately.":"o que queda dos dous grupos marcha na mesma dirección, por separado.","what is ruined: {0}.":"o que se estragou: {0}.","what is taken is not worth what it cost to take.":"o que se colle non vale o que custou collelo.","what is this room? what is this fire?":"que é esta sala? que é este lume?","what is underneath is not rock. it is laid in courses, and it goes down.":"o que hai debaixo non é rocha. está colocado en fiadas, e baixa.","what made this shadow persist? is it gone now?":"que fixo que esta sombra persistise? xa desapareceu?","what prison did this convict escape from?":"de que cárcere escapou este condenado?","what the village throws away goes in one end. what it needs comes out the other.":"o que a vila tira vai por un extremo. o que precisa sae polo outro.","what they did was talk. they were the best anyone had ever met at it, and they were a telepath, and they could see the roads a thing might go down before anybody set out on any of them.":"o que facían era falar. eran os mellores que ninguén coñecera niso, e eran telépatas, e podían ver os camiños que algo podería tomar antes de que ninguén se puxese en marcha por ningún deles.","whatever comes out of the vats and fails the assay goes in here, and the machine has been very busy.":"todo o que sae das cubas e falla o ensaio vén aquí, e a máquina estivo moi ocupada.","whatever he was waiting for, it did not arrive, and he has been walking ever since.":"sexa o que sexa o que agardaba, non chegou, e leva camiñando desde entón.","whatever he was waiting for, it did not arrive. he has been walking ever since, and he has been keeping a list.":"sexa o que sexa o que agardaba, non chegou. leva camiñando desde entón, e leva levando unha lista.","whatever it is, it is what the storm is going around. the storm has been going around it for a very long time.":"sexa o que sexa, é o que a tormenta está a rodear. a tormenta leva rodeándoo moitísimo tempo.","whatever left it is still close enough to be watching, and is not coming in.":"sexa o que sexa o que o deixou, aínda está preto dabondo para observar, e non se achega.","whatever supplies the rest of it does not reach this far, or was told not to.":"sexa o que sexa o que abastece o resto diso non chega ata aquí, ou dixéronlle que non o fixese.","whatever they are facing, none of them was willing to go past here, and all of them agreed on where here was.":"sexa o que sexa ao que se enfrontan, ningún deles estivo disposto a ir máis alá de aquí, e todos concordaron en onde estaba aquí.","whatever this is, it was not built to be opened from outside. it was built so that opening it would have to be a decision somebody made from within.":"sexa o que sexa isto, non se construíu para abrirse desde fóra. construíuse para que abrilo tivese que ser unha decisión tomada por alguén desde dentro.","whatsapp":"whatsapp","when all resources go to war":"cando todos os recursos van á guerra","when in doubt, high explosives.":"en caso de dúbida, explosivos potentes.","when it passes, everything that was standing is polished on one side.":"cando pasa, todo o que estaba de pé queda pulido nun lado.","when you incite an angry mob.":"cando incitas unha multitude enfurecida.","when you say there is someone keeping the fire, he nods, and looks away, and takes a while.":"cando dis que hai alguén atendendo o lume, el asente, e aparta a mirada, e tarda un anaco.","where the windows of the schoolhouse aren't shattered, they're blackened with soot.":"as ventás da escola que non están esnaquizadas, están ennegrecidas pola feluxe.","who is this Profane that they worshiped?":"quen é este Profano ao que adoraban?","who will hunt the beasts?":"quen cazará as bestas?","whoever built this place and whoever built those did not merely know each other. they were the same.":"quen construíu este lugar e quen construíu aqueles non se coñecían simplemente. eran os mesmos.","whoever comes back to it will have walked a long way for nothing.":"quen volva a el terá camiñado moito para nada.","whoever kept it got this far out, made it permanent, and then at some point stopped keeping it.":"quen o levaba chegou ata aquí, fíxoo permanente, e logo nalgún momento deixou de levalo.","whoever set them is not here, and has not been for a day or two, judging by the other two.":"quen os colocou non está aquí, e non o estivo durante un día ou dous, a xulgar polos outros dous.","whoever set them was walking out, stopping, and coming back. over and over.":"quen os colocou estivo saíndo, parando, e volvendo. unha e outra vez.","whoever was held here took the cell apart and put it back together better. the bunk is reseated. the vent has been rebuilt and it draws properly now. there is a bracket in the corner that is not standard issue and is doing a job the original design got wrong.":"quen foi retido aquí desmontou a cela e volveuna montar mellor. o catre está reasentado. a ventilación foi reconstruída e agora tira ben. hai un soporte no recuncho que non é de fábrica e que fai un traballo que o deseño orixinal fixo mal.","wild beasts attack the {0}":"bestas salvaxes atacan a {0}","wild swings":"golpes salvaxes","will this fire die out if you manage to escape?":"apagarase este lume se consegues escapar?","willing to talk about it, for a price.":"está disposta a falar do tema, por un prezo.","winds up":"énchese de corda","wings in your face":"ás na túa cara","wires run overhead, corroded and useless.":"fíos pasan por riba, corroídos e inútiles.","with a little effort, it might fly again.":"con pouco esforzo, podería voar de novo.","with nothing left standing over it, the mount finally comes apart the way it should have the first time.":"sen nada máis por riba, a montura finalmente desfaise do xeito en que debería telo feito a primeira vez.","within a month there is a new line, a little further along, in the same hand.":"antes dun mes hai unha nova liña, un pouco máis adiante, coa mesma letra.","won't say from where he came, but it's clear that he's not staying.":"non di de onde vén, pero está claro que non vai quedar.","wood":"leña","word comes in from the {0} before the sound does.":"a noticia chega desde a {0} antes có son.","word of this will reach wherever he came from.":"a noticia disto chegará a onde sexa que el viñese.","wordpress":"wordpress","work it":"traballalo","workshop":"taller","workshop's finally ready. builder's excited to get to it":"o taller xa está listo. a construtora está encantada","worlds going quiet one after another, from orbit, patiently, in a fixed order.":"mundos quedando en silencio un tras outro, desde a órbita, con paciencia, nunha orde fixa.","worth killing for, it seems.":"parece que paga a pena matar por el.","write the name down":"anotar o nome","wrong ampoule":"ampola equivocada","yes":"si","you are getting better at this.<br>you are not sure that is the same thing as getting free of it.":"estás mellorando niso.<br>non estás segura de que iso sexa o mesmo que liberarte diso.","you are not good at any of it and she watches you be bad at it with visible restraint.":"non es boa en nada diso e ela obsérvache facelo mal con contención visible.","you are standing where you are standing now. the room is the same room. it is lit the same way.":"estás onde estás agora mesmo. a sala é a mesma sala. está iluminada do mesmo xeito.","you come out the other side with less skin than you went in with.":"saes polo outro lado con menos pel da que tiñas ao entrar.","you could backtrack and climb out this very moment.":"poderías dar a volta e saír escalando neste mesmo intre.","you do not know what would open this. you do not know anybody who would.":"non sabes que abriría isto. non coñeces a ninguén que o soubese.","you do not remember being here. you do not remember any of the sixty-one.":"non lembras ter estado aquí. non lembras ningunha das sesenta e unha veces.","you do not remember writing any of them, and you have just written another.":"non lembras ter escrito ningunha delas, e acabas de escribir outra.","you find that you are not prepared for this version of you to die.<br>you have never once minded before.":"descobres que non estás preparada para que esta versión de ti morra.<br>nunca antes che importara.","you get the gloves out of the pack without deciding to. you have handled every other one of these barehanded and you are not going to handle this one barehanded and you could not tell anybody why.":"sacas os guantes da mochila sen decidilo. manexaches todos os demais destes a manciñas e non vas manexar este a manciñas e non poderías dicirlle a ninguén por que.","you have been walking level the whole time. you are no longer sure.":"levas camiñando en chan todo o tempo. xa non estás segura.","you have done this quickly. quicker than last time, and last time was quicker than the one before.":"fixeches isto rápido. máis rápido cá última vez, e a última vez foi máis rápida cá anterior.","you have frequently looted your own kills. the living had more need of these things than the dead.":"saqueaches con frecuencia as túas propias mortes. os vivos precisaban máis destas cousas cós mortos.","you have made that mark. you make it without thinking, on things you want to find again.":"fixeches esa marca. fáola sen pensar, en cousas que queres volver atopar.","you have never been here, and the scratch has been under that stone longer than the village has stood.":"nunca estiveches aquí, e a marca leva baixo esa pedra máis tempo do que a vila leva en pé.","you have never felt so alone...":"nunca te sentiches tan soa...","you have never seen this book before.":"nunca viras este libro antes.","you have not died once. not this time.":"non morriches nin unha soa vez. non esta vez.","you have seen that before. you know exactly where.":"xa viches iso antes. sabes exactamente onde.","you keep ducking for a ceiling that is higher than it looks.":"segues agachándote para un teito que é máis alto do que parece.","you know the letters. you have never cut them into anything.":"coñeces as letras. nunca as gravaches en nada.","you know this creature is not of this world.":"sabes que esta criatura non é deste mundo.","you lift it. you know the name. you have never once written it down.":"levántalo. sabes o nome. nunca o escribiches nin unha soa vez.","you long for the warm fire in your room.":"anhelas o lume quente do teu cuarto.","you may observe your fate":"podes observar o teu destino","you move forward but a sphere has no end.":"avanzas pero unha esfera non ten fin.","you put it down. you do not put it away.<br>the fleet goes on climbing.":"déixalo. non o gardas.<br>a flota segue ascendendo.","you put it in the bottom of the pack, under everything, and you do not touch it again.":"mételo no fondo da mochila, baixo todo o demais, e non o volves tocar.","you see a symbol they bear, somehow knowing it to represent The Profane.":"ves un símbolo que levan, e dalgún xeito sabes que representa Ao Profano.","you see modern repairs in this ancient structure.":"ves reparacións modernas nesta estrutura ancestral.","you see what they saw.":"ves o que eles viron.","you see what they saw. it is exactly as impossible as it was the first time.<br>and it is exactly as true.":"ves o que eles viron. é exactamente tan imposible como a primeira vez.<br>e é exactamente tan certo.","you send this beast back from whence it came.":"mandas esta besta de volta a onde viñese.","you should know how to do this. you are certain you should know how to do this.<br>nothing comes. you stand there and you are no use to her at all.":"deberías saber facer isto. estás segura de que deberías saber facer isto.<br>non che chega nada. quedas alí de pé e non lle serves de nada.","you stand in the light where the shape of you is unambiguous, and you do not say anything.":"quedas de pé na luz onde a túa forma é inequívoca, e non dis nada.","you stand there with both palms flat on stone that has no markings on it, and you know -- the way you know your own name, which you do not -- that this is wrong. that it is supposed to be six. that it was never a lock at all, only a thing that could not be done alone.":"quedas alí coas dúas palmas planas sobre pedra sen marcas, e sabes -- do xeito en que sabes o teu propio nome, que non sabes -- que isto está mal. que se supón que son seis. que nunca foi unha pechadura, só unha cousa que non se podía facer soa.","you take it with gloves on":"cóllelo cos guantes postos","you take the gloves off.":"quítaste os guantes.","you wake from that nightmare in a dark room...":"espertas dese pesadelo nun cuarto escuro...","you walk the whole face of it twice. there is nothing here to try.":"percorres toda a súa cara dúas veces. non hai nada aquí que tentar.","you will not open that door. not this time. you gave her your word and she came a very long way for it.":"non abrirás esa porta. non esta vez. déchelle a túa palabra e ela viaxou moi lonxe por ela.","your hands go up before you have decided to raise them.":"as túas mans érguense antes de que decidas erguelas.","your minds touch again. feeling a pang. it isn't the usual constant hunger. it is a pang of guilt.":"as vosas mentes tócanse de novo. sentindo unha punzada. non é a fame constante habitual. é unha punzada de culpa.","your minds touch again. her memories are guarded but suddenly aware how few memories you have. unable to remember anything before this dark, cold room.":"as vosas mentes tócanse de novo. os seus recordos están protexidos pero de súpeto conscientes de cantos poucos recordos tes ti. incapaz de lembrar nada antes deste cuarto escuro e frío.","your minds touch again. knowing there are other wanderers out there, though far fewer than before.":"as vosas mentes tócanse de novo. sabendo que hai outros andarilos aí fóra, aínda que moitos menos ca antes.","your minds touch again. she recalls a battle under a blood-red sky. somehow you know you where there but don't remember. did you choose not to remember or are you not meant to remember?":"as vosas mentes tócanse de novo. ela lembra unha batalla baixo un ceo vermello sangue. dalgún xeito sabes que estabas alí pero non o lembras. escolliches non lembralo ou non se supón que o lembres?","your minds touch again. somehow both remembering stars in the deep, dark sky.":"as vosas mentes tócanse de novo. dalgún xeito ambas lembrando estrelas no ceo profundo e escuro.","your own footsteps come back to you from the wrong direction.":"os teus propios pasos vólvenche desde a dirección equivocada.","ⰑⰖⰔⱂⰃⰠ2ⰉⰉ Ⱀⱂ ⰄⰀ ⰒⰑⰆⰉ me2Ⱐ ⰄⰀ ⰂⰉⰄⰉ2Ⱐ ⰍⰑⰐⰠⰜⰠ ⰉⰆⰅ ⰔⰠⰄⰡⱂⰞⰨ":"ⰑⰖⰔⱂⰃⰠ2ⰉⰉ Ⱀⱂ ⰄⰀ ⰒⰑⰆⰉ me2Ⱐ ⰄⰀ ⰂⰉⰄⰉ2Ⱐ ⰍⰑⰐⰠⰜⰠ ⰉⰆⰅ ⰔⰠⰄⰡⱂⰞⰨ"});
